window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4601,"title":"Chapter 4601: Food Reserve (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4601: Food Reserve (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","In order to recover its strength as soon as possible, it followed behind Huang Yueli and Li Moying as they quietly entered the palace.","It was really too small and translucent. Adding on to the fact that Huang Yueli and the rest’s attention had always been on the Empyrean Devil Crystal, they didn’t notice its existence.","Later on, Huang Yueli was thrown out of King Xiang’s illusion and the Empyrean Devil Crystal also fell onto the ground.","Huang Yueli was momentarily dizzy and Li Moying only cared about checking on her injuries so the Extreme Frost Giant Eye Octopus immediately realised that its chance...was here!","It immediately pounced at the box containing the Empyrean Devil Crystal and wrapped itself around the lid. It used all its remaining strength to drag the box away.","It was a beast that could only grow by absorbing Devil Qi. If it could obtain the Empyrean Devil Crystal, it would definitely be a blessing in disguise!","Not only would he be able to recover his strength in an extremely short period of time, but he might also be able to complete his evolution under the stimulation of such dense Devil Qi. His strength would further increase and surpass his original realm!","The Giant Eye Octopus was already thinking about how to show off its might after it had succeeded in its cultivation in the future and left the deep cold pool to return to the Divine World...","But at this moment, following Li Moying’s stern shout, its whereabouts were exposed.","But after a few breaths, it became Huang Yueli’s...Food reserves.","It was really sad to smell it and tears to see it.","Huang Yueli looked at the trembling little thing in front of her and found it hard to believe.","She turned around to look at Li Moying who was beside her,” Husband, this little thing said that it’s the Extreme Frost Giant Eye Octopus? This... Was that even possible? Such a huge ferocious beast is only this small in its infancy?”","Li Moying frowned slightly,” Logically speaking, this is indeed not very possible...’","Before he could finish, the Giant Eye Octopus shrieked in horror again.” How is it impossible? Of course it was possible, because this...This was real! You are the God Clan, of course you don’t know what our Devil Clan’s fierce beasts look like! The stronger the spirit beast was, the fewer children it would give birth to. In fact, it would only give birth to one every few hundred years. Each of them was very powerful, but...But we are different!”","“Oh? How is it different?” Huang Yueli raised her brows as she asked noncommittally.","“The stronger the beasts of our Devil Clan are, the more offspring they give birth to. However, their strength is not strong! For example, when I was born, I had at least a few thousand siblings. However, in the process of growing up, we competed with each other and devoured each other. Only by eating our siblings could we increase our strength and break through step by step to become an adult! I... I ate thousands of brothers and sisters to become like that!”","The Giant Eye Octopus didn’t want to reveal its identity at first, for fear of arousing the resentment of the warriors of the God Clan.","But Huang Yueli was really too terrifying.","That green-eyed appearance was actually even more terrifying than the most brutal ferocious beast of their Devil Clan!","It had no doubt that as long as its answer was slightly wrong, it would become a dish on Huang Yueli’s plate, and it would be the kind of snack that was not even enough to fill the gaps between her teeth.","Therefore, it had no choice but to reveal all its secrets.","It was deeply aware that facing Huang Yueli, only by being extremely honest, could it have a tiny bit of hope to escape the fate of being cooked.."]},{"number":4602,"title":"Chapter 4602: Food Reserve (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4602: Food Reserve (7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hearing the explanation of the Extreme Frost Giant Eye Octopus, Li Moying’s eyes flashed with a flash of realization.","He pondered for a moment.” I see...ln that case, this little thing is really the Giant Eye Octopus.”","Huang Yueli pursed her lips,” Husband, you actually believed it so easily? This little thing might have been made up! What brothers and sisters devouring each other? How could there be such a ferocious Devil in the world? I think it’s fake, right? Forget it, I can’t be bothered to care so much. Who cares what breed it is? Just roast it!”","“No, no, no, I’m telling the truth!”","It was about to cry. A layer of faint water droplets appeared on its smooth surface.","Only the heavens knew why this girl from the God Clan was so difficult to deal with!","If he lied, he would be barbecued. If he told the truth, he would still be barbecued!","Just as it was in despair, Li Moying’s voice rang out at the right moment, saving its life.","“Li ‘er, I feel that what this little thing said should be true. That’s because it should be the Extreme Frost Giant Eye Octopus that I fought with before. Look","here...’","Li Moying said as he took the little thing from Huang Yueli’s hands.","The Extreme Frost Giant Eye Octopus felt that it had escaped the Devilic claws of the Female Devil. Before it could breathe a sigh of relief, it felt an even stronger pressure enveloping its entire body. Instantly, its body seemed to be frozen, and it did not dare to move.","Li Moying stretched out his slender finger and poked it on its body,” See this? This scar should be caused by my lightning earlier. It’s because its body has shrunk and it looks much shorter...And here, look at the bottom of its round body. These few small bumps shouldn’t be crooked or moldy. These should be the embryonic form of its eight limbs...”","The Extreme Frost Giant Eye Octopus’s brain twitched.","Damn it, it was crooked and moldy. Those were its most beautiful, most powerful, and most terrifying limbs!","What kind of taste did this brat of the God Clan have? Did he have any sense of aesthetics?","However, no matter how furious it was in its heart, its body didn’t dare to move at all. Even though Li Moying poked its body a few times, it didn’t dare to make a sound.","When Huang Yueli heard that, she immediately went to her husband’s side and started to observe carefully.","After a long while, she nodded and said,”Husband, what you said is very reasonable. These really seem to be those eight limbs.” In that case, we should indeed adopt this little thing and let it grow up a little...’","Upon hearing this, the Giant Eye Octopus was pleasantly surprised.","It knew that its strength was publicly recognized by the ordinary world. As long as these two little ghosts of the god clan knew its origin and strength, they would definitely worship it!",". If I grow up a little, these eight limbs will grow out. Otherwise, it’s too boring to just eat octopus. I still prefer octopus tentacles. They’re delicious! Husband, when it grows up a little, I will make you Braised Octopus to eat. This is a famous dish that I learned when I was in Soaring Heavens Continent!” Hearing Huang Yueli’s words, it almost fainted on the spot.","It hurriedly raised its head to take a look and realised that Huang Yueli wasn’t even looking at it directly, but was instead exchanging glances with Li Moying affectionately. Looking at this stance, no one took it seriously at all.","It seriously suspected that as long as Li Moying gave a nod, it would immediately go to the dining table!"]},{"number":4603,"title":"Chapter 4603: Food Reserve (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4603: Food Reserve (8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“No, I... You can’t eat me. I’m not delicious. I’m really, really not delicious! And I’m poisonous. If you eat me, you’ll be poisoned! I’m a ferocious beast of the Devil Clan. If you, from the God Clan eats me and accumulate too much Devil Qi in your body. Really... People will really die!”","The Giant Eye Octopus racked its brains and suddenly thought of a reason to avoid being eaten. It immediately shouted.","Hearing this, Huang Yueli was slightly startled.","It had to be said that the reason that the Giant Eye Octopus had found was quite convincing.","To ordinary God Clan, eating the Extreme Frost Giant Eye Octopus definitely wouldn’t have a good ending. As she and Li Moying had cultivated an evil cultivation method, it wasn’t very possible for them to go berserk but the possibility of having a stomachache still existed..","Seeing Huang Yueli’s hesitation, the Giant Eye Octopus started to shout loudly once again, publicizing its own capabilities, even swearing to the heavens and the sun that it would pledge allegiance to Huang Yueli and risk its life for her.","As Huang Yueli listened, she suddenly gave a cold laugh: ” Alright, stop putting on an act here. Do you think I don’t know? Didn’t you come for the Empyrean Devil Crystal? Do you really think I’m stupid enough to keep you by my side and wait for you to recover your strength before taking revenge on me?” The octopus froze.","It had never expected that its motive had been seen through by Huang Yueli!","It wholeheartedly wanted Huang Yueli to take it in as a servant, not only for the sake of escaping, but at the same time, it was also coveting that piece of Empyrean Devil Crystal in Huang Yueli’s hands.","As long as it had the Empyrean Devil Crystal, it would be able to recover its strength very quickly, and it was very likely that it would improve even further.","To a ferocious beast like it, this was a huge opportunity. It could not let it go easily.","Moreover, even if it acknowledged Huang Yueli as its master, it didn’t feel that there would be any problems or any impact on it.","This was because it was a ferocious beast from ancient times. Only a Devil Clan ancient cultivator could truly subdue it by using Devil Qi as a medium, supplemented by the Devil Clan’s contract seal technique.","For a god like Huang Yueli, using the God Clan’s method to form a contract with it, it couldn’t be said to be completely ineffective but it could only have a slight restraining effect.","Now it was still in its infant form so it might have no choice but to listen to Huang Yueli’s orders. But as long as it broke through to the adult form, it would be able to easily break free from this contract and if it wanted to kill Huang Yueli and Li Moying for revenge, there wouldn’t be any obstruction!","The Extreme Frost Giant Eye Octopus had such self-confidence and bullied Huang Yueli and Li Moying because they were young so they probably didn’t know the tricks behind this so they dared to take the risk to deceive the two of them.","Who knew that Huang Yueli actually didn’t reveal anything and directly","exposed it.","The Giant Eye Octopus froze for a long time before it laughed dryly. “Why would you think that? How could I...Why would I take revenge on you? As for the Empyrean Devil Crystal, I naturally need it to cultivate, but isn’t it also to serve master better? I...","“Cut the crap. I’ve seen through all your thoughts. However, I will still sign a contract with you!”","Just as the Giant Eye Octopus was in complete despair, Huang Yueli suddenly changed the topic.","The little thing turned her head in shock and looked at Huang Yueli,” You...","You..","Huang Yueli gave a slight smile,” I’ve just learnt the Devil Clan’s contract seal technique from the notes left behind by King Xiang and was just thinking of finding a fierce beast to try it out.. Consider yourself lucky! If you didn’t look so delicious, I wouldn’t have considered it!”"]},{"number":4604,"title":"Chapter 4604: Food Reserve (9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4604: Food Reserve (9)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When the Extreme Frost Giant Eye Octopus heard Huang Yueli’s words, its eight eyes rolled back as it almost fainted on the spot.","Initially, it thought that Huang Yueli wasn’t prepared to kill it on the spot because she was planning to let it go.","Who knew that Huang Yueli had actually grasped the Devil Clan’s contract seal technique and even planned to use this method to sign a contract with it!","This was not a joke. If it really signed this contract, it would forever be the slave of this damned girl from the God Clan in front of it, and it would never be able to turn over a new leaf!","Furthermore, what made it feel even more chilly was that Huang Yueli had said that she had contracted with it because it looked ‘very delicious’!","This... What kind of description was this?","Thinking of how Huang Yueli had drooled at it earlier, the little thing felt a chill rising from the bottom of its heart.","“Master... Master, you’re really... you have really good taste, but... But I really can’t be eaten... I... I’ll take care of the house for you...”","The Giant Eye Octopus was now a pitiful little thing shivering in fear.","No one would dare to believe that an ancient ferocious beast like it would act in such a manner in front of this young couple from the God Clan.","However, this was the truth. The situation was stronger than the person.","The last trump card of the Extreme Frost Giant Eye Octopus had been torn apart by Huang Yueli and now, it really couldn’t jump around anymore.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying exchanged a glance as she lifted her chin and said reluctantly,” Alright then. Seeing how pitiful you sound, let’s contract it first as reserve food. I don’t lack food for a while now. If your performance is as good as you say, I can consider letting you guard the house. If you dare to disobey my orders...’","Huang Yueli’s voice was extremely sweet and pleasant to the ears and her speed of speech was neither fast nor slow, making one feel extremely comfortable listening to it.","However, the Giant Eye Octopus was shivering.","Other than Braised Octopus, I also like to barbecue octopus tentacles, stir-fry octopus with pickled vegetables, and stewed octopus in chicken soup... When you grow up, you should be able to cook so many dishes!”","The Giant Eye Octopus rolled its eyes and really fainted.","Huang Yueli looked at its round body that was twitching continuously and frowned, feeling extremely puzzled,” Eh? It fainted from fright? Isn’t this Giant Eye Octopus a legendary ancient ferocious beast? What kind of big scene had it not seen before? Why is it so timid?”","Li Moying’s lips curled up in amusement.S?arch п?wпo??l .?rg on g??gle","Did his little fox really not know how intimidating her green eyes were just now?","He walked over to Huang Yueli’s side and poked that Extreme Frost Giant Eye Octopus a few times, forcefully waking it up from its unconsciousness.","The little thing had just woken up and was still in a daze when she heard Li Moying’s clear and cold voice saying,” Alright, don’t waste any more time. Hurry up and form a contract with this little fellow.” We can’t let go of such a good reserve.”","The little thing almost burst into tears on the spot.","But now that things had come to this point, it knew that it definitely couldn’t escape and could only bear with its heart filled with resentment and frustration as it sobbed and signed the contract with Huang Yueli.","Originally, it still had a glimmer of hope, that was Huang Yueli had just come into contact with the Devil Clan’s Contract Seal Array and if she wasn’t familiar enough or the Devil Qi in her body wasn’t enough to use it, then it could buy some time for itself and find an opportunity to secretly escape from the Female Devil’s Devilic claws.."]},{"number":4605,"title":"Chapter 4605: Food Reserve (10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4605: Food Reserve (10)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Unfortunately, its wish was destined to never come true.","Huang Yueli took out the notes left behind by King Xiang and casually swept a few glances before stretching out her hands and started to form a seal.","Her hand speed was very fast. In just a dozen breaths, she had continuously changed a dozen hand seals. Moreover, each hand seal perfectly reproduced the contents of the notebook without any mistakes.","In less than 15 minutes, she successfully contracted the despairing Giant Eye Octopus and made it her contracted beast.","Huang Yueli raised its tiny body up to her eyes and said happily: ” That’s great! I’ve finally contracted my first Devil Clan fierce beast. It’s truly a cause for celebration! Although you’re just a reserve, since you’re the first one, I still have to give you a name. You’ll be called... Octopus! Husband, how about this name?”","But Li Moying had a doting smile on his face,” Not bad, this name is very real and I feel that it’s very good.”","The Giant Eye Octopus was so angry that its entire body was bulging like a round balloon.","Damn it...how real?!","Very good!","Was this young genius of the god clan brainless? Why did he praise everything his wife said?","However, whatever it said now was useless. After the contract was signed, it didn’t even have the ability to resist Huang Yueli. If it wanted to live on peacefully and not be made into various seafood dishes, it could only obediently be his ” octopus ‘","After Huang Yueli had contracted with the Extreme Frost Giant Eye Octopus, she was able to communicate with it through her consciousness. Everything in this little thing’s memories was no longer a secret to her as its Master.","She closed her eyes slightly and communicated with the little thing for a moment before slowly opening her eyes.","“Looks like our guesses were wrong. The cave above the cave was indeed built by Ruiying, but the palace used to store the Empyrean Devil Crystals was built by King Xiang.”","Seeing Li Moying’s puzzled expression, Huang Yueli continued to explain,” This little thing said earlier that it and those fierce beasts in the extremely cold deep pool were captured by King Xiang and not Devil King Ruiying. Furthermore, Ruiying should have already died at that time...”","Li Moying frowned slightly,” In that case, Ruiying and King Xiang are really close friends. Otherwise, King Xiang wouldn’t have spent so much effort to build a palace for him after his death, to protect his most precious treasure when he was alive. This friendship is really priceless...But I wonder how the Devil King Ruiying passed away?”","“I don’t know.” Huang Yueli shook her head,” When Octopus was captured, it wasn’t much older than now. Since then, it had been locked up in this extremely cold deep pool, guarding the entrance to the bottom of the pool. It had never seen Devil King Ruiying and had only had a little contact with King Xiang...","“I wonder how many secrets there were during the ancient times. They have already disappeared from the God Realm with time...”","Li Moying sighed deeply as he looked towards the spacious and worshipful marble palace walls, as a dark light flashed past his eyes.","“It’s very likely that the God Clan’s continent that we know now is completely different from the ancient times. Moreover, everything that we believe is completely different from the truth.... In a place we don’t know, who knows how many secrets are buried...”"]},{"number":4606,"title":"Chapter 4606: Simply appalling (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4606: Simply appalling (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying had such a feeling, but wasn’t Huang Yueli the same?","If they hadn’t accidentally barged into Devil King Ruiying’s cave and discovered the cave hidden deep inside, they would never have known that King Xiang had such a history and that there was such a deep friendship between the God Clan and the Devil Clan...","They would not have known that the array techniques of the God Clan and the Devil Clan had something in common. The God Clan had even sought to use the Devil Qi to cultivate.","All of this was beyond their imagination.","The two of them sighed before turning around and bowing deeply toward the transparent barrier that had been holding the Empyrean Devil Crystal.","Now, they were unable to enter the illusionary realm. However, the two of them believed that the remnant will left behind by King Xiang would not disappear so quickly. It was definitely still watching them.","Then, the two of them prepared to leave.","Although Huang Yueli had a vague guess in her heart that the burial ground of Devil King Ruiying should be nearby, but the two of them were already satisfied with the Empyrean Devil Crystal and didn’t want to disturb the peaceful sleep of a person who had passed away for hundreds of millions of years, even if the other party was from the Devil Clan, it was the same.","After the Empyrean Devil Crystal disappeared, another arch appeared in the palace, right across from the one they had entered.","Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up,” That should be the exit. Let’s go, let’s hurry back!”","“Alright.”","Li Moying replied softly.","The two of them passed through the second door. As expected, there was a teleportation array at the door.","In the blink of an eye, the two of them had already been teleported out of the cave abode, right on the land where they had fought with Ruijiang.","It had been a few days since they entered the cave dwelling and the trees on the ground were initially struck by Li Moying’s lightning and were burning non-stop but now they had all been burnt down and the surroundings had turned into an icy cold scorched earth, full of devastation.","Ruijiang’s corpse had begun to rot and a stench of decay pervaded their nose.","Huang Yueli couldn’t stand this smell and immediately covered her nose as her other hand tugged at her husband’s sleeve.","“Let’s go, let’s go. We have to hurry back to the camp. I wonder how Xuan Chaoyi and the others are doing. Ruijiang hasn’t returned for so many days, the Devil Clan camp must be in a mess!”","Li Moying nodded slightly.","The two of them immediately used their movement mystic skills and flew back.","Huang Yueli’s guess wasn’t wrong.","At this moment, the Devil Camp was already in an extremely chaotic scene.","The Devils had never had any concept of law and discipline. To be able to form an army to fight, it was all because of the absolute strength of the superior experts as a deterrent.","Therefore, when Ruijiang was in the camp, even if there were some small disputes in the Devil Camp, they would generally listen to the deployment. But now, Ruijiang had inexplicably disappeared, and the Devils were leaderless, causing a commotion.","In the beginning, this was because some Devil soldiers were unwilling to abide by the military’s discipline. There were more and more cases of fighting and even killing their colleagues.","As seven days passed, Ruijiang still hadn’t returned. The commotion had escalated further. Many squad leaders had gathered their own teams and started fighting with each other to fight for the position of the camp’s commander.","For a moment, the Devil Camp was filled with killing intent and corpses.","Even the Devils could not protect themselves, let alone the God Clan captives in the camp.","Xuan Chaoyi and the others ‘faces turned as pale as paper when they heard the deafening sounds of killing outside.","“What should we do? Why did the Devils suddenly fall into chaos?”"]},{"number":4607,"title":"Chapter 4607: Simply appalling (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4607: Simply appalling (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“I think I heard the Devils outside talking just now. It’s said that after the Sky Devil Ruijiang left the camp seven days ago, it hasn’t returned. That’s why it’s so chaotic!” A white tiger spoke in a low voice.","Xuan Chaoyi immediately became nervous when he heard that.” You said...” What did you say? Ruijiang disappeared seven days ago? How did you know? Are you sure?”","” Yes!” The cultivator from the White Tiger Clan nodded,” I’m sure!” Last night, the camp was also very chaotic. You were all asleep. I heard someone talking outside. It was two Devil soldiers discussing the disappearance of Ruijiang! It is said that Ruijiang usually leaves the camp every night, but he will definitely return the next morning. This time, he has disappeared for seven days. Even the Devil Deputy General An Xie suspects that something has happened to him. He is now fighting for the position of the general!”","Hearing this, many god clans smiled.","“Hehe, this is really retribution! Ruijiang actually went missing!”","“It’s best if he dies outside! “Perhaps he was really killed by our god clan’s cultivators! Perhaps he met Divine General Xuan on the way?”","“If that’s the case, that’s great!”","“Shut up, you guys can still laugh!”","Compared to the other team members who didn’t know the severity of the situation, Xuan Chaoyi, the team leader, realized the seriousness of the matter at once. His expression immediately darkened.","“Uh, Captain, this... Is there something wrong?” The cultivator from the White Tiger Clan had a puzzled expression.","“You...” Xuan Chaoyi said unhappily. Don’t you remember what happened seven days ago? Sacred Phoenix Clan’s Matriarch Huang and Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Young Master Li came to look for us seven days ago because we were unable to cooperate with them to find the talisman in Ruijiang’s hands. The two of them suspected that the talisman was hidden outside the camp so they left the camp to search for it, this... This is the same time as Ruijiang’s disappearance!”","Hearing this, the expressions of the God Clan cultivators changed one after another. They also realized that the situation was not right.","Someone asked,” But, Captain, maybe Clan Leader Huang and Master Li couldn’t find the talisman and have already returned to the camp?” They might","not have gone missing, right?”","Xuan Chaoyi glanced at the person who asked the question.” If they were back, the camp is in such a mess now. It’s a good time to look for the talisman. They would have come to us for help long ago! Now, there was already a fight outside, but they still hadn’t appeared. This...There was definitely a problem!","There’s a 99% chance that they haven’t returned since they left seven days ago!”","Xuan Chaoyi’s words were reasonable and no one could refute them.","Everyone’s expressions turned even uglier, and cold sweat broke out on their foreheads.","“No, no, no. No way! Peerless geniuses like Matriarch Huang and Young Master Li would not...Will something happen just like that?”","“The two of them are extremely powerful. They even have the protection of an ancient Divine Beast. It is impossible for them to die just like that...”","“That’s right. Even if they haven’t returned for seven days, it doesn’t mean that something happened. Ruijiang hasn’t returned for seven days either. Did","something happen?”","Some of them were still hoping to get lucky and desperately tried to find all kinds of reasons to convince themselves.","Xuan Chaoyi was not that optimistic,” Clan Leader Huang and Young Master Li are indeed very strong, but between them and Ruijiang, who is stronger? If they had run into Ruijiang, who would be the unlucky one? Both parties have been missing for seven days.. Who is more likely to have an accident?”"]},{"number":4608,"title":"Chapter 4608: Simply appalling (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4608: Simply appalling (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Even the most optimistic person had to think deeply about this.","For a moment, all the captives of the God Clan fell silent. The smiles on their faces disappeared.","What Xuan Chaoyi said was absolutely right. If Huang Yueli and Li Moying had encountered Sky Devil Ruijiang while searching for the Array Talisman, they would definitely be doomed!","Now, it seemed that this was very likely to happen...","Xuan Chaoyi took a deep breath and continued,” Even if I’m overthinking things, Matriarch Huang and the others are fine. However, the chaos of the Devil Clan is still very dangerous for us. Have you forgotten how many Devils wanted to tear us apart and eat us when we were escorted to the Devil Camp? If it wasn’t for Matriarch Huang finding a way to suppress it, perhaps... We would have died long ago! Now, the Devil army is completely in chaos. No one cares about it, and Matriarch Huang is not around...”","When he said this, everyone present felt a chill in their hearts.","That’s right, for them, the most pressing problem was survival!","They all had the restrictions left behind by the Devils, which was to prevent them from escaping. They only had less than ten percent of their strength left.","If the Devil Clan really wanted to kill them, they wouldn’t even have the slightest strength to resist!","“What should we do? Captain, can we sneak out in the chaos?”","“Are you kidding me? Going out is a dead end! There are so many Devils outside...’","“However, staying here is only waiting for death...”","Before they could reach a conclusion, a flurry of footsteps came from outside the tent.","Then, the tent flap was pulled down roughly.","An early-stage Sky Devil deputy general rushed in with a team of Devil soldiers and blocked them in the tent.","As soon as the deputy general entered the door, the pungent smell of blood surged toward Xuan Chaoyi and the others.","His body was stained with blood. It was obvious that he had experienced a great battle just now and killed many of his own kind!","The Devil deputy general’s gaze swept across the dozen or so God Clan warriors, and a sinister smile immediately appeared on his face.","“You want to run? Where are you going? You think you can escape from here? Hehe, now that Lord Ruijiang is missing, you are all mine! Just wait for your death!”","“You... What do you want?” As the team leader, Xuan Chaoyi was the first to step forward and protect his teammates behind him.","The deputy general sized him up and sneered,”What do I want?” “I was injured in the battle just now. I was worried that I wouldn’t be able to recover. Fortunately, I remembered that there were still a few of you God Clan trash in the camp in time. I just happened to refine a pill. My strength will definitely recover in time! Men, bring the alchemy furnace I prepared over!”","Following the order of the Devil deputy general, the Devil soldiers formed groups of four and carried extremely heavy brass alchemy furnaces that were as tall as two people into the tent.","Seeing these few alchemy furnaces, the faces of the God Clan’s cultivators all revealed a look of horror.","Even someone like Xuan Chaoyi, who was chosen as the team leader because he was a steady person, felt his heart tighten and his body turn cold.","This kind of alchemy furnace used by the Devil Clan was similar to the one used by the God Clan, but it was not exactly the same.","The most important difference was that the God Clan’s alchemy furnace had several air intakes at the heating point, and a large number of complicated array patterns were drawn on the outside of the alchemy furnace.."]},{"number":4609,"title":"Chapter 4609: Simply appalling (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4609: Simply appalling (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Regardless of whether it was the air intake or the array patterns, the main function was to help the spirit apothecary adjust the temperature of the deviant flame during the pill refinement process.","Only by heating it at the right temperature at the right time could the medicinal pill be guaranteed to exert its greatest medicinal effect.","However, the Devil Clan’s alchemy furnace was not so complicated. There was only one air intake. Moreover, the array patterns on the furnace body were also very simple. There were only a few basic array patterns that helped the flame burn.","This was mainly because they did not need such a complicated structure.","The pills of the Devil Clan were obtained by refining living spirit beasts, gods, or humans. Because they were all living creatures, the efficacy of the pills mainly depended on the cultivation strength of the person who was refined before his death and the degree of pain before his death.","The fiercer the Devil fire burned, the more painful the living thing sealed in the pill furnace would be, and the better the medicinal effect after the pill was formed.","Therefore, those precise control array patterns were redundant and were simplified.","Since they were young, Xuan Chaoyi and the others had seen the picture of this alchemy furnace in the academy’s ancient records. They had also heard of the brutality of the Devils.","However, they were still very young and had just reached adulthood. This was the first time they had seen a Devil’s alchemy furnace with their own eyes!","When they heard the trace of this Devil deputy general’s words that he wanted to throw them in to refine pills, everyone was so scared that their faces turned pale.","‘ Hahaha!” The deputy general of the Devil Clan was very happy when he saw their expressions.” How is it? Are you scared? It’s good that you’re afraid. You can be even more afraid! The more afraid you are, the higher the quality of my medicinal pills. Perhaps not only can I recover my cultivation before I was injured, but I can also take another step forward!”","“What are you all standing there for?” he urged the Devil soldiers. Hurry up and light a fire for me and stuff these little God Clan ghosts in! Hurry up, hurry up. If the other deputy generals remember this matter, it will be too late!”","During this chaotic battle, everyone was eager to get the medicinal pills refined by the god clan cultivators.","He could be considered to have the fastest reaction.","If the others reacted, it would be another fierce battle.","The Devil soldiers immediately came up to drag him.","Xuan Chaoyi’s expression was cold. His eyes were fixed on the Devil soldiers ‘every move. When they were only a few steps away from him, he suddenly shouted in a deep voice,” Attack!”","Following his order, the God Clan warriors in the tent attacked at the same time. Dark Force of different attributes burst out from their bodies.","The few Devil soldiers closest to him died on the spot.S earch ?ew?o?el. ?rg on g??gl?","Xuan Chaoyi didn’t stop either. He charged straight at the deputy general, forming two water swords with both hands and stabbing at the deputy general’s throat!","The deputy general of the Devil Clan obviously did not expect that these captives of the God Clan, who had been starved for several days and had restrictions imposed on them, could actually resist.","Caught off guard, he could not dodge in time. A water sword grazed the front of his neck, and blood immediately gushed out.","Xuan Chaoyi immediately shouted after his attack hit the target.” Everyone, don’t linger in the battle. Leave immediately!” Leave immediately! Split up and run in different directions!”","As he spoke, he attacked again, continuing to attack the deputy general. The water sword in his hand formed a screen of light.","How could the Devil soldiers have thought that the restriction that Xuan Chaoyi and the rest had placed on them when they entered the camp had long been secretly removed by Huang Yueli.."]},{"number":4610,"title":"Chapter 4610: Simply appalling (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4610: Simply appalling (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The restriction on their bodies was added by Huang Yueli using her own unique method, mainly to prevent the suspicion of the Devil soldiers.","As it was only a simulation of the Devil Clan’s restriction, it could only suppress 30% of Xuan Chaoyi and the others ‘strength.","Of course, because they had been starving for seven days, they could not use 70% of their strength. It would be good if they could use 50%. However, this at least gave them a chance to resist.","When the Deputy General of the Devils spoke, Xuan Chaoyi gave his companions a look and agreed to attack together. As expected, the Devils were caught off guard.","The other teammates had already reached the entrance of the camp. They turned around and saw that Xuan Chaoyi was still fighting fiercely with the Devil Deputy General. They could not help but stop.","“Captain Xuan, let us help you...”","“No, you guys go! Hurry up and leave! We’re not his match even if we join forces. I can only stall him for a while. If he doesn’t leave, then... It’s too late!” Seeing that they were not leaving, Xuan Chaoyi was sweating profusely.","Originally, he was already no match for the Devil Deputy General, and now that he made mistakes repeatedly, he was even more vulnerable.","A few breaths later, the Deputy General of the Devil Clan struck Xuan Chaoyi’s chest with his palm.","Xuan Chaoyi spurted out blood and flew backward.","When his teammates saw this, they were both shocked and angry. However, before they could react, the Devil Deputy General suddenly turned around and attacked them.","“You idiots, hurry up and stop these little God Clan kids! If the medicinal pills that are about to reach my mouth fly away, you’ll all be skinned alive!”","The Devil soldiers also reacted and surrounded the other god clans.","His teammates were not as strong as Xuan Chaoyi to begin with, so they were all heavily injured and fell to the ground.","The Deputy General of the Devil Clan strode back and grabbed Xuan Chaoyi’s collar. He lifted the dying Xuan Chaoyi up. His originally handsome face looked extremely terrifying because of the ferocious sneer.","He leaned closer to Xuan Chaoyi and said word by word, “God Clan brat, you’re really bold. How dare you ambush me...” How dare you injure me! Today, I will refine you into a medicinal pill. Not only will I refine you into a medicinal pill, but I will also make you die in extreme pain! I’ll refine you into a peerless medicinal pill! ”","As he spoke, he pressed a hand on Xuan Chaoyi’s forehead, and a surge of Devil Qi suddenly invaded his body.","The next moment, Xuan Chaoyi let out a shrill scream.","“Ah...lt hurts... It hurts... Help! Let me die...","Let me die...Ah!”","When the other teammates heard this voice, their hearts trembled and cold sweat broke out on their backs.","The Black Tortoise Race was a God Clan that mainly cultivated water. They had always been known for their endurance and perseverance. However, Xuan Chaoyi’s painful appearance now...lt could be seen that he could not endure it no matter how hard he tried!","If this vicious punishment was imposed on them...","“Let... Let go of Captain Xuan! Let him go! You guys... You heartless things!”","Even though they were afraid, some of their teammates couldn’t stand it anymore and struggled to get up to save them.","However, before he could get up, he was slapped back by the Devil soldier.","‘ Don’t worry!” the Deputy General said with a sinister smile.” Come one by one. When this Black Tortoise brat enters the alchemy furnace, it will be your turn!”","As he spoke, he lifted Xuan Chaoyi’s neck and walked towards a heated alchemy furnace.","The warriors of the God Clan all looked desperate.","Could it be that they were destined to die miserably here today?","At this moment, a familiar sweet voice came from the tent door.” You’re courting death!”","Before he could finish his sentence, the tent suddenly burst into flames.."]},{"number":4611,"title":"Chapter 4611: Simply appalling (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4611: Simply appalling (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The sword intent formed by the fire attribute energy formed a glaring wall of fire and shot into the tent.","The curtain at the door could not withstand such a temperature at all, and in the blink of an eye, it had already turned into smoke.","A few fire dragons landed with precision and swept toward the Devil soldiers who were suppressing Xuan Chaoyi and the other God Clansmen.","These Devil soldiers did not even have the chance to resist. In the blink of an eye, they were burned into charred corpses. Many of the corpses still had shocked expressions on their faces.","This change happened too suddenly.","No one present could react in time.","It was not until the charred corpses of these Devils fell to the ground that everyone suddenly came back to their senses.","The God Clan cultivators quickly jumped up from the ground and ran toward the door.","The Deputy General of the Devil Clan didn’t bother to chase after them. Instead, his face was full of shock and anger as he glared at the door.” Who dares to ruin my good plan? Why are you hiding outside? Come out!” “Who said I was hiding outside? Do you think I need to hide from you?”","A light laugh came from the entrance of the tent.","Immediately after, a graceful figure passed through the tent door that was still emitting smoke and walked in.","When they saw who it was, Xuan Chaoyi and the others almost cried tears of joy. “Matriarch Huang, you... You’ve finally appeared. You came at the right time! You’re really... You’re really our savior. We don’t know how to repay you..","Earlier when he heard that delicate voice, Xuan Chaoyi’s first reaction was that Huang Yueli had arrived.","However, he felt that it was impossible.","Huang Yueli had not appeared for seven days and as long as she was still alive, it was already not bad so how could she possibly have the ability to run back to the Devil Camp to save them?","Moreover, even if she came, she might not be able to get them...","But who knew that Huang Yueli had really appeared. Not only did she arrive in time, she had even killed so many Devil soldiers in a single move, saving him.","This was simply a miracle!","Instantly, in the eyes of Xuan Chaoyi and the rest, Huang Yueli’s figure became incomparably tall!","However, when the Devil Clan’s Deputy General saw Huang Yueli’s appearance clearly, he was stunned and immediately following that, he burst out in a burst of disdainful laughter.","“Hahaha, the one who attacked just now was you, you little brat? What kind of joke is this? Do you think I’m stupid? How could a God Clan member of your age, a little girl, have such powerful strength? Was it one of your elders who attacked just now? Hurry up and let him in. What are you pretending for?”","Huang Yueli’s face was expressionless as she shot a glance at him and said indifferently: ” The one who attacked earlier was me. There’s no such thing as an elder.”","“You really don’t have any elders? That means you have some powerful weapon in your hands! Looks like my luck is really not bad. Not only can I get so many pills refined from living souls today, but I can also get weapons refined by the God Clan! This is a treasure that you can’t buy even if you have money!”","When the Devil Clan’s Deputy General heard Huang Yueli’s words, he immediately revealed a drooling smile.","He had said those words earlier not because he really wanted to let the person behind Huang Yueli in, but to probe Huang Yueli’s trump card.","After all, Huang Yueli had just killed a few Devils in one move, which was too? shocking.","Even the Deputy General himself might not be able to do it.","In his opinion, this was definitely not the true strength of a cultivator of Huang","Yueli’s age.."]},{"number":4612,"title":"Chapter 4612: Simply appalling (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4612: Simply appalling (7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","For Huang Yueli to be able to accomplish this, there were only two possibilities.","The first was that she had the support of a powerful adult God Clan cultivator.","She was only sent out to negotiate.","The other was that she had a heaven-defying weapon in her hands.","If it was the former, the Devil Deputy General would naturally not dare to provoke her and could only flee for his life. However, if it was the latter...lf he didn’t take this opportunity to get his hands on the weapon, wouldn’t he become a fool?","Thus, he probed.","He did not expect that this girl from the God Clan was actually so unguarded. With just a sentence, she had exposed her true strength...","The Devil Clan Deputy General’s heart leaped with joy as he turned his head and stretched out his hand towards Huang Yueli.","“Little girl, you look pretty good. If you obediently hand over the treasure in your hand and sleep with this general for a few nights, perhaps this general will be in a good mood and leave your corpse intact. I won’t refine you into a medicinal pill...","Following his evil laugh, a cold Devil Qi rushed towards Huang Yueli.","Xuan Chaoyi and the others ‘expressions changed.” Matriarch Huang, be careful!”","“Quick, dodge!”","Their terrified cries had yet to end when they saw Huang Yueli’s lips curling up into a disdainful cold smile. With a slight flash, she easily dodged the Devil Clan’s Deputy General’s attack.","Then, she sneered,”You’re about to die, yet you still dare to daydream!” The Devils are indeed full of ignorant fools!”","As she spoke, she stretched out her right finger and drew it in the air at a moderate speed.","A line of fire immediately appeared where her fingertips swept past, forming a circle of fire.","Huang Yueli’s movements didn’t seem to be fast, even a little slow but she was able to complete her actions before the Devil Clan Deputy General could reach her.","When the Deputy General of the Devil Clan rushed forward, he felt an astonishing heat in front of him. However, he could not dodge in time and could only fall headfirst into the ring of fire.","Almost in the blink of an eye, the Devil Deputy General’s head disappeared.","Immediately after, all the places that were trapped by the fire ring instantly evaporated and turned into a wisp of green smoke.","After a few breaths, the Deputy General of the Devil Clan, who had been standing in the tent and clamoring to refine all the warriors of the God Clan, had completely disappeared in front of everyone. Only wisps of faint smoke were still showing his existence.","With a clang, a green translucent stone fell to the ground.","From the moment Huang Yueli entered the door, her little face which had been stiff suddenly revealed a smile as she ran to the spot where the stone had fallen and bent down to pick it up.","“Devil Stones! This was the Devil Stone of a Sky Devil Stage cultivator! That’s great. We can exchange this for a lot of military merits!”","Huang Yueli raised the Devil Stone in front of her eyes and looked at it carefully for a while, almost unable to resist kissing it.","After thinking about it, he felt that it was a little dirty, so he held back and directly put the Devil Stones into his space.","Just now, he thought that this girl from the God Clan was cold and domineering, with the demeanor of a peerless expert. How did she become a miser in the blink of an eye?","Were their eyes playing tricks on them? Or was he hallucinating?","Even Li Moying who followed Huang Yueli in couldn’t help but facepalm.","The Devil Stones of the Sky Devil Stage Devils were very rare to others, but to them, it was really nothing.."]},{"number":4613,"title":"Chapter 4613: Simply appalling (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4613: Simply appalling (8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Not to mention anything else, in Huang Yueli’s space, there was still Ruijiang’s Devil Stone lying quietly!","When they killed Sky Devil Ruijiang, he relied on the power of King Xiang’s talisman to forcefully raise his realm. Therefore, the Devil stones he left behind after his death had also reached the level of the quasi-Devil king realm. Although there was a difference from the true Devil king realm, it was not something that the Sky Devil realm could compare to.","As for the God Clan’s coalition army, they hadn’t killed a Devil King for hundreds of years. Therefore, this Devil Stone of the Devil King Realm was already shocking enough. It was estimated that when they returned to the 12 continents of the God Clan, it would definitely shock the entire military.","Compared to this, what could the Devil crystals of that Devil Deputy General count for?","However, his little fox was someone who would not let go of even a copper coin.","The legendary profiteer who was delayed by martial arts cultivation...","Huang Yueli raised her head and saw everyone’s astonished gazes. Her small face stiffened as she coughed heavily: ” Cough cough, you guys didn’t see anything earlier. If my husband were to come, you all know what to say right?” Xuan Chaoyi was speechless.","Sensing that everyone’s gazes were a little strange, Huang Yueli suddenly felt that something was amiss and hurriedly turned around to take a look, only to see Li Moying’s tall and straight figure.","“Cough, cough, cough!” She immediately felt awkward and coughed a few times.","He could only repeatedly hypnotize himself that he didn’t need the burden of a goddess anymore...","She quickly walked to Li Moying’s side and hooked his arm,” Husband, you came so quickly! I thought you would have to delay a little longer!”","After the two of them hurried back to the Devil Camp, they split up.","Huang Yueli first rushed over to rescue Xuan Chaoyi and the rest of the God Clan practitioners while Li Moying went to the Devil Clan’s main camp, planning to wipe out the Devil Clan’s main force in one fell swoop. When the two of them met up, they could return to You An City directly.","Huang Yueli had originally thought that her actions were fast enough and the matters on her side were simpler so she would definitely be able to complete it faster than Li Moying so she could go and support him later.","Who knew that Li Moying actually followed her closely?","Huang Yueli was slightly puzzled as she turned to look at her husband. Li Moying shook his head slightly,” My side isn’t going too smoothly. Earlier when I went to the Middle Corps main tent, there was no one there and the Devil army had already split into several teams, fighting their own battles. We have to find their leader one by one. Therefore, I decided to come and see how things are going on your side first.”","Huang Yueli understood and immediately said: ” Alright then, let’s go together. Hurry up and deal with all these Devils!”","She was an impatient person as she pulled Li Moying along, wanting to go out.","It was only then that Xuan Chaoyi and the others recovered from their shock. Seeing this, they rushed in front of them and stopped them.","“Wait! Matriarch Huang, Young Master Li, you guys...Don’t be anxious! How dangerous would it be to rush out like this? We should discuss a plan first before we can leave the camp safely...”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment,” Plan? What plan? By the time the discussion is over, perhaps these Devil armies have run off to who knows where, and we won’t be able to earn any military merits even if we want to.”","Xuan Chaoyi was clearly a little stunned..” Wha...” What military merits? Shouldn’t we seize the time and escape from this camp?”"]},{"number":4614,"title":"Chapter 4614: Simply appalling (9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4614: Simply appalling (9)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli frowned slightly, feeling even more puzzled than him.","“Escape from the camp? When did I say that I was going to escape from the camp? If we want to leave, it’s actually very simple. We can swagger out and no mo can stop us. However, although these Devil armies are in a mess, they still have a lot of people. If we leave them alone, they will definitely gather and harass the residents at the border. Therefore, we must do our best to eliminate them. Even if we can’t wipe them out completely, we must at least get rid of all the Devils above the late Earth Devil Stage.”","Huang Yueli had never been a commander in the army but she could make a judgement based on her common sense.","Although their commander, Ruijiang, was already dead, and the Devil army was leaderless and in chaos, this did not mean that they had no fighting power or destructive power.","There were many small villages near Blessed City where many human villagers lived. Most of them were only at the low level of the Profound Meaning Realm. In the Immortal Realm, they were considered ordinary people, similar to those who did not have cultivation in the lower realm.","Originally, the Devil army was bent on taking Blessed City and was too lazy to find trouble with them. However, once they were defeated, they would definitely burn, kill, and plunder everywhere.","Moreover, it was impossible for all of these Devil armies to die in internal strife. At least 70% of the army would be left behind and gathered again to continue harassing the border.","Therefore, in order to solve the problem, they definitely had to kill more experts among the Devils.","This was a very urgent task. If they returned to Blessed City and asked Xuan Jiuling to send troops over, it would obviously be too late.","Huang Yueli’s scheme was very reasonable and easy to understand. Xuan Chaoyi and the rest weren’t stupid and immediately understood.","However, after he understood her words, not only was Xuan Chaoyi not at ease, he was even more shocked.","“Phoenix...Matriarch Huang, you... Why do you think so? This... Please think twice!”","“I know that you are very powerful. You were able to kill the Devil Deputy General just now with one strike, which means that an early-stage Sky Devil expert is no threat to you. However, this was the Devil army camp after all!","Ruijiang was also a well-known expert among the Devil Clan. Among the Devil","Clan that followed him on this expedition, there were not only early-stage Sky Devils, there were even several mid-stage Sky Devils! Wouldn’t it be very dangerous if you encountered a mid-stage Sky Devil Devil?”","“Even if...Even if the two of them were strong enough and did not put mid-stage Sky Devils in their eyes, but...But Ruijiang himself was at the peak of the Sky Devil Stage! Do the two of you know what this means? Even Divine General Xuan doesn’t dare to say that he can definitely defeat Ruijiang. Moreover, Ruijiang still has that Array Talisman that can greatly increase his strength...”","“Even though Ruijiang is missing now, who knows when he will return? If he suddenly appears, we will definitely die, or...We should hurry back to Blessed City while Ruijiang isn’t around!”","Xuan Chaoyi’s words were said earnestly and earnestly. He felt that it was all for the sake of Huang Yueli and the rest. Anyone who had a bit of rationality should listen to his suggestion at this time.","However, he didn’t expect that after Huang Yueli heard it, she still shook her head,” Captain Xuan, you’re worrying too much.”","“This subordinate...”","Xuan Chaoyi still wanted to say something when he heard Huang Yueli say indifferently,” Ruijiang...well, he was killed by us a few days ago!”"]},{"number":4615,"title":"Chapter 4615: Simply appalling (10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4615: Simply appalling (10)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“What? What did you say? Ruijiang... How did he...What happened?”","Xuan Chaoyi’s eyes widened. He froze on the spot, and his jaw almost fell to the ground.","Not only him, but all the God Clansmen present were dumbfounded. They could not believe their ears at all.","After a long while, Xuan Chaoyi finally recovered from his shock and laughed dryly,” Haha, Matriarch Huang, Young Master Li, I’ve made a fool out of myself. I must have been attacked by that Deputy General of the Devil Clan just now and injured my brain. I actually heard you kill Ruijiang...” I’m simply...”","“You didn’t hear wrongly. I did say that my husband and I have already killed Ruijiang!” Huang Yueli raised her brows slightly as she repeated what she had said earlier.","Upon hearing this, Xuan Chaoyi was completely stunned. He looked at the two of them with his mouth agape.","The other God Clans looked at each other and could not even speak.","It wasn’t that they had heard wrongly just now, but... Huang Yueli really said those words!","However, this... How was this possible?","Even if Huang Yueli and Li Moying were indeed god grade geniuses that were hard to come by in ten thousand years and their innate talent and abilities were publicly acknowledged by everyone, but they were still very young after all!","After the God Realm’s Grand Meet, everyone was already familiar with their cultivation realms. Both of them were peak Profound Heart realm cultivators!","As for Sky Devil Ruijiang? That was peak Sky Devil Stage, equivalent to peak Dao Profound Realm strength!","With the gap of an entire realm, Ruijiang could kill the two of them in a second. No matter how heaven-defying they were, it was impossible for them to kill Ruijiang!","Everyone’s face and eyes were filled with disbelief but no one dared to say it out loud in front of Huang Yueli.","But when Huang Yueli saw their expressions, she knew what they were thinking.","She was initially unwilling to explain more on this matter but after considering that they still needed Xuan Chaoyi and the rest to work together to pursue the Devil army, she made an exception and said a few more words. She told them about how she and Li Moying followed Ruijiang and discovered the hidden location of King Xiang’s Array Talisman, which was then discovered by","Ruijiang, and the entire process of winning the battle with him, to Xuan Chaoyi and the rest.","However, regarding the residence of the Devil King Ruiying, it was still a secret of King Xiang. She did not mention a word, but emphasized on the battle.","After listening to Huang Yueli’s words, the God Clan practitioners seemed to have woken up from a dream as they finally understood why Huang Yueli, Li Moying and Ruijiang had gone missing seven days ago!","However, although they understood, the shock in their hearts did not decrease at all. Instead, it doubled.","“Matriarch Huang, Young Master Li, you guys...You guys... If you hadn’t said it yourself, I would never have believed that such a thing could happen. Two young Celestials at the peak of the Heart Profound Realm actually joined forces to kill a Devil Lord at the peak of the Sky Devil Stage! This... This is too exaggerated...”","Xuan Chaoyi spoke again. Because of the shock, he could not even speak properly and began to stutter.","Huang Yueli took a glance at him and corrected him: ” Wrong. It wasn’t two Heart Profound Realm experts who killed the peak Sky Devil Stage Devil. At the beginning, we almost died in Ruijiang’s hands. To be able to turn defeat into victory in the end, it was all thanks to my husband breaking through to Dao Profound Realm at the critical moment. Only with Dao Profound Realm cultivation did he successfully kill Ruijiang. Otherwise, our corpses would have been cold by now..”"]},{"number":4616,"title":"Chapter 4616: Follow the boss, military merits fall from the sky (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4616: Follow the boss, military merits fall from the sky (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Oh, so that’s the case. So it’s Master Li who has advanced. I knew it. No wonder you were able to kill a strong Devil like Ruijiang. So...”","Xuan Chaoyi’s brain hadn’t turned around and he followed Huang Yueli’s words. Halfway through his sentence, he suddenly reacted and was instantly stuck.","Li Moying, he actually...He actually...","” Master Li broke through to Dao Profound Realm?! Heavens, how is this possible?”","“Young Master Li is only twenty-five this year, right? He actually broke through to Dao Profound Realm already? You guys... Are you kidding me?”","“That’s impossible, right? How could such a thing happen! The earliest cultivator to break through to Dao Profound Realm in the history of the Divine","Clan’s 12 continents also only broke through when he was 35 or 36 years old!” Before Xuan Chaoyi could say anything, his team members were already screaming.","Everyone’s gaze fell on the handsome man who had been silently guarding behind their wife since they entered the door. Their eyes were not only shocked, but more accurately, they were in awe.","A 25-year-old Dao Profound Realm powerhouse...This was definitely an unprecedented peerless genius!","Even though she knew that Huang Yueli and Li Moying had rare god grade innate talent in the God Realm, but...Even if it was a divine genius, to be able to be so powerful...l’ve never heard of it!","Hearing everyone’s shrieks, Li Moying was a little speechless as he frowned slightly,” How can it be so exaggerated, how much do you know about the history of the God Clan? How do we know how old the youngest Dao Profound Realm cultivator in history is?","He wasn’t being humble, but he had his reasons.","Huang Yueli had already told him in detail about the conversation between her and King Xiang’s remnant thoughts. Amongst which, King Xiang had once told Huang Yueli that her innate talent was extremely outstanding, even more outstanding than when King Xiang was young. But he had never mentioned that she was the most talented genius he had ever seen.","It could be seen that in the ancient times, the divine grade geniuses of the God Clan would definitely not be as rare as they were now.","Li Moying admitted that his innate talent was about the same as his wife and if Huang Yueli wasn’t the most outstanding genius, then he naturally wasn’t either.","When Huang Yueli heard that, she was a little dissatisfied.","She turned her head to look at Li Moying as she pouted her lips,” Husband, your words are wrong. The Heaven and Earth Profound Qi in the ancient God Realm was so dense and there were so many treasures. How could it compare to the present? If you were born in the ancient era, your cultivation would definitely be higher than now. You would also be a top-notch genius!”","In her eyes, of course, her husband was good everywhere.","When Li Moying heard her say those words, his handsome face turned slightly red as he hurriedly placed a hand on his lips and coughed lightly,” Li ‘er, you.... Now is not the time to talk about this. Let’s hurry up and chase after the Devil army! If we’re late, I’m afraid something unexpected will happen.”","“That’s true!”","Huang Yueli regained her senses and immediately threw her husband’s innate talent to the back of her mind.","She turned around and faced Xuan Chaoyi and the others again.” My husband and I are going to chase after the Devil army and kill the Devil experts. Are you willing to come with us?” she said. You don’t have to take the risk if you encounter an expert. You only need to tell us the other party’s location and stall him. I don’t dare to say that there’s no danger, but...”","“I’ll go, of course I’ll go!”","Before she could finish her sentence, Xuan Chaoyi spoke up impatiently","What a joke, who would refuse?"]},{"number":4617,"title":"Chapter 4617: Follow the boss, military merits will fall from the sky (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4617: Follow the boss, military merits will fall from the sky (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","This was a good thing for military merits to fall from the sky!","Even Sky Devil Ruijiang had already died in Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s hands so the remaining people in the Devil Camp were naturally not worth mentioning. It was impossible for anyone to be a match for these two big shots.","And they only needed to help Huang Yueli and the rest to delay the fleeing devils.","With Huang Yueli and the rest’s character, they would definitely give out some military merits to them after the matter!","Although this was very dangerous, the benefits were too great!","Usually, how could they, who were in the early or middle stages of the Heart Profound Realm, have the guts to kill a Devil in the Sky Devil Realm? In fact, because the physical quality of the Devils far exceeded that of the gods, even if they fought with Devils of the same level, they had to think twice before doing so.","How long would it take to earn military merits like this?","And following Huang Yueli and the rest, even a little bit that leaked out from their fingers would probably be more than what they had accumulated over the past few years. After returning to Blessed City, who knew how many resources they could exchange for from the Military Department?","None of the God Clansmen who could enter this special mission team were fools. They all realized how great an opportunity this was.","Everyone scrambled to respond, expressing that they would listen to the command and cooperate with Matriarch Huang and Young Master Li to kill the enemy!","Huang Yueli then revealed a satisfied smile,” I’m very happy that everyone has such guts. I really didn’t misjudge you! Now, please come closer...Come a little closer. Everyone will surround me and form a circle.”","Xuan Chaoyi and the rest didn’t understand but they still followed Huang Yueli’s instructions and surrounded her and Li Moying in the middle.","Huang Yueli’s wrist shook slightly as her palm faced upwards, revealing a small token that looked like gold but not gold, jade but not jade.","“Activate the formation!”","Huang Yueli’s cold voice rang out as her other hand drew a few simple array patterns in the air.","Immediately after, the talisman in her palm suddenly emitted a dazzling golden light, enveloping her and everyone around her.","“This... This is...”","” What’s going on?!”","This golden light was too dazzling. Everyone could not see anything in an instant, and for a moment, they were a little flustered.","However, before the golden light faded away, they could already feel a heat rising in their bodies. This heat flow flowed from their dantian, along their meridians, and into their limbs and bones.","And wherever the heat flow went, they could clearly feel that the Profound Energy in their bodies had an obvious increase!","“This... Why do I feel like my strength has increased? I... I feel like I’m about to advance to the Late Heart Profound Realm!”","“I... Me too! I suddenly feel like I’m advancing. I feel like my entire body is filled with strength! ”","“What happened? What exactly happened?”","After the golden light dissipated, everyone’s gaze fell on Luo Chenxi’s palm.","The small token had already returned to its original state. Moreover, it could be seen with the naked eye that the luster on the surface of the token had decreased a little compared to before. It looked a lot dimmer.","Everyone had seen the process of Huang Yueli drawing the array patterns to activate this token so they were very clear that the changes on their bodies were related to this token.","Huang Yueli’s lips curled up slightly as she kept the token in her palm and retracted her hand.","Xuan Chaoyi suddenly had a shocking thought..” This...” Could this be...”"]},{"number":4618,"title":"Chapter 4618: Follow the boss, military merits will fall from the sky (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4618: Follow the boss, military merits will fall from the sky (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xuan Chaoyi suddenly stopped mid-sentence.","Even he felt that his guess was a little ridiculous.","However, Huang Yueli nodded her head lightly,” That’s right, just as you’ve thought, this is the target of your team’s investigation, the talisman that Sky Devil Ruiiianz has that can raise the group’s strength! Based on mv observations, this Array Talisman should have been refined by the ancient","Spirit Armament Master, King Xiang. Therefore, my husband and I call it the King Xiang Array Talisman. ”","Xuan Chaoyi opened his mouth but couldn’t find his voice.","He had experienced too many shocks today.","Even though he knew that Huang Yueli and Li Moying were the top peerless geniuses of the God Clan, such geniuses were different from ordinary people like them. No matter what kind of miracle happened to them, or what kind of heavenly luck they encountered, it was very normal.","However, everything that had happened now still made his heart surge and it was difficult for him to calm down...","“So, the so-called Array Talisman really exists? Can Ruijiang really rely on it to increase the strength of the entire Devil army?” Xuan Chaoyi tried to calm himself down and asked.","The existence of King Xiang’s Array Talisman itself was already shocking enough.","Back then, their team had been sent out by Divine General Xuan Jiuling not to find this Array Talisman, but to find out what kind of heaven-defying magic treasure Sky Devil Ruijiang had that could greatly increase the combat strength of the Devils and influence the outcome of the battle.","The so-called Array Talisman was just a guess of Xuan Jiuling and the others. No one dared to guarantee that this thing really existed. After all, no one had ever heard of an Array Talisman that could be used repeatedly and could even raise a cultivator’s strength to such an extent!","Huang Yueli nodded slightly, ” That’s right, this is indeed Ruijiang’s hidden treasure. We also spent a lot of effort to obtain it from his hands. In fact, the power of this talisman is far more than that. It’s just that I’m not familiar with it yet. At most, I can only increase the strength of twenty people. I can’t cover an army of ten thousand like Ruijiang.”","King Xiang had left behind a stone tablet in the cave abode of the Devil King Ruiying, explaining the usage of this talisman.","This talisman was designed for the Devil Clan. If it was in the hands of the God Clan, it would not be able to activate it. If it fell into the hands of those cultivators of the evil way, it could be activated. However, it could only increase the strength of those cultivators of the evil way and the Devil Clan. It could not benefit the pure-blooded God Clansmen like Xuan Chaoyi.","But it was in Huang Yueli’s hands.","Huang Yueli had obtained the guidance from King Xiang in the illusory realm and also obtained his notes. In a very short period of time, she had already grasped the majority of the functions of the universal array patterns.","Coincidentally, most of the formation patterns on this King Xiang Array Talisman were drawn using common formation patterns, and only a small portion were drawn using the formation patterns of the Devil Clan.","On the way back, Huang Yueli had been pondering over these array patterns, wanting to change the Devil Clan’s array patterns into array patterns that could be activated using Profound Energy. If this could be done, this Array Talisman could also be used on the God Clan.","As it turned out, she had succeeded...Half.","After thinking hard, she finally found a few key array patterns. With some slight modifications and her hand seals, she could use them to increase the strength of the God Clan’s cultivators.","However, this way, the power of this talisman would be greatly weakened.","Now that she had covered 20 people, it was already her limit.."]},{"number":4619,"title":"Chapter 4619: Follow the boss, military merits will fall from the sky (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4619: Follow the boss, military merits will fall from the sky (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Towards this, Huang Yueli was extremely dissatisfied.","King Xiang could directly refine such a heaven-defying Array Talisman, and she...lt took so much effort just to modify it slightly. It could be seen that the gap between her and the truly powerful spiritual artifact masters in ancient times was really too great!","It was unknown how long it would take to catch up to or even surpass King Xiang’s attainments...","Xuan Chaoyi and the others didn’t think too much about it.","The reason Huang Yueli gave was still very convincing and adding on that they had long been completely convinced by Huang Yueli and Li Moying, naturally they wouldn’t suspect that there was anything wrong with the two of them,","After all, Ruijiang was a peak Sky Devil expert while Huang Yueli was only at peak Heart Profound Realm so she couldn’t be like Ruijiang, unleashing the full power of the Array Talisman. This was too normal!","” Matriarch Huang, it’s already very impressive that you’re able to use the Array Talisman to increase our strength!”","“Yeah, I only know now that the feeling of the Devil Clan’s strength increasing by a large margin was actually so good. I now feel that I can kill a late stage Earth Devil!”","“No wonder those Devil soldiers suddenly became so powerful. Such a secret treasure...lsn’t this too heaven-defying?”","” Fortunately, Matriarch Huang and Young Master Li managed to kill Ruijiang. Otherwise, who knows what kind of trouble our God Clan’s army would have encountered. Ruijiang isn’t a true expert of the Devil Clan yet. If this talisman falls into the hands of a Devil King, I’m afraid that the twelve continents of the God Realm would really fall...”","Xuan Chaoyi’s final sigh made all the God Clan members nod.","Looking at Huang Yueli and Li Moying, her eyes were filled with respect.","Huang Yueli and the rest had been training outside so they didn’t know about the situation in Blessed City but Xuan Chaoyi and the rest were very clear about it.","In fact, the God Clan army led by Xuan Jiuling was barely holding on. Most of the time, they didn’t even dare to go out of the city gates to fight with the Devil army.","If the two of them hadn’t killed Ruijiang in time, the Devil army would probably have already invaded Blessed City.","Once the barrier of Blessed City was broken through, the entire Heaven Fox Continent would probably fall in a short period of time.","Huang Yueli had not expected that these people would suddenly become so agitated.","However, she did not reveal anything on her face and remained indifferent.” Although your strength has increased, it has only increased by half a small realm. You still have to be more careful. There are many experts in the Devil Camp. If you are not careful, you will easily lose your lives. Although military merits are important, your lives are more important! It wasn’t easy for me to save you all because I wanted to bring you back safely. Don’t let me down!”","When Huang Yueli said these words, Xuan Chaoyi and the rest’s hearts shook as they were extremely moved.","Although the God Clan army was not as cold-blooded and heartless as the Devils, since they had joined the military camp, the military headquarters, from top to bottom, required all soldiers to kill the enemy and win as their first goal, regardless of personal life and death.","Although these people were all outstanding geniuses of the various large families, after receiving this extremely dangerous mission, they also knew that they would most likely die.","He did not expect that he would still have the chance to return alive!","Furthermore, Huang Yueli actually said that they should place their lives above killing the enemy and winning!"]},{"number":4620,"title":"Chapter 4620: Follow the boss, military merits fall from the sky (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4620: Follow the boss, military merits fall from the sky (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","They had never seen such a commanding general before...","For a moment, everyone’s feelings were somewhat complicated.","Huang Yueli totally didn’t realise that her words had caused them such a huge shock.","After all, in her opinion, there was no suspense in today’s battle.","If it was just to kill the devils, actually with her and Li Moying, it was already sufficient. She brought along these God Clan practitioners because on one hand, she needed someone to provide them with information and intercept the devils that were escaping. On the other hand, she valued them for daring to accept this kind of suicidal mission and would rather die than submit in front of the devils ‘Deputy General so she wanted to help them out and let them earn some military merits.","Actually, with or without them, it wouldn’t affect her and Li Moying’s actions too much.","Since that was the case, it was reasonable for them to pay attention to their safety.","She had spent so much effort to save the person. If he died on the way, wouldn’t it be a huge loss?","After Huang Yueli finished speaking, she thought for a moment and took out a few standard spirit weapons from her space, tossing them over.","Only then did she walk out of the camp side by side with her husband.","Xuan Chaoyi and the others came back to their senses. They quickly bent down to pick up their weapons and quickly followed.","The current Devil Clan camp was already not as chaotic as before.","Perhaps it was because after a few days of chaotic warfare, the various factions in the Devil army had gradually determined their strength. Some of the weaker factions had already been killed or surrendered.","In the camp they were in, there were no longer Devils killing each other. Instead, there were groups of Devil soldiers who were arranged in a relatively orderly manner, patrolling the vicinity.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying led a group of God Clan soldiers and rushed out, and they met a small patrol team head-on.","When the Devil captain saw them, his eyes immediately lit up. Aren’t you the God Clan soldiers who were captured a few days ago? Alright, you must have seen that Mizuki wasn’t here and wanted to escape, right? He was simply courting death! Where do you think you can run to?”","This Devil captain was already at the middle Earth Devil Stage, so he believed that his strength was not bad.","In addition, he knew that the God Clan captives had their meridians sealed, so he naturally didn’t put them in his eyes.","Not only did he not sense any danger, he even thought that he had obtained a chance to make a contribution.","A red light flashed in his eyes as he grinned hideously, “Everyone, attack together and kill these God Clans.” Ah!”","Before the Devil captain could finish his sentence, he saw a blinding flash of fire in front of him.","Before he could react to what had happened, his body fell to the ground with a loud bang. His entire body instantly emitted green smoke, and in the blink of an eye, he had become a charred corpse.","His team members were rubbing their fists and getting ready to take the credit.","Who knew that their captain would fall first.","They were all stunned for a moment before their expressions changed.” Not good! These God Clans were not to be trifled with. Quick... Run!”","Unfortunately, it was already too late.","Huang Yueli’s hand swept out a flame and enveloped them all within the fire attributed energy domain.","The dozen or so team members fell down without a sound.","Xuan Chaoyi and the rest stood behind Huang Yueli and when they saw that she had just raised her right hand slightly and harvested an entire team of Devil soldiers, they were so shocked that they couldn’t even speak.","This team could be considered an elite team of Devils, and all the members were at the Earth Devil Stage.."]},{"number":4621,"title":"Chapter 4621: Follow the boss, military merits fall from the sky (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4621: Follow the boss, military merits fall from the sky (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Even if they fought alone, they would have to spend a lot of effort to win.","In the end, in Huang Yueli’s hands, it was... Only one move?","No, that’s not right. He didn’t even need to use a single move!","Huang Yueli had clearly just raised her hand.","Li Moying was already in Dao Profound Realm, but Huang Yueli was still in Heart Profound Realm!","Everyone was obviously at the Heart Profound Realm so why was Huang Yueli’s Heart Profound Realm combat strength so much weaker than everyone else? It was like the difference between a ferocious beast and an ant on the ground!","However, without waiting for them to think further, Huang Yueli and Li Moying had already stepped over the corpses of the devils and without turning back, they rushed forward.","“Matriarch Huang, this Devil Stone...” Xuan Chaoyi could not help but remind her.","“The magic crystals are yours! However, don’t waste time picking it up now. There will be plenty of opportunities later! Help me deal with the two teams coming from the right. They’re not very strong. You can handle them!” “And the three squads coming from the back!”","“Send a few people to the east and help me investigate if there are any Devils above the late stage of the Earth Devil Realm. If there are none, kill them directly. If there are, send someone to report immediately!”","Huang Yueli didn’t even look at the Devil Stones that had already rolled to the ground, but she quickly gave out instructions one by one.","Hearing Huang Yueli say that she wanted to leave these magic crystals to them, Xuan Chaoyi and the rest’s eyes turned red, unable to suppress the joy in their hearts.","No one had expected Huang Yueli to be so generous!","This... This was Old Devil’s Devil Stone!","One of them was a middle Earth Devil!","Huang Yueli actually didn’t have any interest at all?","However, that was right. He had even killed Ruijiang, who was at the peak of the Sky Devil Stage. How could he be interested in this little bit of military merit?","Xuan Chaoyi and the rest were excited and just as they were about to go over to pick up the Devil Stones, they heard Huang Yueli’s order for them to face the enemy first.","They had already accepted Huang Yueli as their leader so of course they didn’t dare to disobey her orders. They hurriedly turned around and went towards the two Devil Clan teams that Huang Yueli mentioned.","The God Clan soldiers felt their hearts turn cold.","Huang Yueli said that these two teams weren’t very strong, this... This was judged according to her own standards, right?","The two mo squads in front of him had a total of 30 to 40 people. Moreover, there were two mid Earth Devils and the rest were all early Earth Devils. There were only a few ordinary mo soldiers!","It would be difficult for them to meet such a small team.","There were only two squads now, and the number of people was double that of the God Clan soldiers!","Xuan Chaoyi subconsciously turned back, wanting to look for Huang Yueli and the rest for help but Huang Yueli and Li Moying had already run far away, leaving behind a ground full of devil corpses!","It was obviously a little too late to call for help now.","Moreover...","Xuan Chaoyi gritted his teeth and felt too ashamed to call for help!","Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s age was only half of theirs but they already had such powerful abilities, even able to kill peak Sky Devils! Facing these two teams, Huang Yueli only needed one move.","And there were so many of them!","Could it be that he still had to turn around and escape, waiting for Huang Yueli and the rest to save him?","“What should we do? Captain? Should we...”","“What nonsense? All of you! Didn’t you hear what Matriarch Huang said?” Xuan Chaoyi suddenly drew his long saber and rushed out first. Seeing this, the others were ashamed and quickly followed.."]},{"number":4622,"title":"Chapter 4622: Follow the boss, military merits fall from the sky (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4622: Follow the boss, military merits fall from the sky (7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","At the same time, the captains of the two Devil squads had already seen them.","Seeing that Xuan Chaoyi didn’t run away but charged straight at them, the Devil soldiers couldn’t help but laugh.","“Are these God Clans stupid? We clearly have more people, yet they still dare to charge over? What was he trying to do? Do you want to die?”","“Who cares? Hurry up and kill them. This is all our credit!”","“No, we can’t kill him! He had to capture her alive! Lord Deputy General needs the geniuses of the God Clan to refine the Soul Birth Pill to advance. If we capture them alive and send them over, it will definitely be a great merit!”","The Devils sized up Xuan Chaoyi and the others unscrupulously, completely disregarding them.","“Look, this kid in the lead actually dares to charge straight at us! Was he afraid that he would not die fast enough? Haha!”","One of the mid-stage Earth Devils laughed loudly. When he saw Xuan Chaoyi’s long saber waving in front of him, he didn’t panic at all. Instead, he went forward to meet it.” Just watch, I’ll capture him alive...”","Before he could finish, the long saber in Xuan Chaoyi’s hand suddenly changed its direction. It went from a straight slash to a horizontal slash, sweeping toward ms waist.","The squad leader did not expect such a turn of events. He was stunned for a moment before he hurriedly tried to dodge.","However, the speed at which Xuan Chaoyi changed his moves was beyond his expectations.","Although he saw it, he couldn’t keep up with his movements at all.","With a dull thud, Xuan Chaoyi’s long saber swept across his waist with a burst of Dark Force.","Blood instantly splattered out!","The squad leader was still joking when he suddenly felt a chill on his waist. He looked down and realized that his lower body had been dislocated from his upper body. He immediately cried out in horror,”Ah...!” Help, help...! This... What was going on? How was this possible?","It hurts, help...Help!”","He crawled on the ground for dozens of meters before his eyes rolled back and he fell to the ground.","Along the way, blood and internal organs were all on the ground, making it look extremely bloody.","Seeing this scene, the expressions of all the Devils present changed.","Although this scene was tragic enough, it was not rare in the battle of the Devil Clan. However, it was really unexpected that the warriors of the God Clan were so brutal.","Moreover, their squad leader was one of the top experts in the military camp, yet...He was killed in one move!","And it was such a brutal method!","This God Clan...How could he be more terrifying than the Devils?","In fact, what these Devils didn’t know was that Xuan Chaoyi was even more shocked than they were.","Just now, when the mid-stage Earth Devil squad leader rushed towards him, he was extremely nervous. The palm of his hand that was holding onto the long saber was already covered in sweat.","In the past, if he had encountered a middle stage Earth Devil during his scouting, he would definitely choose to avoid it. Unless there was no way to avoid it, he would choose to fight and escape. In short, he would still choose to escape.","But now, because of Huang Yueli’s orders, he had no choice but to charge forward and face the Middle Earth Devil head on!","The attack power and speed of a Middle Stage Earth Devil was equivalent to a Late Heart Profound Realm expert of the God Clan. It could be said that he was far above him. He was simply courting death!","When Xuan Chaoyi was extremely nervous, he suddenly noticed that there was a flaw in the Devil squad leader’s waist.","He wasn’t even sure if he was seeing things.","After all, the other party’s speed was so much faster than his. Logically speaking, even if there was a flaw, it was not something he could see at a glance.."]},{"number":4623,"title":"Chapter 4623: Follow the boss, military merits will fall from the sky (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4623: Follow the boss, military merits will fall from the sky (8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","However, no one knew what Xuan Chaoyi was thinking at this moment. He subconsciously tilted the blade to the side and slashed horizontally.","Xuan Chaoyi was extremely annoyed by the change in technique.","Because in this way, he had completely given up on defense. If this saber missed and the Devil squad leader attacked him, he would definitely not be able to withstand it and would be doomed!","As this thought lingered in Xuan Chaoyi’s mind, he suddenly felt a resistance from his hand, as if he had cut something.","He had completely relied on his instincts to burst out the water attributed Profound Energy in his body!","At this point, Xuan Chaoyi barely managed to stand firm. Just as he was about to judge the situation, he heard the horrified scream of the Devil squad leader.","Xuan Chaoyi quickly lowered his head and almost vomited on the spot.","He... He did not expect that his slash just now was actually so accurate! He had actually chopped an Earth Devil Middle Stage cultivator in half!","This... This...","It wasn’t that he hadn’t killed Devils before, but it was the first time he had seen such a disgusting scene.","Just as he was in shock, the other God Clan members had already rushed over from behind him. When they lowered their heads to look at the scene, they were also stunned.","They thought that they might have to collect Xuan Chaoyi’s corpse by running over, but they did not expect...Their captain had actually displayed his might and dealt with this middle Earth Devil so easily!","That’s right, this method..","Ugh...","“Captain, this...This was... You...”","“An accident, this... This is definitely an accident...” Xuan Chaoyi didn’t know how to explain.","If this kind of thing was spread to the twelve continents of the God Clan by his team members, he would definitely be perverted on the spot!","Even he himself did not know how this happened..","No, he knew!","A flash of inspiration suddenly flashed in Xuan Chaoyi’s mind as he recalled how Huang Yueli had activated the Array Talisman to raise their abilities and before she left, she had even given them a brand new standard spirit weapon..","The long sword that he used to fight with the devil squad leader was given to him by Huang Yueli. It looked like a high grade spirit weapon but he didn’t expect it to be so sharp that it could cut a devil into two, just like cutting tofu..","No wonder Huang Yueli would directly assign them such a combat mission, not worried that anything would happen to them...","Just as Xuan Chaoyi was deep in thought, the remaining Devils had already regained their senses and pounced on them while howling.","‘ Damn the God Clan! How dare they kill people here!”","“You’re simply courting death. Isn’t it just because your spirit weapons are sharp?”","“Let’s go, everyone! He had to capture them alive and bring them back! We have more people, these bastards are definitely not a match for us!”","Seeing the Devil army that was twice their size rushing over with a roar, the team members ‘expressions changed.","Xuan Chaoyi, on the other hand, was roused. He raised the long saber in his hand again.” Don’t be afraid, everyone! Let’s charge together! These are all our military merits! If anyone is late and can’t get any military merits, don’t blame me for not warning you!”","After saying that, he did not wait for the others to react and already impatiently rushed towards the Devil army.","Being able to remind these kids was already his duty as a captain.","Otherwise, he would not have let these people snatch his military merits!","Seeing Xuan Chaoyi run away, the team members had the illusion that their captain...Had he gone crazy?"]},{"number":4624,"title":"Chapter 4624: Follow the boss, military merits will fall from the sky (9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4624: Follow the boss, military merits will fall from the sky (9)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Although they didn’t see clearly how Xuan Chaoyi killed the Devil Clan’s squad leader, but everyone knew Captain Xuan’s ability. He was at the middle stage of Heart Profound Realm and wasn’t like Huang Yueli or Li Moying who were heaven defying peerless geniuses, he...how did he dare..Was he seeking death?!","However, in the next moment, the team members realized...They themselves had made a huge mistake!","It was not that Xuan Chaoyi did not want to live anymore, but...He was ahead of all of them!","Even though the two Devil squads were already prepared and attacked in groups, Xuan Chaoyi still dodged the attacks agilely. Although he was slightly injured, he still managed to kill two Devil soldiers!","“What are you guys still standing there for? Hurry up! Have you all forgotten that Matriarch Huang helped you all increase your strength? Do you really not want the military merits anymore?”","Hearing Xuan Chaoyi’s shout, everyone seemed to wake up from a dream and rushed over.","At the start, some of them were still very nervous. Although Huang Yueli had activated the array earlier, but they had only raised half a minor realm. With this little bit of strength, could they really deal with so many devils?","They didn’t expect that once they attacked, they would realize how big of a mistake they had made!","Half a minor realm did not sound like much but after they received the Array Talisman’s enhancement, the Profound Energy in their bodies had already reached a state of abundance. This kind of state of abundant blood and Qi allowed them to easily unleash 100% of their strength.","Other than that, the spirit weapons that Huang Yueli gave them were also so powerful that they defied the heavens.","On the surface, it seemed to be no different from the military’s military ranks based on cultivation. However, when it was used, the difference was shocking.","What kind of spirit weapon did Huang Yueli give them? Even if it was a","treasured weapon, it didn’t have such great power!","With the combination of the two, their combat strength had at least doubled.","These Devils in front of them, who should have been very difficult to deal with, were now completely not their match.","The God Clan team members did not spend much effort to chase them away. In the end, they even killed them all one by one.","In this process, Xuan Chaoyi, who was the first to react, was naturally the biggest winner. He had killed seven to eight Devils by himself, including the mid-stage Earth Devil squad leader. If he collected these Devil Stones, he would be able to earn a huge amount of military merit!","It had already surpassed the total military merits he had accumulated in the army for seven to eight years.","As for those who were particularly slow to react, by the time they realized what had happened, the battle had already ended. Some of them did not even get a single magic crystal.","Seeing Xuan Chaoyi squatting on the ground and picking up the Devil Stones, these people were so envious that they almost cried.","“Captain, you’re really too lucky. So many magic crystals, it’s too enviable...’ Xuan Chaoyi was grinning from ear to ear.” Hehe, I have a lot of magic crystals because I listen to Matriarch Huang’s commands. You were hesitant when she asked you to come over to fight the enemy. What about now? Who asked you to not believe the words of the Matriarch Huang?”","Those who were running at the back were already regretting it at this time. “I... Of course we believe her, but...lsn’t that just a step too slow?”","“Sigh, if I had known earlier, I would have been the first to rush over!”","‘ What Matriarch Huang said is absolutely the golden rule. In the future, no matter what orders she gives, I will definitely follow them without hesitation!”","When Xuan Chaoyi heard this, he turned around and pointed behind him.” Then why are you still in a daze? Just now, Matriarch Huang said that there would be a group of Devils over there and asked us to stop them...”","‘ Where? Where?!” “I’ll go right away!”","“Don’t fight with me!”"]},{"number":4625,"title":"Chapter 4625: Follow the boss, military merits will fall from the sky (10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4625: Follow the boss, military merits will fall from the sky (10)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The members of the God Clan who were still doubtful of Huang Yueli’s judgement earlier had already treated Huang Yueli’s order as an imperial edict as they scrambled to rush towards the direction Xuan Chaoyi was pointing. What a joke, it was the Matriarch Huang who ordered them to stop them!","How could Matriarch Huang’s judgment be wrong?","She was obviously leaving the military merits to them on purpose. Whoever didn’t hurry up and go would be a fool!","Just like that, under Xuan Chaoyi’s lead, the God Clan practitioners followed Huang Yueli’s instructions and intercepted the Devil Clan teams one by one. Not long after, they had killed over a hundred people.","The more devils they killed, the more the God Clan practitioners revered Huang Yueli.","One had to know that these people were no longer considered weak among the young cultivators of the God Clan. To be able to enter the Heart Profound Realm under the age of 100, they could be considered outstanding talents among the various great God Clan families.","Although he could not compare to the top Heaven-rank geniuses in his family, he was already at the forefront of the entire 12 continents of the God Clan. He could also obtain the support of a large amount of resources from his family.","Precisely because of this, they had enough foresight to see how shocking Huang Yueli’s actions were!","The God Clan had many cultivation techniques that could be used to temporarily increase a cultivator’s cultivation. However, such cultivation techniques required many years of bitter cultivation. Moreover, even the most top-notch divine level cultivation technique could only increase the limit of a small realm.","In order to achieve this goal, one had to pay the price of damaging one’s meridians and cultivation. After using this cultivation technique once, one might not be able to recover even after spending several months.","But what about Huang Yueli?","She had only activated the King Xiang Array Talisman in her hand and spent a few dozen breaths to raise their cultivation by more than half a small realm. There were even people who had directly raised their cultivation by a small realm!","Moreover, there were no side effects!","Not only that, the spirit weapons that Huang Yueli gave them were also so powerful that it had exceeded their imaginations.","Although these weapons weren’t considered high grade weapons, the power they displayed wasn’t inferior to expensive artifacts!","However, this was not what they admired the most.","What was even more shocking was Huang Yueli’s accurate judgement of the situation.","The mo teams that she arranged for them, each one was just the limit that they could deal with. Moreover, even the order of the battle was arranged extremely accurately.","If it wasn’t for Huang Yueli’s arrangements, they wouldn’t have been able to kill so many devils in such a short period of time.","Today’s battle results were already beyond their wildest dreams.","This meant that Huang Yueli’s divine sense was so powerful that it defied the heavens, allowing her to clearly determine the movements of all the Devil forces within a few hundred meters in a short period of time...","As battle after battle continued, the same thought rose in the hearts of every God Clan member, ‘A god-tier genius really lives up to his reputation!’ They would never be able to catch up to him!","At the same time, many people had another thought.","Why were they able to pick up so many military merits today?","Wasn’t it because they followed the right boss?","Following a peerless genius like Huang Yueli and acknowledging her as boss, this military merit seemed to have fallen from the sky.","If... It would be great if he could always fight alongside her in the future.","Unfortunately, they also understood that this was just a thought.."]},{"number":4626,"title":"Chapter 4626: Arriving at Blessed City Again (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4626: Arriving at Blessed City Again (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","After all, peerless geniuses like Huang Yueli and Li Moying were the family’s main targets of protection so it was impossible for them to be like them, staying on the Devil Clan battlefield for a long period of time.","If something happened to them and they died in the hands of the Devil Clan, it would not only be the loss of their families, but also the common loss of the entire twelve continents of the God Clan.","It was better to seize this opportunity and accumulate more military merits!","The God Clan members were getting more and more motivated and sometimes even without Huang Yueli’s arrangements, they would take the initiative to attack the Devil Clan.","As for the information that Huang Yueli and Li Moying requested them to provide, they were extremely proactive and even sent a few specialists to continuously provide Huang Yueli and the rest with information.","Huang Yueli got so much information and couldn’t help but smile, ” Xuan Chaoyi and the rest are still very capable! If not for their help, it would have taken us a lot of effort to find these Devil Clan experts one by one. Moreover, their combat strength has also surprised me...’","Li Moying didn’t have any expression on his face. He merely raised his brows and said indifferently,” He’s indeed a promising talent. Unfortunately, his cultivation is a little lacking...”","“It is nothing much if their cultivation is poor. If I were in the army, I could take them in and train them. They would be of use. Unfortunately...” Huang Yueli didn’t finish her sentence but shook her head regretfully.","Li Moying naturally understood what she meant.","It was only a coincidence that the two of them returned to You An City and participated in the battle against the Devils.","He had not forgotten that the two of them were still in the process of eloping!","Even if they didn’t elope, it was impossible for them to stay in the military.","Forget it, Huang Yueli’s character was too jumpy and it was impossible for her to stay in the military camp all the time. Even if she had to deal with the Devil Clan, she would rather do it according to her own heart.","“Don’t worry about this. The Devils here have been dealt with. We still can’t find them. They probably escaped from the camp. As for ordinary mo weapons...","There are simply too many of them. It’s impossible for us to kill them all. Therefore, it’s about time for us to withdraw.” Li Moying reminded.","Huang Yueli nodded her head,” Husband, you’re right. It’s getting late so let’s prepare to return to Blessed City. I can go back and rest for a few days.”","This time when she left the twelve continents of the God Clan, she and Li Moying had gone through a few big battles and the elixirs and Spirit Weapons that she had stored up previously had already been used up quite a bit so she really needed to enter the city to replenish them.","Taking advantage of this opportunity to send Xuan Chaoyi and the others back, it was killing two birds with one stone.","Since she had already made up her mind, Huang Yueli didn’t waste any time as she immediately got Little Qilin to send a message to call Xuan Chaoyi and the rest back.","Not long after, the members of the God Clan team appeared in front of them.","Everyone’s face was filled with joy.","It could be seen that in the process of this encirclement and suppression, each and every one of them had reaped a bountiful harvest. They had earned a large number of military merits until their hands were soft, and they all had a look of success.","Some of them were already so excited that they couldn’t hold it in anymore. They began to discuss in low voices, discussing what treasures they would exchange their military merits for when they returned.","There were even some people who were slightly dissatisfied.. When they saw Huang Yueli, they couldn’t help but ask: ” Matriarch Huang, Young Master Li, the two of you called us back so quickly? Was he going back to Blessed City? Why don’t we kill more Devils before leaving?”"]},{"number":4627,"title":"Chapter 4627: Returning to Blessed City (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4627: Returning to Blessed City (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","As soon as this person spoke, he received the approval of many people.","The team members all agreed.","“That’s right, Matriarch Huang, let’s kill more Devils! These are all military merits!”","“The strength of these Devils is only so-so. In the past, we really overestimated them! Only now do I know that we have the strength to fight with Earth Devil Stage Devils. We shouldn’t have avoided the battle!”","“Yes, it’s too early for us to leave now...”","Seeing this, Huang Yueli frowned and the smile on her face disappeared.","“What’s wrong?” she shouted sternly. Are you all very proud? After killing so many Devils this time, you feel that you’re very powerful, right?”","Hearing Huang Yueli’s voice, all the members of the God Clan present trembled.","The voice immediately stopped.","Everyone lowered their heads and stood respectfully at their original positions, waiting for Huang Yueli to speak.","In the God Realm, only with sufficient strength could one win the respect and reverence of others.","And Huang Yueli had already proven that she was worthy of such a high and mighty position. Now, there wasn’t a single one of these God Clan members who didn’t treat her as a god.","Huang Yueli gave a cold snort: ” The reason why I am willing to help you today is because you dared to risk your lives to come to the Devil Clan’s territory to complete a dangerous mission. It is because I value your spirit of sacrificing yourself for the public! You are worthy of these military merits! But...”","She suddenly changed the topic.” But please don’t forget. You were able to defeat these Devils today not by relying on your own strength! If you didn’t have the King Xiang Array Talisman to raise your cultivation level, if you didn’t have a powerful spirit weapon, would you still be able to accomplish today’s battle results? I hope you can recognize your own strength. Otherwise, if you return to the battlefield in the future and continue to be so blindly arrogant, what awaits you...","I’m afraid it won’t be a great victory like today, but a fatal disaster!”","The God Clan team members were originally filled with joy. Everyone began to feel arrogant, thinking that the Devil army was only so-so. They were not","inferior to those Divine level geniuses and had the strength to earn a large","number of military merits.","And Huang Yueli’s words were like a bucket of cold water, pouring over them.","Everyone quivered and calmed down.","At this moment, they realized how unreasonable their excitement was.","If they had left Huang Yueli’s protection, it was impossible for them to replicate today’s battle results. And in the ever-changing battlefield, as long as there was a slight deviation in their judgement of the enemy’s strength, it would be fatal.","Thinking of this, Xuan Chaoyi broke out in a cold sweat. He felt a lingering fear in his heart.","“Yes... Yes, Matriarch Huang! Subordinate... This subordinate understands! We were indeed too complacent just now...”","Huang Yueli glanced at him indifferently, ” There are tens of thousands of devils in the army and even though my husband and I have killed the commander Ruijiang and cleared out many high levelled devils, but without these people, the impact on the battle strength of the tens of thousands of devils is limited! Don’t look at how you killed hundreds of Devils just now, that was all one by one! When the Devils reacted and sent thousands of troops to encircle and suppress them...Not to mention you guys, Moying and I can only flee for our lives!”","As the saying went, two fists could not fight four hands.","Huang Yueli had never had the bad habit of being blindly arrogant.","“This subordinate...This subordinate knows his mistake...” The God Clan soldiers could not even raise their heads.."]},{"number":4628,"title":"Chapter 4628: Returning to Blessed City (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4628: Returning to Blessed City (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli stopped there and didn’t say anything more,” Prepare to return to Blessed City.”","Xuan Chaoyi quickly stood up and gathered his team members.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying brought a group of people and secretly left the Devil Camp.","Blessed City, City Lord Manor.","Xuan Jiuling, who had been appointed as the general of the Blessed City coalition army, was sitting in the upper seat of the hall.","Below him was Meng Shurong, the city lord of Blessed City.","Further down, all the generals of Blessed City’s coalition army, except for a few people who had set up defenses outside, were gathered in the hall.","The atmosphere was very heavy.","Xuan Jiuling stroked his beard and said in a deep voice,” Commanders and Divine Guards, you are the backbone of our alliance army. All these years, it was all thanks to your bravery in killing the enemy at the front line that Blessed City was not captured by the Devils. You have also saved all the people of the Heaven Fox Continent.","“Today, I’m sure everyone knows why I’ve gathered everyone here. The army of Sky Devil Ruijiang has been at Blessed City for a few months. Our army has clashed with the Devil army several times, but they all ended in defeat.”","“What’s more, ten days ago, we gathered all the remaining troops and took advantage of the Devils’ unguarded situation to sneak attack their camp. We thought that this time, we would be absolutely safe. Even if we couldn’t completely annihilate the Devil army, we could still severely injure the enemy and obtain a great victory. But in the end...lt was still disappointing! Not only did they fail to win, but they also suffered heavy casualties.”","“Right now, our army only has around ten thousand soldiers left, while the mo army still has tens of thousands. In addition, the Sky Devil Ruijiang also had a unique secret technique to increase the combat strength of the entire army... What should we do next to protect Blessed City? Please share your thoughts.” Xuan Jiuling was filled with worry and anxiety.","As one of the top experts of the God Clan and an Eight-star Divine General, he had joined the coalition army when he was young. He had experienced countless battles. It could be said that he had a lot of combat experience and had experienced all kinds of situations.","However, he had never seen such a desperate situation before.","He had already commanded the alliance army to fight with the army of Sky","Devil Ruijiang so many times, but he had not gained an advantage even once!","Seeing that the number of allied forces was dwindling, if this continued, Blessed City would probably fall in a matter of days!","If he couldn’t defend Blessed City, the consequences would be unimaginable, and his reputation would be ruined here...","After Xuan Jiuling finished speaking, the hall fell into a deathly silence.","All the generals present lowered their heads and frowned, not saying a word.","Such meetings had been held several times in the City Lord’s Mansion recently.","In the beginning, everyone actively provided their own opinions and discussed a few specific battle plans, which were put into practice.","But who knew that the plan that they thought was foolproof would end up in a fiasco!","That was because the Devil army was truly too powerful!","In the face of absolute strength, any battle law or array formation technique was actually just a joke...","Especially that sneak attack battle ten days ago, even the peak Dao Profound","Realm Xuan Jiuling personally made a move and was heavily injured by Sky","Devil Ruijiang....","To be honest, most of the generals present were already in despair. They felt that it was already impossible for them to defeat the Devil army. Many people were even prepared to live and die with Blessed City.."]},{"number":4629,"title":"Chapter 4629: Returning to Blessed City (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4629: Returning to Blessed City (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xuan Jiuling waited for a while, but no one answered him.","He swept his gaze over everyone and found that they all had looks of despair. He could not help but feel a surge of anger. He stood up and slammed the table heavily.","“Enough, who are you all acting for? All of you, cheer up! Looking at you, do you think we’re going to lose? Do you think Blessed City will definitely fall? Was the Devil army that powerful? A mere Sky Devil Ruijiang scared the guts out of you?”","The appearance of a peak Dao Profound Realm powerhouse with a stern voice and expression was seriously very frightening.","The generals present felt guilty after being scolded by him, and they couldn’t even raise their heads.","‘ What are you waiting for?” Xuan Jiuling became even angrier. He suddenly pointed to the right side of the hall and called out.” Jing Shaoyuan, what are you waiting for?” I heard that in the battle ten days ago, you fought with the genius cultivator of the Devil Clan? What kind of strength did the other party have? Could it be that he’s even stronger than you, the number one genius of the White Tiger Race? Could it be that the Devils have such powerful experts other than Sky Devil Ruijiang?”","Jing Shaoyuan stood up immediately upon hearing his name.","During that battle, he treated Huang Yueli and Li Moying as devil experts and chased after them for a long distance.","She was also knocked out by Jun Sihan and had suffered serious injuries. She had not fully recovered until now.","However, he was completely unaware of this and thought that he was really injured by the Devils.","Recalling the scene at that time, he felt even more afraid. General Xuan, I... The two Devils that this subordinate encountered that day looked very young, but their strength was quite heaven-defying. They could even reach the strength of the divine geniuses of our God Clan..","As soon as he said this, the scene immediately became noisy.","“What is it? A Devil with god-level talent? That’s impossible, right?”","“Are you kidding me? What was the concept of a god-grade genius? They were peerless geniuses like Matriarch Huang and Young Lord Li! How could the Devils have such talent?”","” Young Master Jing, we know that you were not able to kill the Devil Clan’s cultivator and were even injured. You are indignant, but you can’t fabricate the truth like this...”","“That’s right. If the other party really has the strength of a divine level genius, how could you chase them so far?”","Jing Shaoyuan felt suffocated when he heard these discussions, and he almost vomited blood.","He still thought that his innate talent wasn’t bad and even if he couldn’t compare to Huang Yueli and Li Moying for the time being, but as long as he cultivated diligently, there might be a day where he could surpass the two of them.","But he had not expected that in the eyes of others, the gap between him and Huang Yueli was so huge!","He... He was also the number one genius of the White Tiger Race. How could he be as useless as they said!","Jing Shaoyuan wanted to stand up and defend himself, but the fact that he had been injured made it seem like he was trying to quibble.","He could only grit his teeth and say with a pale face,” I’m not exaggerating. Those two Devils are just like that. They’re terrifyingly strong!” I suspect that they are the clansmen secretly nurtured by Sky Devil Ruijiang to attack Blessed City. I didn’t expect to see through them! I wasn’t their match, but it was true that I chased them for more than ten miles because Jun Sihan of the Veracious Wyvern Clan was with me. If we hadn’t joined forces, I wouldn’t have been able to fight against those two Devils..”"]},{"number":4630,"title":"Chapter 4630: Returning to Blessed City (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4630: Returning to Blessed City (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Jun Sihan? He’s actually with you? Where was he? Where did he go now? Why didn’t he appear again after that battle?","Could it be that he has already...” Xuan Jiuling thought of Jun Sihan and frowned.","This young master of the Veracious Wyvern race had stayed in Blessed City for a period of time, but he had mysteriously disappeared afterward.","Xuan Jiuling was afraid that something had happened to him, so he had specially sent people to look for him, but he couldn’t find him.","Unexpectedly, she was with Jing Shaoyuan.","Jing Shaoyuan shook his head.” This...” I don’t know about that. At that time, we joined forces to resist the enemy, but the strength of those two geniuses of the Devil Clan was too strong. We were still unable to defeat them. I was knocked unconscious. As for Jun Sihan...He shouldn’t have been knocked unconscious because I haven’t seen him since I woke up. There aren’t any traces of blood nearby either. I guess he should have successfully escaped. As for why he didn’t return to Blessed City...","I don’t know.”","Xuan Jiuling frowned even more when he heard this.","Although the God Clan had split into 12 big families, each of them had their own way of doing things. On the surface, they all seemed to have the same status.","However, the Veracious Wyverns were still a little special. They were the most mysterious of the twelve families.","Jun Sihan had disappeared in Blessed City. If the Veracious Wyvern Clan were to pursue the matter with him, it would be hard for him to explain.","However, this worry only lingered in Xuan Jiuling’s heart for a few breaths before he threw it to the back of his mind.","“Forget it. We will discuss Jun Sihan’s whereabouts in the future. The most important thing now is to determine the next defensive plan. Everyone, share your opinions.”","Xuan Jiuling knew the severity of the situation. He understood that if Blessed","City fell, he, as the commander, would definitely be buried with it. At that time, whether the Veracious Wyvern Tribe pursued him or not would have nothing to do with him.","He repeated what he had just said.","However, there was still no response.","The current situation was already dangerous enough, and Jing Shaoyuan’s words had clearly increased their panic.","One Sky Devil Ruijiang was already strong enough to make people despair. According to Jing Shaoyuan, the Devils had two hidden masters who could easily beat Jing Shaoyuan and Jun Sihan!","This battle...Was there a need to continue fighting?","Xuan Jiuling saw that everyone was starting to cower in fear, and his anger grew.","City Lord Meng Shurong also saw that the situation was not good and hurriedly intervened.","“Alright, let me say a few words first. The current situation is already very obvious. It is almost impossible for us to fight against the Devil army. The only way is to defend and wait for the arrival of reinforcements. According to Divine General Xuan’s speculation, the reinforcements will arrive in about a month.","As long as we hold on until then, we will be able to turn the tables!”","After Meng Shurong finished speaking, the generals looked at each other, unconvinced.","One month...With the difference in strength between them and the mo army, defending for a month was simply a dream!","Moreover, even if reinforcements arrived...","They probably wouldn’t be able to fight against Ruijiang’s strengthened mo army.","No matter how he thought about it, this was a dead end!","Even Meng Shurong himself did not believe his own words. After saying that, he frowned.","At this moment, a series of hurried footsteps suddenly came from outside the meeting hall.","“Xuan...Divine General Xuan, Meng.... City Lord Meng, come out...Something big has happened!”"]},{"number":4631,"title":"Chapter 4631: Returning to Blessed City","paragraphs":["Chapter 4631: Returning to Blessed City","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The atmosphere in the meeting hall was originally very heavy.","Suddenly, someone ran in and shouted loudly, making everyone’s heart skip a beat.","Some of them who were not mentally strong almost fell to the ground.","‘ What’s going on?” Xuan Jiuling frowned and shouted. Why are you so surprised? Didn’t I tell you earlier that today’s meeting is of great importance and no one is allowed to disturb you?”","Along with his cold and stern voice, the pressure of a Dao Profound Realm powerhouse also followed and spread outside the hall.","The steward at the door gasped and stopped in his tracks.","“Xuan...Divine General Xuan, I didn’t mean to disturb your discussion, but...","Something big has really happened!”","The steward didn’t even catch his breath before he spoke impatiently.","Xuan Jiuling and Meng Shurong looked at each other in confusion.","“Ahem, Steward Jiang, come in first.” “Tell me clearly, what exactly happened?” Meng Shurong asked.","Xuan Jiuling’s pressure dissipated, and the steward immediately walked in quickly and bowed.","Without waiting for Xuan Jiuling to speak again, he said anxiously,” Just now, the Lan Divine Guard who was in charge of the defense on the city tower sent someone to report that there was a team of more than ten people. They were all from the God Clan. They came from the direction of the Devil Clan’s camp and have already arrived at the city. I wonder if we should open the city gate and let them in?”","When Xuan Jiuling heard this, he was slightly stunned.” Team? What team? Didn’t our alliance army give up on the frontline camp and retreat into the city? Who else is outside?”","Ever since their sneak attack on the Devil Clan camp ten days ago suffered a crushing defeat, Xuan Jiuling had already ordered all the troops to return to Blessed City in order to avoid greater losses.","This was because the number of soldiers left by the God Clan was too small. If they continued to fight on their own, they would probably not even need Sky Devil Ruijiang to personally take action. They would be defeated one by one. They might as well gather together and rely on Blessed City’s towering walls and powerful defensive formations to defend the city.","At this moment, there should only be a few scout teams still outside the city to gather information.","However, these scout squads all had special ways to contact the city, so they definitely did not need to send someone to report.","Steward Jiang bowed and replied,” General, the person outside the city gate claims to be Xuan Chaoyi, the divine guard of the Black Tortoise Clan. He said that he was ordered to lead a small team to the Devil Camp to carry out a secret mission. Now, he has completed the mission and returned...’","As soon as he said this, most of the generals present were confused.","However, Xuan Jiuling, Meng Shurong, and the others were shocked.","Xuan Jiuling couldn’t help but stand up from his seat.” What did you say?!” Xuan Chaoyi and the others had completed the mission? And... He even returned successfully? How is this possible? You guys...","Are you sure it’s Xuan Chaoyi himself?”","Others might not know what Xuan Chaoyi was up to, but Xuan Jiuling knew very well that Xuan Chaoyi’s team had left on a dangerous mission!","Finding out the exact information about the secret treasure in Sky Devil Ruijiang’s hands was simply a mission with hell difficulty.","With Xuan Chaoyi and the rest’s cultivation, they would definitely be killed instantly if they really came before Sky Devil Ruijiang.","Therefore, Xuan Jiuling had said from the beginning that he would let Xuan Chaoyi and the others scout around the Devil Camp.."]},{"number":4632,"title":"Chapter 4632: Returning to Blessed City (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4632: Returning to Blessed City (7)","I ranstator: Misty ctoua I ranstatlons?????? ealtor: Misty ctoua I ranstatlons","As long as he could gather information with reference value, even if he couldn’t see the artifact with his own eyes, he could still come back and report.","However, even so, Xuan Chaoyi and the others never returned after leaving Blessed City.","Almost a month had passed, but there was no news at all. None of the members of the team had successfully escaped.","Under such circumstances, it was almost certain that Xuan Chaoyi and the rest had failed their mission in the ever-changing battlefield. Moreover, the entire team had definitely been wiped out by the Devil army.","Regardless of whether the team members were killed on the spot or captured alive, they would still be unable to escape death in the end. It was impossible for them to return to Blessed City.","As Xuan Chaoyi was an expert among the younger generation of Xuan Jiuling’s clan, Xuan Jiuling was depressed for a while.","He didn’t expect Xuan Chaoyi to be alive and return at such a critical moment!","Moreover, he said that he had already completed the mission?","Xuan Jiuling was extremely excited. He walked to the bottom of the stairs in a few steps and stood in front of Steward Jiang, asking anxiously.","Xuan Jiuling’s Dark Force became more obvious as he got closer. Steward Jiang’s cultivation wasn’t high enough, so he felt pressured and took a few steps back.","“That... Divine General Xuan, the Lan Divine Guard, and the others were unable to confirm if it was the Dark Divine Guard himself, nor were they sure if the secret mission that the Dark Divine Guard mentioned was true. That’s why they asked me to come and report it...”","‘ That’s right. The Lan Divine Guard of the Heavenly Fox Clan only received the order to increase the number of members a few days ago. He really doesn’t know Xuan Chaoyi!” Meng Shurong also reacted.","During this period of time, the frontline outside Blessed City suffered heavy casualties. Many of the current generals were newly promoted or transferred from outside, so they were barely familiar with each other.","In order to prevent the Devils from taking advantage of this weakness, Xuan Jiuling personally ordered the generals on the city tower to be careful and not let go of any suspicious people.","“Divine General Xuan, City Lord Meng, look...How should we deal with this matter?”","Seeing that the two masters were silent, Steward Jiang was a little anxious and asked again.","Xuan Jiuling took a deep breath.” I’ll personally go to the city tower to take a look! Let’s go now. Lead the way!”","After saying that, he ignored the fact that the pre-war meeting was halfway through and directly strode out of the meeting hall.","The generals in the hall hadn’t spoken a word, but when they saw Xuan Jiuling suddenly leave, they all revealed surprised expressions and looked at each other.","“What’s going on? Why did the Mystic Divine General leave just like that? Who is this Xuan Chaoyi?”","‘ He seems to have been sent by the Mystic Divine General to train himself. I don’t know what’s going on. Why does the Mystic Divine General value him so much?”","“The city gates have been sealed off. Divine General Xuan had personally given the order not to allow anyone to enter the city. Are you going to break the rules of the army for his clansmen? Isn’t that too unfair and unconvincing?”","Meng Shurong’s face darkened when he heard the discussion.” Shut up!” he shouted. The Mystic Divine General has his own reasons for doing things. It’s not something you can casually discuss! Hurry up and follow me!”","Meng Shurong flicked his sleeves and left quickly.","He was probably the only one who knew why Xuan Jiuling was so agitated.","The Array Talisman in Ruijiang’s hands had always been a thorn in Xuan","Jiuling’s side.."]},{"number":4633,"title":"Chapter 4633: Returning to Blessed City (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4633: Returning to Blessed City (8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xuan Jiuling and Sky Devil Ruijiang had fought a few years ago, and their strength had always been on par.","If this time was like before, Xuan Jiuling could restrain Ruijiang, then the battle situation wouldn’t be so tragic.","However, Sky Devil Ruijiang had this artifact in his hands. This was the real reason why the difference in strength between the two armies was so huge.","If Xuan Chaoyi had really returned and completed his mission as he had said and found some useful information, it would definitely be great news for","Blessed City, which was already in a precarious situation.","Perhaps this was the key to turning defeat into victory.","No wonder Xuan Jiuling paid so much attention to him and personally went to the city tower to identify him.","After being reprimanded by Meng Shurong, the generals in the meeting hall realized that they had said something wrong. Although they were still confused, they did not dare to say anything else and hurriedly followed.","Xuan Jiuling’s footsteps were very fast. It didn’t take long for him to appear on the city tower.","When the Lan Divine Guard, who was in charge of setting up defenses, saw the arrival of the general, he hurriedly bowed.” Reporting to Divine General Xuan, just now, I...”","“Alright, cut the crap. Steward Jiang has already told me everything. Just point to where Xuan Chaoyi and the others are.” Xuan Jiuling waved his hand and asked anxiously.","The Lan Divine Guard had wanted to say more, but seeing Xuan Jiuling’s stern expression, he didn’t dare to be negligent. He hurriedly brought him to a city wall in the west and pointed down.","Divine General Xuan, please take a look. The Dark Divine Guards and the deployment he led are waiting below!”","Xuan Jiuling immediately walked to the wall, narrowed his eyes, and looked down.","In order to defend against the Devils ‘attack, the city walls of Blessed City were built very high, at least a hundred meters high.","Moreover, he had used the array to create a fog effect. A thick layer of clouds had formed in the middle of the city wall, surrounding the entire city.","From above, one could see the situation below, but those standing outside the city wall below could not see through this illusion array and see the people standing on the city tower clearly.","Xuan Jiuling recognized Xuan Chaoyi with just a glance.","He immediately nodded and said,” That’s right. This is the divine guard Xuan Chaoyi selected by my clan. I recognize him!” He did leave Blessed City after accepting the secret mission I gave him. Quickly let him in!”","After obtaining Xuan Jiuling’s approval, the Lan Divine Guard hurriedly nodded.” Yes, I’ll get someone to remove the defensive array and open the city gate...”","He commanded his soldiers and was about to follow Xuan Jiuling’s instructions.","Suddenly, an anxious voice came from behind Xuan Jiuling.” Wait! No, he couldn’t open the city gate. He absolutely couldn’t open the city gate! Stop it, Lan Divine Guard, stop it now! If the city gates are opened, Blessed City will definitely be destroyed!”","The Blue Guard was so frightened by these words that he felt a chill run down his spine and broke out in a cold sweat.","He hurriedly turned around and saw Jing Shaoyuan limping toward him.","Xuan Jiuling and Meng Shurong also heard the voice, and their faces darkened as they frowned at Jing Shaoyuan.","“Commander Jing, what do you mean? Do you have any objections?”","Jing Shaoyuan had just recovered from his injuries and was exhausted. He was already panting after running for a while, and his wounds were aching. However, he still forced himself to stand in front of the two superiors.. He braced himself and said,” Divine General Xuan, below...” There’s a Devil spy down there!”"]},{"number":4634,"title":"Chapter 4634: Returning to Blessed City (9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4634: Returning to Blessed City (9)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The word ‘spy’ was too sensitive.","Xuan Jiuling’s expression changed immediately.” What? What spy? Explain yourself! Xuan Chaoyi is a young warrior in my clan. He grew up in my clan and has many years of experience in the allied army. How could he be a spy of the Devils? Don’t talk nonsense!”","Jing Shaoyuan looked down at the city gate tower again, his expression growing more anxious.","“Divine General Xuan, this subordinate...l’m not lying, and I don’t have any intention of slandering the Mystic Divine Guards, but...However, in Xuan Chaoyi’s team, it was really...There are really two Devil spies, I... I’ve fought with them before. I know them!”","“What? Do you really have evidence to prove that there’s a spy down there? Which ones?” Meng Shurong asked with a frown.","Jing Shaoyuan pointed below.” It’s the two people standing behind Xuan Chaoyi, a man and a woman! They are the two Devil geniuses who fought with me back then. 1...1 definitely won’t be mistaken! Back then, when I joined forces with Jun Sihan, I was still defeated by the two of them. I was seriously injured and Jun Sihan’s life is still unknown! If the two of them sneak into the city, Blessed City will be finished!”","“What is it? You... Did you get the wrong person?”","As soon as he said that, everyone present became nervous.","Xuan Jiuling’s brows were tightly knitted together.” This...” How is this possible?”","Meng Shurong’s heart skipped a beat and he quickly looked down the city gate tower.","As expected, she saw the two ‘suspicious persons’.","Both of them were wearing cloaks that covered most of their faces. Their exact appearance could not be seen, but from the aura emitted from their bodies, they should be from the God Clan.","“Commander Jing, are you sure you didn’t make a mistake?” Meng Shurong asked in confusion. I think these two seem to be of the God Clan. I can’t feel the aura of the Devil Clan. Moreover, we can’t see what they look like from so far away. How do you know they are Devils?”","Jing Shaoyuan stomped his feet anxiously when he saw that his two superiors still refused to believe him.","“This subordinate will definitely not malign them. I have fought with them before and saw the spiritual weapons on their bodies. As for why they did not have the aura of the Devil Clan on them, then... There were many possibilities!","Who knows if they have any secret treasures to hide their auras?”","Meng Shurong and Xuan Jiuling frowned and didn’t say anything.","The generals who had followed behind had also arrived. When they heard the dispute between the two sides, someone could not help but interrupt.","“Commander Jing, Xuan Chaoyi is a divine guard of the God Clan! Could it be that he will come with the Devils? According to what you said, they... Could it be that they betrayed the alliance army?”","Jing Shaoyuan choked.” This...” This was hard to say. However, it was true that they had brought the Devils back. Divine General Xuan, please give the order as soon as possible to guard the city gates. It would be best if they were killed outside the city gates immediately! These two Devil Clan geniuses are extraordinary. If we allow them to continue growing, they will definitely become a huge threat. Why don’t we take this opportunity to kill them!”","Faced with Jing Shaoyuan’s solemn declaration, Xuan Jiuling’s brows were still tightly furrowed, and he was extremely conflicted.","Xuan Chaoyi was a junior in his clan. He knew Xuan Chaoyi’s character and was unwilling to believe that he would betray the alliance army.","Moreover, if Xuan Chaoyi really completed the mission, the information he brought back would be too important.. If they killed him by mistake, the entire battle would be reversed!"]},{"number":4635,"title":"Chapter 4635: Victory came too suddenly (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4635: Victory came too suddenly (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","However, Jing Shaoyuan’s concerns were not without reason.","He was also thinking about the alliance army.","During this period of time, as the battle between the two armies became more and more intense, both sides had sent a large number of spies and scouts to the enemy.","In the past, there had been cases where Devils disguised themselves as humans and tried to sneak into Blessed City. There had also been cases where the soldiers sent by the alliance army were brainwashed by the Devils and sent back to Blessed City, ruining the battle that was bound to be won at the critical moment.","As a Divine General who had experienced hundreds of battles, Xuan Jiuling had seen such situations countless times over the years. Therefore, he was very cautious. Ever since he decided to retreat to Blessed City, he had issued a strict order to prohibit anyone from entering or leaving.","He didn’t even let anyone open the door when some refugees who hadn’t entered Blessed City in time came to call.","It was not that he did not sympathize with the homeless refugees, but no one could prove that they were not spies of the Devil Clan. For the sake of the people of the entire city, he had no choice but to make a choice.","This time, Xuan Jiuling had agreed to let Xuan Chaoyi and the others enter the city because he knew Xuan Chaoyi and also because Xuan Chaoyi’s mission was very important. Otherwise, he would have chased them away long ago.","Xuan Jiuling frowned and thought for a long time, but he couldn’t make a final decision.","The generals who had gathered heard the conversation between Jing Shaoyuan and Xuan Jiuling and quickly began to discuss.","“This... Divine General Xuan, I think Commander Jing’s words are reasonable! At this moment, Sky Devil Ruijiang was probably worried that they would not be able to attack Blessed City. The possibility of them sending spies was extremely high! It’s really too suspicious for Xuan Chaoyi and the others to return at this time...”","‘ That’s right, Divine General Xuan. Think about it. The Dark Divine Guards have been missing for almost a month. They didn’t come back sooner or later, but they came back when Blessed City was sealed. This...lsn’t this too much of a coincidence?”","“Even if Xuan Chaoyi is the genius of your clan, you can’t let all the citizens in the city take such a huge risk for him, right?”","“You can’t say that, right? The Mystic Divine General had just said that the Mystic Divine Guards had accepted a secret mission to leave the city. Now that he has returned, he might have obtained some crucial information!”","“What other crucial information can there be? Can he snatch the secret treasure of Sky Devil Ruijiang?”","‘ No matter how valuable the information is, it’s impossible to kill Sky Devil Ruijiang. On the contrary, letting spies sneak into the city might cause the entire Blessed City to fall!”","‘ But Xuan Chaoyi is a comrade who fought alongside us. Are we going to give up on him just like that?”","‘ There’s nothing we can do about it. He’s already working for the Devils. How can he be pitied?”","The generals discussed animatedly, expressing their own opinions.","Although a small number of people sympathized with Xuan Chaoyi and felt that he should be allowed in, more people chose to support Jing Shaoyuan.","As a member of the alliance army, they had long disregarded life and death. Not only did they not care about their own lives, but they also did not care about the lives of others.","As long as it was for the final victory of the battle, it was reasonable to sacrifice","Xuan Chaoyi and the others.","Xuan Jiuling, as the general, naturally understood this principle.","He stared at the small group of people under the city gate tower and was silent for a long time. However, be careful not to injure them. Just warn them and let them leave.”","In the end, he still gave the order.."]},{"number":4636,"title":"Chapter 4636: Victory came too suddenly (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4636: Victory came too suddenly (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The situation in Blessed City was too tense.","He could not tolerate any more accidents or variables.","With the current military strength and situation, he had to defend Blessed City for an entire month. He absolutely could not take any risks!","As for Xuan Chaoyi...","It was really a pity.","Xuan Jiuling sighed deeply and closed his eyes. He then waved his hand and ordered the soldiers on the city gate tower to shoot arrows down.","As he gave the order, the crisp sound of the bowstring rang out continuously. Hundreds of arrows with pure white feathers were shot out at the same time, shooting down the city tower.","Xuan Chaoyi and the others who were waiting not far from the city gates were already waiting for the gates to be lowered, but to their surprise, what they received was a large number of arrows instead and they were all caught off","guai u.","“Damn it, this...What’s going on? Xuan Chaoyi, didn’t you say that you came out on a top-secret mission from Divine General Xuan? Regardless of whether Blessed City has been completely sealed off, Divine General Xuan will definitely open the door for you as long as he sees you return!”","Facing the arrows that rained down like a heavy downpour, Huang Yueli took out a shield from her space and placed it on her head, easily blocking it.","The divine weapons that shot arrows from the city walls were only at the Profound Meaning realm. In addition, these arrows were not meant to take their lives. They were just a warning. Therefore, everyone in the team blocked them relatively calmly. Only a few people were scratched.","But even so, Huang Yueli was still very surprised as she brought her men and retreated a few miles. After dodging the attack, she looked for Xuan Chaoyi to question him unhappily.","However, Xuan Chaoyi was also very surprised.","“This... I don’t know what’s going on either. Logically speaking, things shouldn’t be like this. Not only is the Divine General an elder of our clan, but he has also personally taught me before. He is also anxious to know the whereabouts of the array talisman. No matter what, he...He shouldn’t have chased us away, right?”","As soon as he said this, the team members all agreed.","Obviously, no one expected to encounter such a thing.","Huang Yueli could tell that he wasn’t lying and couldn’t help but frown,” This is really strange...Could it be that something happened to Xuan Jiuling?”","Li Moying shook his head,” That’s impossible. Heavenly Devil Rui Jiang has already been killed by us. None of the remaining fiends can threaten Divine General Dao Profound, unless there’s an accident within the alliance army.”","“Within the alliance army? What could have happened? You ‘an City is about to be breached. I don’t believe that there’s anyone in the alliance army who would deliberately cause trouble.” Huang Yueli narrowed her eyes.","Although the twelve great god clans had their own plans and were not united with each other, the alliance army was still relatively united.","If they restrained each other when fighting against the demons, they would definitely become the public enemy of the entire country.","Huang Yueli felt that no one would be so silly.","“How about... It’s just that Xuan Chaoyi didn’t make things clear just now. The people on the city gate tower didn’t understand what you meant, or they didn’t tell Divine General Xuan about you..","Huang Yueli pondered for a long while and felt that this was the most likely reason.","She looked at Xuan Chaoyi and said,” How about this? Go to the city gate again and tell them your identity and mission in detail. Make sure you’re clear and tell them to report it to Divine General Xuan!”","“But, didn’t this subordinate make it very clear just now?” Xuan Chaoyi was stunned..” Even if I say it again, I’m afraid...”"]},{"number":4637,"title":"Chapter 4637: Victory came too suddenly (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4637: Victory came too suddenly (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xuan Chaoyi seemed to have thought of something as he raised his head to look at Huang Yueli,” Matriarch Huang, Young Master Li, why don’t the two of you go to the city gates personally and explain it clearly to the Divine Guards guarding the city? With your status, I’m afraid no one will dare to lock you outside the city...”","This question had been bothering Xuan Chaoyi ever since they arrived at Blessed City.","Originally, he thought that as long as he followed these two peerless geniuses, he would be able to enter the city smoothly.","Who knew that when they neared Blessed City, Huang Yueli and Li Moying were still maintaining their disguise in the devil camp, unwilling to clean up and even suggested that he be in charge of negotiating with the divine soldiers on the city gate tower.","Whereas Huang Yueli and Li Moying were just like two unremarkable little soldiers, secretly following behind him.","Hearing Xuan Chaoyi’s question, Huang Yueli raised her brows,” Because...We don’t want to expose our identities.”","“Ah? Why?” Xuan Chaoyi was stunned.","All the team members present were also shocked and stared at the two of them with their mouths agape.","Huang Yueli’s expression was indifferent as she explained,” I believe you guys should have heard about it right? My husband and I sneaked out from the Sacred Phoenix Race because the Sacred Phoenix Race did not agree to our marriage. Hence, to put it bluntly, we eloped...” Xuan Chaoyi was speechless.","The other team members were speechless.","It wasn’t that they hadn’t heard of this rumor before, but everyone treated it as gossip and didn’t take it to heart.","Especially after they accidentally bumped into Huang Yueli and Li Moying in the devil territory, they didn’t believe in this kind of nonsensical Jianghu rumor.","All the team members felt that Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s disappearance was because they had received the secret order from the Allied Armies","Headquarters and had secretly infiltrated the Devil Race’s inner circle...","The so-called elopement was made up by some boring people who liked to gossip.","In the end, they really eloped!","Huang Yueli ignored their shocked expressions as she continued,” So it’s not suitable for the two of us to appear in Blessed City and we don’t want to expose our identities. When everyone enters Blessed City later, don’t expose our identities. You’re responsible for handing over Rui Jiang’s magic crystals and saying that he was killed by a mysterious expert. You only saw Rui Jiang’s corpse and didn’t see the person who killed him. Do you remember?”","This was what she had discussed with Li Moying from the start.upd?t? ?t ?ew?o?el. ?rg","That was why they disguised themselves as normal members and followed behind Xuan Chaoyi and the others.","Xuan Chaoyi’s forehead was covered in cold sweat as he looked at Huang Yueli, wanting to say something but hesitating.","Huang Yueli saw that he was feeling uncomfortable from holding it in so she raised her brows and asked: ” Captain Xuan, do you have anything else to say? The task I gave you is very simple. Don’t tell me you can’t even do this? If anyone says anything, don’t blame me and my husband for being rude to him!” Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s deterrence was sufficient.","Although Huang Yueli had said it in a joking tone, but it still made all the team members present tremble as they tried their best to express their loyalty.","Among them, only Xuan Chaoyi was still hesitant. After holding it in for a long time, he finally asked the question in his heart.","“That... Matriarch Huang, Young Master Li, actually...Actually, you don’t have to continue hiding your tracks. Even if the two of you really eloped, as long as you hand over the magic stones to the Allied Armies, it means that you killed Sky Devil Rui Jiang.. The Allied Armies headquarters will definitely stand on your side!”"]},{"number":4638,"title":"Chapter 4638: Victory came too suddenly (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4638: Victory came too suddenly (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xuan Chaoyi paused for a moment as he looked at Huang Yueli’s expression. He then continued: ” Although the Elders of the various families are powerful, but who would not give face to the Allied Armies Headquarters? With your contributions this time, it is more than enough for the Allied Armies headquarters to arrange your marriage...’","The Allied Armies itself did not participate in the disputes between the major families.","It was fine if they were ordinary Divine Soldiers and Divine Guards, but those who were able to enter the Allied Armies headquarters had to swear to the","Heavenly Dao to abandon their family’s position and remain neutral forever.","Hence, the grudge between Sacred Phoenix Clan and Cloudy Qilin Clan was not considered a matter in the Allied Armies headquarters at all.","On the contrary, the two of them had the strength to kill Devils at the peak of the Sky Devi realm at such a young age. This was great news for the Allied Armies!","They would probably have to worship the two of them!","It was not a big deal to come out and help them solve a little trouble.","Even if Sacred Phoenix Clan and Cloudy Qilin Clan were still unwilling to agree,","Huang Yueli and Li Moying could still officially get married in the Allied Armies headquarters and similarly obtain the entire Divine Realm’s recognition and blessings.","With their talent and strength, if they stayed in the Allied Armies headquarters, they would still be peerless geniuses that were worshipped by the stars.","When Huang Yueli heard that, she smiled at Xuan Chaoyi,” I’m also very clear about what you said...”","“Then why did you..","“We just think that eloping is fun. We don’t want to go back yet.” Huang Yueli continued smiling.","Xuan Chaoyi was speechless.","The other team members were speechless.","What?! Was eloping fun?","Divine level geniuses were really so willful!","One was the Sacred Phoenix Clan’s current clan leader while the other was the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s future clan leader. Such a high position with great power was sufficient to cause a bloody storm. There were even some clans where blood-flowing massacres had occurred for the sake of the position of the successor. There were even quite a number of blood brothers and father and son killing each other.","For the position of clan leader, how many people would even sell their conscience to the Devils!","But what about these two?","She actually abandoned her position as the clan leader and eloped?","Furthermore, even though they knew that they could obtain the backing of the Allied Armies, they didn’t have any intention of asking the Allied Armies headquarters to intercede for them.","Why?","Could it be that they still wanted those stubborn Grand Elders in the clan to beg them to return?","Huang Yueli looked at everyone’s expression as though they had been struck by lightning and couldn’t help but laugh,” Alright, I was just joking with you guys. We just have some matters to attend to and can’t go back to our clan now so we don’t want to waste time in the Allied Armies. In order to avoid trouble, I decided to hide my identity.”","After the matter in Blessed City was settled, she planned to follow Li Moying to","Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s cave dwelling.","She had made an appointment with Saint Iniquitous Shadow to bring Li Moying back together.","Later on, a series of things happened and he almost forgot about it.","It was only when he was in Sky Devil Rui Xiang’s cave dwelling and talking about the evil cultivation method with King Xiang that he remembered this. Now that he remembered, he definitely had to make a trip over. However, they were visiting the cave abode of the Sorcerers. If they were to get involved with the Allied Armies this time and people knew that they had made a great contribution, there would definitely be a group of people surrounding them. With so many pairs of eyes watching, it would be difficult for them to escape.","It was better to keep a low profile from the beginning.","In any case, the credit for killing Rui Jiang could not be snatched away by others. It would not be too late to claim it in the future.","Huang Yueli made up her mind as she urged Xuan Chaoyi,” Don’t think too much about it. Hurry up and call someone to open the door. The sun will set soon..”"]},{"number":4639,"title":"Chapter 4639: Victory came too suddenly (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4639: Victory came too suddenly (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xuan Chaoyi didn’t dare to be negligent. He quickly agreed and led his team members back to Blessed City’s city gate tower.","“Open the door! Who was the guard on duty today? Why didn’t you help me inform Divine General Xuan? I’m Three-star Divine Guard Xuan Chaoyi. I left Blessed City under Divine General Xuan’s secret order. I have important information that I have to personally inform Divine General Xuan. If you don’t report it, it will delay the military’s plans. Can you bear the consequences?”","Seeing that there was no movement from the city tower, Xuan Chaoyi became anxious. When he called at the door, his tone became less polite.","Now that he had already acknowledged himself as Huang Yueli’s subordinate, it was fine if he was locked outside but if Matriarch Huang was neglected because of this, how could that be allowed?","“Open the door, hurry up and open the door!”","Waves of anxious shouts seemed to be unable to move the guards on the city gate tower.","The more Xuan Chaoyi thought about it, the more he felt that something wasn’t quite right and was just about to go back and report to Huang Yueli.","Unexpectedly, a cold voice suddenly came from the city tower.” Xuan Chaoyi, as a member of the Black Tortoise Clan and a Divine Guard of the Allied Armies, you’re actually afraid of death and have joined the Devil Race. Now, you even dare to bring the Devil Race here to call on us. You want to sneak into Blessed City?!” Do you really think everyone in the city is a fool? You’re simply a disgrace to the Allied Armies!”","The voice sounded familiar, but Xuan Chaoyi couldn’t remember who it was.","On the other hand, Huang Yueli blinked her eyes as she said in astonishment:","This is... Jing Shaoyuan? He has returned to Blessed City safely...”","Back then on the Devil race battlefield, Jing Shaoyuan chased after her and Li Moying and didn’t let them go. In the end, they had no choice but to join forces with Jun Sihan and knocked Jing Shaoyuan out.","The situation had been urgent, and the two of them had disguised themselves as Devils, so they couldn’t send Jing Shaoyuan back.","Jun Sihan was also in a hurry to enter the Devil territory to find his son.","So, they had no choice but to drag the unconscious Jing Shaoyuan to a deserted corner and hide him.","Huang Yueli was still a little worried that if this fellow was discovered by the devil race, he would lose his life accidentally.","It seemed that Jing Shaoyuan was still lucky.","“Commander Jing?” Xuan Chaoyi was stunned for a moment.” Commander Jing is one of the most outstanding Divine Guards in our Allied Armies. I’ve always looked up to him! He... Why did he say that about me? How do I look like a Devil spy?","Although Jing Shaoyuan was petty and jealous, he had his own strengths.","He had been cultivating hard and had been the vanguard in battle. He had made many military achievements and had been stationed in Blessed City for many years, so he had a lot of prestige in the local military camp.","” Commander Jing, you...” Xuan Chaoyi was confused when he heard that Jing Shaoyuan was on the tower.” Commander Jing, you... How could you have such a misunderstanding? As a warrior of the Black Tortoise Race, how could I surrender to the Devils and bring shame to the Divine General? What I said is the truth. Please immediately report this matter to Divine General Xuan...","“You’re still trying to quibble?” Jing Shaoyuan snorted. To tell you the truth, Divine General Xuan already knows about your matter! He clearly told me that there were only 18 people in the team. Why did there be two more people when they returned?”","Hearing this, Xuan Chaoyi choked.","There were two more people...of course it was Huang Yueli and Li Moying.."]},{"number":4640,"title":"Chapter 4640: Victory came too suddenly (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4640: Victory came too suddenly (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","But thinking of what Huang Yueli said earlier, he couldn’t explain it honestly. ” Commander Jing, ” Xuan Chaoyi hesitated for a moment before coming up with an excuse.” So you suspect me of defecting to the enemy because I don’t have the right number of people in my team?” he asked loudly. You’re really mistaken. There are two more people in my team because I saved two heavily injured soldiers on the way. My team is definitely filled with gods...” “They’re all from the god clan... Are you sure?” Jing Shaoyuan sneered.","“Of course I’m sure...","Before Xuan Chaoyi could finish his words, Jing Shaoyuan interrupted him. “What about the two people behind you? Are they also from the God Clan?” “Of course...","“You’re still spouting nonsense!” Jing Shaoyuan’s voice became sharper.” The two people behind you...They were clearly Devils! I fought with them on the battlefield ten days ago. They are not only Devils, but also the top experts of the younger generation of Devils!”","Jing Shaoyuan narrowed his eyes.” Xuan Chaoyi,” he snapped.” The Divine","General is right here. Why don’t you tell us what you did in the Devil camp?” Why did you bring the two Devils back to Blessed City? Are you trying to help the Devils take down Blessed City when the Allied Armies is weak?”","Xuan Chaoyi’s eyes widened. He was completely dumbfounded by the question.","He had never expected that Jing Shaoyuan would actually recognise Huang Yueli and Li Moying as devils...","No, they had even fought on the battlefield..","Initially when Huang Yueli and the rest followed the Devil Race to battle, Xuan Chaoyi and the rest were treated as captives and locked up in the tent, totally not knowing what happened on the battlefield, let alone knowing about the exchange of blows between both parties.","He did not expect that he was treated as a Devil spy because of this...","After Xuan Chaoyi understood this point, he had no idea as he subconsciously turned to look at Huang Yueli.","In this situation, he felt that he could not explain it clearly with his mouth alone.","When Huang Yueli heard Jing Shaoyuan’s voice, she had already reacted and didn’t say a word, thinking about what to do next.","If they had known that Jing Shaoyuan was on the city gate tower, they would have changed into a disguise before coming over.","Unfortunately, they had already been recognized by Jing Shaoyuan.","Besides, the two of them were not the ones who had fought with Jing Shaoyuan, so there was no way to explain it clearly.","The only way to make the guards on the city gate tower believe that they were not Devil spies and let them in was to reveal their true identities.","However, if it was possible, she really did not want to be exposed so quickly.","As for the Saint Iniquitous Shadow...","Suddenly, Huang Yueli felt a weight on her shoulders.","Li Moying held her slender shoulders and pulled her into his embrace. He lowered his head and whispered into her ear,” Forget it, we can’t implicate","Xuan Chaoyi and the rest. Let’s send them back to the city first and explain the Devil Army’s matters clearly.” Even if the Allied Armies headquarters sends someone over, it will take a few days. It shouldn’t be difficult for us to slip away early. ”","Huang Yueli thought for a moment and nodded her head,” Alright, Husband,","I’ll listen to you.”","“Patriarch Huang, Young Master Li, the two of you are...Do you have an idea?” Xuan Chaoyi had been waiting at the side for a while. He raised his head and looked at them.","Huang Yueli waved her hand at him,” Alright, rest for a while. I’ll talk to Jing","Shaoyuan..”"]},{"number":4641,"title":"Chapter 4641: Victory came too suddenly (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4641: Victory came too suddenly (7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hearing this, Xuan Chaoyi felt relieved and quickly retreated to the side.","Huang Yueli took a few steps forward and came to the front of the group as she raised her head to look in the direction of the city tower.","The city tower was really very high, and it was surrounded by a thick fog condensed by an array. Ordinary people standing below the city tower could not see the situation above at all.","However, not only was Huang Yueli’s cultivation outstanding, she was also proficient in arrays. After forming a few hand seals and using her Heavenly Piercing Eye Technique to take a closer look, she still saw the person on the city gate tower.","Jing Shaoyuan hadn’t lied. Xuan Jiuling was really on the city gate tower.","Apart from them, there was also a large pile of Heart Profound Realm and Dao Profound Realm martial artists. Looks like the entire Blessed City’s generals were pretty much all gathered.","She had not expected that when she and Li Moying were Gods, they would be surrounded wherever they went. Now that they had disguised themselves as Devils, they were still treated so well.","When they saw the two of them appear, the entire Blessed City began to","prepare for battle.","Huang Yueli gave a faint smile and said: ” Commander Jing, long time no see! How are your injuries? I remember that at that time, more than half of your ribs were broken, and your leg was also fractured. Now... Can you stand up now?”","“You... Damn Devil thief, it’s really you...!”","Although Jing Shaoyuan was no longer in a wheelchair, he was still limping.","Hearing Huang Yueli’s ridicule, he was so angry that he almost spat out a mouthful of blood, wishing he could personally rush down and tear the Devil Race that had injured him and caused him to lose all his face into two halves.","Fortunately, he remembered in time that he could not beat him...","“It seems that you know that you can’t hide it anymore!” Let me tell you, no matter how much you pretend, you can’t pretend to be a god! Hurry up and get lost!”","Jing Shaoyuan wanted to shoot at the two Devils below him.","However, Xuan Jiuling had given him a strict order not to act rashly. He was afraid that the Devils would use the two of them as bait and that there would be some trap waiting for them.","Huang Yueli was scolded by him but her face didn’t show any anger as she continued to smile: ” I am a genuine god race. Since when was I pretending? Jing Shaoyuan, is your eyesight as bad as before?”","“What past? Don’t speak as if you know me. This Divine Guard...”","Jing Shaoyuan was so angry that his lungs were about to explode. He glared at the Devil girl below, his eyes almost spewing fire.","However, the next moment, he was stunned on the spot.","That was because the young girl below the city gate tower had smeared something on her face a few times and wiped it with her sleeve. When she raised her head again, her face had changed...lt was a face that he was extremely familiar with, a face that he could recognize even if he turned into ashes!","“Huang...Huang Yueli?!” Jing Shaoyuan was so shocked that he couldn’t help but scream.","Huang Yueli’s expression was indifferent as she nodded her head,” That’s right, it’s me. I didn’t expect that you wouldn’t recognize me after not seeing me for a while. Hurry up and let me and my husband in!”","“You... You...","Jing Shaoyuan’s eyes widened, and he was tongue-tied. For a moment, he couldn’t even speak.","How could he have imagined that this ‘Devil race’ young lady below was actually the peerless genius Huang Yueli who had trampled him, the White Tiger Race’s number one genius, under her feet several times!","And from her tone, the man behind her...Could it be Li Moying?","How was this possible?"]},{"number":4642,"title":"Chapter 4642: Jaw Dropping Shock (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4642: Jaw Dropping Shock (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Didn’t the two of them claim to have eloped?","How could he suddenly appear in the territory of the demons?","Jing Shaoyuan felt like he was in a bad mood and was in disbelief.","The matter of Huang Yueli and Li Moying secretly leaving the Sacred Phoenix Continent, that bunch of Sacred Phoenix Race Elders had initially tried their best to conceal it.","It was not easy to abduct the two god grade geniuses back but not long after, the two of them ran away. If this matter were to be spread out, the Sacred Phoenix Race would lose all their face.","Moreover, Huang Yueli was still the Sacred Phoenix Race’s Patriarch.","Even the clan leader had eloped..","This was truly a rare piece of news that only appeared once in thousands of years in the Twelve Continents!","Unfortunately, there was no such thing as an impenetrable wall.","Not long after Huang Yueli and Li Moying left, Cloudy Qilin Clan sent people over.","A god grade genius ‘young lord was abducted by a Sacred Phoenix Clan. After Cloudy Qilin Clan’s people returned from the Floating Sea, the more they thought about it, the more indignant they became. Even the clan’s few grand elders who had always been reclusive were alarmed.","The higher-ups of the clan had a meeting to discuss. If they were to suffer this loss, they could forget about raising their heads in the entire twelve continents of the Divine Realm in the future. Moreover, they might even be laughed at by the Sacred Phoenix Race for tens of thousands of years!","No, she must snatch Li Moying back.","Hence, Cloudy Qilin Clan sent a team led by Clan Leader Li Shihong to come knocking on the door to demand for the Sacred Phoenix Clan’s people.","The Sacred Phoenix Race naturally wasn’t willing to show weakness. Not to mention that Huang Yueli and Li Moying had already sneaked away, even if they were still around, they wouldn’t let them off so easily.","Both sides insisted on their own words and refused to give in. Soon, the quarrel escalated into an armed conflict.","Originally, the Sacred Phoenix Continent was the Sacred Phoenix Race’s territory. Making a move here, Cloudy Qilin Clan would not be able to gain an advantage.","But this time, in order to snatch Li Moying back, Cloudy Qilin Clan had actually dispatched two Life Profound Realm Grand Elders!","The moment a Profound Life Realm expert appeared, the Sacred Phoenix Race immediately fell into a disadvantageous position.","Under the circumstances, Huang Tianhao who was the acting Clan Leader had no choice but to reveal the truth, Huang Yueli and Li Moying had secretly left Sacred Phoenix Continent a month ago! He even said that unless the two families agreed to their marriage, he did not plan to come back!","The Cloudy Qilin Clan did not believe it at first so no one would believe such a thing.","There was actually someone who would give up the position of clan leader for a man? How was this possible?","But the Sacred Phoenix Clan insisted that this was the truth of the matter. As time passed, Cloudy Qilin Clan had no choice but to accept this fact.","After all, if Huang Yueli and Li Moying were still in the Sacred Phoenix Continent and their families were fighting, they wouldn’t be hiding right? He had disappeared until now, so he could only run away...","This matter was a very shameful matter to the Sacred Phoenix Clan and Cloudy Qilin Clan. Hence, the two clans wanted to keep this a secret without prior agreement.","But unfortunately, when they had a conflict, it was too big of a fuss. All the big families had sent people to the scene to mediate or watch. Naturally, this secret could not be kept.","This was the most popular gossip among the people. Without any effort, it spread throughout the twelve continents in an extremely short time. Even the alliance army generals who had been stationed in You ‘an City had heard of it.","So when they heard Jing Shaoyuan call out Huang Yueli’s name, everyone was shocked.","Even Xuan Jiuling couldn’t sit still anymore. He strode to the city gate tower and looked down.","As expected, the young lady dressed in an ordinary soldier’s uniform at the city gate was shockingly Huang Yueli!"]},{"number":4643,"title":"Chapter 4643: Jaw Dropping Shock (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4643: Jaw Dropping Shock (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","That exquisitely sculpted and perfect face was enough to make people remember it once they saw it.","Xuan Jiulinz recognized it at a glance.","“You... Are you really Huang Yueli?!”","Hearing Xuan Jiuling’s voice, Huang Yueli smiled,” Lord Divine General, so Jing Shaoyuan didn’t lie to me. You’re really on the city gate tower? That’s good. Please open the city gate and let us in. On the way here, we’ve stayed up all night without resting.”","Xuan Jiuling’s heart was filled with astonishment. He frowned, unable to understand what was going on.","He had also heard about Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s elopement.","However, how did these two people run into the fiend race’s territory?","If it was to train himself by fighting the demons, he could totally join the alliance army directly?","Just as he was hesitating, Jing Shaoyuan came over and whispered, “Divine General, this...” What should he do? In fact, this subordinate was still very suspicious of their identities. How could Patriarch Huang and the others go to the Devil Race? Even if he discovered some mystic realm and went to train, there was no reason for him to mix in the fiend race’s military camp, right?","Not to mention, they really fought with me back then and even attacked me so ruthlessly...”","Hearing Jing Shaoyuan’s words, some of the generals were puzzled.","“That’s right. Commander Jing is right. If she said she was Patriarch Huang, did that mean she was Patriarch Huang? Just based on her face? This subordinate heard that demons can use secret techniques to disguise themselves and disguise themselves as others. It’s much more realistic than our god race’s disguise technique! This place is so far away from the city gate, so I can’t see clearly at all...”","“That’s right, I also know this secret technique. Last time when we were setting up defenses in the White Tiger Continent, our camp was even tricked. Mystic","Divine General, don’t trust her so easily. If you’re deceived, you’ll be in trouble!” “Yes, yes. It’s never too much to be cautious in such matters.”","Xuan Jiuling nodded slightly.” Alright, everyone. I understand what you mean.” You’re all right. Given the current situation, we really can’t trust others easily. However, it’s one thing for the demons to impersonate others, but it’s not so easy to impersonate Patriarch Huang and Young Lord Li.”","Finished speaking, he cleared his throat and raised his voice. He said to Huang Yueli who was below the city gate tower: ” Little lass below, you said that you are Huang Yueli herself. Can you produce any evidence?”","Huang Yueli was slightly startled but she quickly understood.","Xuan Jiuling had always been known for being cautious, so it was not surprising that he would make such a request.","Lord Divine General, what evidence do you want?” she replied indifferently.","Xuan Jiuling replied: ” As everyone knows, the Sacred Phoenix Race’s young tribe leader Huang Yueli is not only a god grade genius that only appears once every ten thousand years, but she has also subdued an ancient phoenix that has already disappeared from the Divine Realm for a hundred thousand years.","She can be said to be the Divine Realm’s Heaven’s Chosen One! If you are really Huang Yueli, please release your phoenix and let everyone take a look.”","Hearing this request, Huang Yueli was instantly speechless.","“This... Cough cough...’","If it was a few months ago, there would naturally be no problem.","Summoning little Wang Cai did not take much effort, it was just the lifting of a finger.","However, she had already left little Wang Cai in the Perched Phoenix Canyon, where could she conjure another phoenix for everyone to see?"]},{"number":4644,"title":"Chapter 4644: Jaw Dropping Shock (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4644: Jaw Dropping Shock (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Furthermore, Huang Yueli had no way to explain to Xuan Jiuling and the rest.","The little phoenix had not disappeared earlier or later, but it had disappeared when others needed the little phoenix to prove it. Who would believe her explanation?","Moreover, Little Phoenix had always been her trump card. Now that her trump card was gone, she could not tell others about this matter and expose her own shortcomings. If she really did so, it would definitely be courting death!","Xuan Jiuling was on the city gate tower and when he saw Huang Yueli’s hesitant look, his heart thumped as he secretly felt that things were not good.","Could it be that Huang Yueli below...Was it really fake?","He even had to be careful. Otherwise, the entire You ‘an City might have been buried by him...","“What’s wrong? Can’t you summon the Ancient Phoenix? In that case, you are indeed not Huang Yueli herself! The audacious fiend race actually dared to impersonate the Sacred Phoenix Race’s patriarch. Simply courting death! Men, release the arrows!”","With Xuan Jiuling’s order, countless arrows on the city gate tower were already aimed downwards.","Huang Yueli quivered as she hurriedly shouted: ” Wait! Stop! What are you all so anxious for? Didn’t I say that I can’t produce any evidence?”","When the divine soldiers on the city gate tower heard this, their movements paused and they helplessly turned to look at Xuan Jiuling and the others.","Without Xuan Jiuling’s strict orders, they wouldn’t dare to act rashly.","Jing Shaoyuan frowned and sneered. Then where is your evidence? Huang Yueli only needed a blink of an eye to summon the phoenix! I saw it with my own eyes!”","Huang Yueli explained indifferently: ” My Phoenix ate an unknown fire attribute fruit halfway and entered a secluded cultivation state. Now I can’t let it out. However...”","“Hehe, who are you trying to fool with such a lie? Did he really think that everyone was a fool? You don’t have a phoenix, so of course you can’t release it. As a demon, where can you contract a phoenix? Stop talking nonsense. Hurry up...”","Jing Shaoyuan suddenly stopped mid-sentence.","He widened his eyes and was tongue-tied as he looked at the huge phantom that suddenly appeared in front of him.","An ancient Qilin Divine Beast covered in light purple scales appeared in front of everyone. It was originally only as tall as a person, but after it appeared, it quickly grew in size with the wind. In the blink of an eye, it had become a huge Divine Beast that was dozens of meters tall.","The Qilin raised its neck and slammed its front claws on the ground, causing the ground to shake.","Even the people on the city gate tower felt their hearts tighten.","Even though everyone knew that the city walls that had been reinforced by the array would not collapse just because of this, they could not help but tremble when they felt the ancient and rich energy from the ancient divine beast in front of them.","Huang Yueli’s sentence was interrupted by Jing Shaoyuan as she slowly floated over from the city gate tower.",". However, my husband’s little Qilin isn’t cultivating. It’s the same if I let my husband release it. What do you think?”","Cheng... Success!","Why not?","Who dared to say that?","The two people below were the true upper echelons of the 12 continents of the Shen clan. Their status was so high that even Xuan Jiuling, who was a Divine General, couldn’t compare to them.","Who dared to lock them outside the city gate tower?","Quick, open the city gates and invite Clan Leader Huang and Young Master Li in!” Xuan Jiuling snapped back to his senses and hurriedly gave the order. In fact, even without him saying anything, the soldiers on the city gate tower had already automatically activated the mechanism.."]},{"number":4645,"title":"Chapter 4645: Jaw Dropping Shock (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4645: Jaw Dropping Shock (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","With a few loud rumbling sounds, the city gate slowly rose.","Huang Yueli’s lips curled up slightly as she turned around and exchanged a glance with her husband.","Li Moying casually waved his hand and let the little Qilin return to its usual size.","The two of them immediately walked toward the city gate.","However, just after taking a few steps, Huang Yueli’s footsteps suddenly halted as she turned around and looked behind her in astonishment,” What are you all in a daze for? Still not entering the city? You don’t want to go back to You ‘an","Xuan Chaoyi and the rest were stunned by Li Moying’s action of releasing Qilin.","Although they had long known of their identities and had even seen Li Moying’s little Qilin in the Devil Race’s territory, but to see the little Qilin using a secret technique to transform into the appearance of an ancient giant beast was still the first time.","Such a powerful divine beast, as if it could stomp a deep pit in the ground with a single stomp, had submitted to such a handsome young martial artist. It was simply unimaginable!","Words could not describe their shock at that moment.","Hearing Huang Yueli’s voice, Xuan Chaoyi and the rest recovered their senses and hurriedly followed behind the two of them into the city.","After ordering the soldiers to open the door, Xuan Jiuling immediately turned around and hurried down the city tower, preparing to personally welcome the two of them.","Behind him, all the generals of the god clan had yet to recover from the shock. They looked at each other in disbelief.","“Then... It was really Patriarch Huang and Young Master Li! I wasn’t dreaming, was I?”","“How can it be fake? Didn’t you see that Qilin? Now in the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan, other than the two Supreme Elders, only Young Lord Li has a Qilin.”","“But...So, the rumors of the two eloping were true? But if they eloped, so be it.","Why did they go to that godforsaken place?”","“How can we guess the thoughts of a peerless genius? Alright, stop talking.","Quick, quick, quick, let’s go down and take a look. I haven’t seen Patriarch Huang and Young Master Li in person yet! I heard that the two of them are the most beautiful in the Divine Realm. I wonder if that’s true?”","The curious people hurriedly followed Xuan Jiuling.","The remaining few people who were hanging on the city gate tower like dead ashes were the ones who had strongly advocated for Xuan Chaoyi and the others to be locked outside the city gate.","Their faces were pale and their foreheads were covered in cold sweat.","One of them looked at Jing Shaoyuan and asked nervously, “Jing...” Commander Jing, we...What should we do? I don’t know if Patriarch Huang heard what we said just now. If she hates us because of this, then... Then what should we do?”Jing Shaoyuan was also upset.","However, the reason he felt ashamed was because he had made a wrong judgment this time and almost ruined the military plan. This would damage his prestige in the alliance army.","When he heard his colleague’s trembling voice, he immediately cast a disdainful gaze.","“You’re really useless! It’s just Huang Yueli and you guys are so scared? A year ago, she was just a martial artist like us! To put it bluntly, we were all thinking for the citizens of You ‘an City. We have a clear conscience, so why should we be afraid of her blaming us? If she wants to take revenge on us because of this,","Divine General Xuan will not agree to it!”","“But...But...” The other guards were still terrified.","Jing Shaoyuan could not help but harrumph coldly. With a flick of his sleeve, he ignored them and went downstairs.."]},{"number":4646,"title":"Chapter 4646: Jaw Dropping Shock (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4646: Jaw Dropping Shock (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Jing Shaoyuan’s legs were inconvenient, and it was harder for him to go downstairs than upstairs.","So by the time he reached the city gate tower, Huang Yueli and Li Moying had already brought a group of Gods Race soldiers into the city.","Xuan Jiuling personally went forward to welcome them as he cupped his hands towards Huang Yueli and Li Moying in greeting.","“Patriarch Huang, Young Master Li, I really didn’t expect that the two of you would actually appear here and even meet my team. What a coincidence! Recently, the battle has been tense, and this old master has been a little too cautious. If I have offended the two of you in any way, please don’t mind.”","Huang Yueli smiled and naturally didn’t have any intention to take Xuan Jiuling and the rest seriously.","Xuan Chaoyi was one of Xuan Jiuling’s own clansmen. Xuan Jiuling definitely didn’t stop his clansmen outside the city out of selfishness.","For the sake of the battle situation, it was understandable to make any decision.","She would not be so unreasonable as to not consider the objective background and go find trouble with others just because they made her unhappy.","” Divine General Xuan, you really don’t have to say that. You’re doing this for the sake of all the citizens of You ‘an City. My husband and I have been in the alliance army before, and we know how fierce the battle against the demons is. We can understand your actions, so please don’t mind.”","Hearing Huang Yueli’s words, Xuan Jiuling heaved a sigh of relief,” Thank you both. Come, bring the two honored guests to the City Lord’s Mansion to settle down. Xuan Chaoyi, you and your team members stay here for a while.”","He stretched out his hand to summon two Gods Race soldiers and let them lead the way for Huang Yueli and the rest.","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes as she knew that Xuan Jiuling had asked Xuan Chaoyi and the rest to stay behind because he definitely wanted to ask about King Xiang’s array talisman.","Regarding this matter, no one had a better say than her.","So Huang Yueli thought for a moment and stood still,” Lord Divine General, my husband and I have something to tell you. Come back to the City Lord’s Mansion with us.”","She did not know how many people knew about King Xiang’s formation talisman.","For the sake of caution, he still wanted to avoid others and tell Xuan Jiuling in private.","However, Xuan Jiuling thought that the two of them were unwilling to leave because they felt that he had neglected them.","He sighed and revealed a tired expression. He said apologetically,” Clan Leader Huang, Young Master Li, the two of you were originally rare guests. Now that you’ve come to our You An City, City Lord Meng and I will definitely welcome you well. However, the current situation...You and Young Master Li came from the Demon Race’s territory, so you should know the situation. With the Demon Race’s army in front, I really don’t have much energy...To be honest, before the two of you arrived, we were still holding a meeting in the city lord’s mansion to discuss the next step of the strategy.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli shook her head and smiled: ” Lord Divine General, you’ve misunderstood us! In fact, what I want to tell you is related to the Heavenly Devil Auspicious River...”","Xuan Jiuling was stunned for a moment as his gaze swept past Xuan Chaoyi who was behind Huang Yueli. Seeing that his expression was also one of affirmation, he regained his senses.","“This... Clan Leader Huang, it seems like you’ve also participated in Xuan","Chaoyi’s mission? This... What was going on? How did you guys meet?”","Huang Yueli nodded slightly,” It’s a long story so let’s return to the City Lord’s Estate first. Lord Divine General, please rest assured. This is definitely good news!”","Xuan Jiuling’s heart skipped a beat when he heard this.","He had interacted with Huang Yueli and the rest before and knew how formidable she and Li Moying were as anticipation rose in his heart.."]},{"number":4647,"title":"Chapter 4647: Jaw Dropping Shock (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4647: Jaw Dropping Shock (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Perhaps the two of them could really bring back shocking good news like how they killed Sky Devil Rui Ze last time!","“Alright, please follow me.”","Xuan Jiuling hurriedly led the way.","The group of people walked quickly and rushed back to the City Lord’s Mansion.","Xuan Jiuling and Meng Shurong let the other generals wait outside as they brought Huang Yueli and Li Moying into a secret room.","As soon as they entered, Xuan Jiuling asked impatiently before the two of them could sit down.","“Patriarch Huang, what good news did you say just now? Since you came back with Xuan Chaoyi and the others, you should already know why I sent them to the demon territory, right?”","Seeing Huang Yueli nod her head slightly, his heart was filled with joy as he asked: ” So that means...” Have you heard about the secret treasure in Heavenly","Devil Auspicious River’s hands?”","Huang Yueli nodded,” That’s right, we’ve already completely figured it out. You’ve guessed correctly. The reason why Heavenly Devil Auspicious River could raise the strength of the entire devil army is precisely because he has an ancient talisman in his hands. This talisman was forged by a powerful being hundreds of millions of years ago. It can be used repeatedly and won’t break easily! ”","Hearing this, Xuan Jiuling was pleasantly surprised.” As expected! This old man knew that my guess was absolutely correct. This is indeed an ancient formation talisman!”","However, his surprise only lasted for a few seconds before his expression darkened.","“Damn it! This was really bad! Heavenly Devil Auspicious River actually had such a powerful secret treasure. It could be said that he was already invincible! We have no chance of defeating him! I only have less than 20 ,ooo soldiers left. The demon army is so powerful that the city walls of You ‘an City can’t stop them at all!”","‘ Damn it, what should we do? We can’t hold You ‘an City for a month and wait for reinforcements!”","Xuan Jiuling was so anxious that he stood up from his seat and paced back and forth in the secret chamber.","In all the years he had joined the alliance army, this could be said to be the most difficult moment he had ever experienced.","In the past, even if he was in a desperate situation, he still felt that he had a chance to turn the tables and fight to the death.","But now, after knowing that Heavenly Devil Auspicious River had such a powerful secret treasure, he could not imagine that they still had any chance of winning.","“Patriarch Huang, what do you think we should do? Was it...Patriarch Huang, what are you laughing at?”","Xuan Jiuling looked anxiously at Huang Yueli, originally wanting to ask for her opinion but he didn’t expect to see Huang Yueli’s smiling face with a relaxed look and was instantly stunned.","Huang Yueli replied unhurriedly: ” Lord Divine General, please calm down and listen to me first. “Actually, not only did we figure out the specific situation of this array talisman, but we also killed Heavenly Devil Auspicious River and obtained the array talisman. Therefore, if you are worried that the demons will be invincible with this talisman, you are overthinking.”","As she spoke, she paused and sighed with regret.","“However, there are still some areas that are not satisfactory. After I got the talisman, I realized that this talisman isn’t suitable for the God Race to use. It can’t display its powerful effect in the hands of Heavenly Devil Auspicious River. It can only increase the strength of 20 people at most, so it’s impossible for the alliance army to use it to strengthen the entire army.”","When Xuan Jiuling heard Huang Yueli’s words, he had already sunk into a petrified state.."]},{"number":4648,"title":"Chapter 4648: Jaw Dropping Shock (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4648: Jaw Dropping Shock (7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Patriarch Huang, you said...What did you just say? I must have heard wrongly, right? Yes, he must have heard wrongly, he must have heard wrongly...How can you be a match for Heavenly Devil Auspicious River?","It would be good enough if he could survive if he encountered him. How could he kill him? My brain is really muddled...”","Xuan Jiuling muttered to himself as a bitter smile appeared on his face.","During this period of time, the situation in You ‘an City had been too tense. He was under too much pressure, and he couldn’t even sleep at night. He had always been in low spirits, but he could only hold on.","Now, his body’s condition had actually deteriorated further, and he was even hallucinating...","However, just as his voice fell, Huang Yueli interrupted.","“Mysterious Divine General, you didn’t hear wrongly. What I said just now was true. A few days ago, my husband and I were looking for this King Xiang Formation Talisman in the demon camp. In the process, we happened to meet the Heavenly Devil Auspicious River. “He was furious and chased after us. He wanted to kill us. The two of us had no choice but to use our full strength to kill him together. We almost lost our lives there...”","Speaking of the scene at that time, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but sigh.","If she could do it all over again, she might not have chosen to fight with Heavenly Devil Auspicious River.","If it wasn’t for Li Moying’s good luck that day, coincidentally advancing successfully at the crucial moment, perhaps the two of them would never be able to return to the Gods Race’s territory.","However, no matter what, the result was still very satisfactory.","“You... You...","Xuan Jiuling’s eyes widened as his mouth opened wide, staring at Huang Yueli for a long time but he couldn’t utter a complete sentence.","Huang Yueli didn’t interrupt him and after she finished speaking, she picked up the teacup on the table and took a sip to moisten her throat as she waited for Xuan Jiuling and Meng Shurong to regain their senses.","City Lord Meng was the first to digest this shocking news.","He stood up and said excitedly,”Patriarch Huang, it seems that what you said is true?” You really killed Heavenly Devil Auspicious River!”","Huang Yueli shook her head,” It wasn’t me. To be precise, the one who killed Rui Jiang was my husband. I was just assisting from the side...’","Before she could finish, Meng Shurong waved his hand and interrupted her.","“That’s not important. You and Young Master Li are one. You joined forces to kill Heavenly Devil Auspicious River, isn’t that right? The main point was that Heavenly Devil Auspicious River was really dead! The commander of the demon army was really dead! Even Rui Jiang’s secret treasure talisman has fallen into your hands!”","As he spoke, not only did he not gradually calm down, but he became even more excited.","Meng Shurong paced back and forth in the room and kept exclaiming,” Oh my god, this...” This victory came too suddenly. It was like red rain from the sky! It’s really unbelievable, really unbelievable!”","It was only at this moment that Xuan Jiuling recovered from his shock as he turned to look at Huang Yueli and Li Moying, his eyes still filled with disbelief.","“Patriarch Huang, Young Lord Li, you guys...Are you really not lying to us? Can the two of you produce some proof? Or could he tell them the details of the battle? It’s not that I don’t want to believe the two of you, but...","It was because this matter was too important and could not tolerate any mistakes. I had no choice...’","Hearing this, Huang Yueli was initially startled and her brows creased.."]},{"number":4649,"title":"Chapter 4649: Jaw Dropping Shock (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4649: Jaw Dropping Shock (8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","In all fairness, Xuan Jiuling’s request was not too much.","The key to this battle was to determine whether Tianmo Auspicious River was really dead.","If there was a mistake in such important information, it would definitely be the result of courting death.","Xuan Jiuling was cautious by nature. In the face of such a huge surprise, he was still able to stabilize his emotions. He was not overwhelmed by the sudden victory and could still carefully verify the authenticity of the news. This was where he was superior.","If it was possible, Huang Yueli didn’t reject his questions and was willing to answer him truthfully.","But the place where she and Li Moying killed Rui Jiang was in the ancient era’s Devil King Realm expert Rui Meng’s cave dwelling.","There were too many secrets hidden deep within the cave dwelling and it was related to her and Li Moying’s secret as evil cultivators so she couldn’t possibly tell anyone about it.","Fortunately, Huang Yueli had already considered this point beforehand and had made some preparations.","With a flip of her wrist, she took out the Demonic Auspicious River’s magic stone from her space and gently placed it on the table.","“Divine General Xuan, City Lord Meng, this is the Demon Stone of Heavenly Devil Auspicious River. We even dug out his magic crystals. How could he not be dead?”","“What is it? The Demon Stones of the Heavenly Devil Auspicious River!” “You really brought out his magic crystals! This... This is really...”","Xuan Jiuling and Meng Shurong gasped.","Although they had long known that since Huang Yueli and the rest had killed Heavenly Devil Auspicious River, obtaining his magic crystals was a matter of course and wasn’t worth making a fuss over, but they still couldn’t control their emotions.","This was...It was the magic stone of a demon expert at the peak of the Heavenly Demon Realm!","The two of them were already 300 years old, but they had never seen each other before!","Even Xuan Jiuling, as a famous expert on the Divine Realm’s Heaven Rankings, had never had a battle record of killing a peak stage Heavenly Demon!","Huang Yueli pushed the magic stone to the center of the table and retracted her hand.","Xuan Jiuling and Meng Shurong immediately rushed forward, completely ignoring their image. They laid on the table and stared at the magic stone, carefully observing it from top to bottom, left to right, not willing to miss a single detail.","Meng Shurong was still muttering to himself, So this is the demon stone left behind by a demon at the peak of the Heavenly Demon Realm! The fiendish qi contained inside is seriously too dense. Just looking like this, I already feel a burst of suffocation in my chest. I’m still Dao Profound Realm cultivation! If it was an ordinary god, they would probably not be able to get close to it. Miss Huang, did you bring it all the way back from the devil camp?”","Huang Yueli didn’t expect him to ask such a question.","She wasn’t even afraid of Heavenly Devil Auspicious River, so why would she be afraid of the magic stones left behind by a dead person? Wasn’t this just another question?","She blinked and nodded.” Yes, I did bring it back.” This isn’t a difficult thing. I naturally have a secret technique to block demonic qi.”","Meng Shurong also realised that her question earlier was very silly. She hurriedly coughed twice and apologized to Huang Yueli: ” Clan Leader Huang,","I’m really sorry. I didn’t mean that your ability wasn’t enough. I’m just a little... Sigh, I’m also a little confused!”","“I understand, City Lord Meng. You don’t have to worry about it.” Huang Yueli hurriedly said.","At this moment, Xuan Jiuling suddenly spoke up in confusion,” Something’s not right.. Why is this Magic Stone different from the peak stage Demon Crystal I saw at the alliance army headquarters many years ago?”"]},{"number":4650,"title":"Chapter 4650: Jaw Dropping Shock (9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4650: Jaw Dropping Shock (9)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Different?” Huang Yueli’s brows rose as she was a little surprised,” What’s going on? Could it be that the demon crystals are different for all demons in the Heavenly Demon Stage?”","Xuan Jiuling frowned and shook his head. Although the shapes of the demon race’s demon stones may be different, their colors are very uniform. The colors of the demon stones are completely different for different cultivation levels.”","As he spoke, he pointed at the magic stone on the table.” I’ve seen magic stones at the peak of the otherworldly demon realm in the alliance army headquarters. They’re a sky-blue color with a slight purple hue at most. However, the magic stone in your hand has already turned purple, with only a small portion of it being blue. This... This... Don’t tell me this is a Demon King’s Demon Stone!”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli and Li Moying exchanged a glance and realised that their husband was also a little surprised.","It seemed that although her husband was very diligent and well-read, he was not a native who had grown up in the Divine Realm. There were still many things he did not understand.","This was the first time Li Moying had heard about the colour of the demon race’s magic stones.","The two of them looked at each other, then at the Magic Stones on the table, and then at Xuan Jiuling and Meng Shurong, who had puzzled looks on their faces...","Finally, Huang Yueli cleared her throat,” Cough cough, alright, I admit, this... This was indeed a Demon Stone of a Quasi-Demon King. Wait, don’t be agitated. Let me finish first.”","Seeing Xuan Jiuling and Meng Shurong’s agitated expressions as though they were about to pounce over and grab her collar to ask questions, Huang Yueli hurriedly stopped them.","Li Moying and I had indeed killed Heavenly Devil Auspicious River and this is indeed his Magic Stone. But when we were killing him, he had temporarily advanced into the Devil King Realm!”","“What is it? Temporarily?” Xuan Jiuling was stunned for a moment before he started to ponder.” Could it be that he used some secret technique to stimulate his body’s potential? The demon race does have many such secret techniques. However, these secret techniques can only increase their physical strength and the purity of the demon qi in their bodies. It’s impossible for them to affect the demon stones, right?”","Huang Yueli replied: ” Rui Jiang didn’t use the devil race’s secret method to","raise his strength. Have you forgotten that he has this ancient array talisman in his hands.’","As she spoke, she took out King Xiang’s formation talisman and waved it in front of the two of them before putting it away again.","He had no intention of letting the two of them take a closer look.","The Demon Stones of the Heavenly Devil Auspicious River had to be handed over to the alliance army headquarters, so there was no use in keeping them. Therefore, there was no harm in letting Xuan Jiuling and Meng Shurong take a look.","However, it was impossible for her to hand over this King Xiang Token. Instead, she wanted to keep it as one of her trump cards.","The power of this array talisman was too heaven-defying. Although she was still far from being able to unleash its full strength, what if one day, she completely cracked King Xiang’s array? At that time, not only would her strength increase greatly, but she would also be able to easily cultivate an army of her own.","With such a treasure, even if the alliance army headquarters sent someone over, she wouldn’t be able to hand it over, let alone Xuan Jiuling and the others.","Of course, there were indeed not many people who dared to snatch things from the Sacred Phoenix Race’s Patriarch’s hands.","Xuan Jiuling and Meng Shurong were obviously not included.","Therefore, although they were very interested in this legendary ancient treasure, they did not dare to say anything. They could only turn their attention back to the Magic Stone.."]},{"number":4651,"title":"Chapter 4651: Jaw Dropping Shock (10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4651: Jaw Dropping Shock (10)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Meng Shurong frowned, still looking puzzled.” Wait, I still don’t understand. What does the talisman have to do with the change in color of the magic stone?”","Xuan Jiuling had already understood as he looked at Huang Yueli and the rest in astonishment.","“All of you...You guys actually... This... This is unbelievable!”","“Brother Xuan, do you understand?” Meng Shurong asked curiously.","Xuan Jiuling nodded, the shock on his face not lessening at all.” Clan Leader","Huang, you understand what you mean, right? “When Heavenly Devil Auspicious River was killed, his potential should have been stimulated by the arrav talisman and he advanced a realm to the Demon King Realm. The increase in cultivation by the array talisman is different from the increase in secret techniques. It will also increase the level of the Demon Stone in the","Demon Race’s body. That’s why the Demon Stone of Heavenly Devil Auspicious River turned that color...”","“What did you say? Brother Xuan, are you mistaken? “According to what you mean, before Heavenly Devil Auspicious River dies, that’s... That was the cultivation of the Demon King Realm! If that’s the case, how could Patriarch","Huang and the others kill him?”","Meng Shurong’s face was almost filled with disbelief.","“It’s not that I don’t believe in Patriarch Huang and Young Master Li’s strength, but their age is obvious. They were able to cross realms and kill a demon at the peak of the Heavenly Demon realm. It was already enough to shake the entire Divine World. Killing a Demon King... This... I really can’t imagine such a thing...”","Xuan Jiuling sighed.” I also think that this matter is too ridiculous. However, other than this, I really can’t think of any other explanation. Why don’t we ask Patriarch Huang to tell us in detail personally?”","Just as his voice fell, the gazes of the two Dao Profound Realm experts landed on Huang Yueli, their expressions agitated as they anxiously waited for her to speak.","Huang Yueli felt a little uncomfortable under their stares as she hurriedly coughed and explained: ” Uh, this...” Things are indeed as Divine General Xuan said just now. When we fought with Rui Jiang, he was at a disadvantage. In a moment of desperation, he took out an array talisman, and his cultivation immediately increased greatly, breaking through to the Demon King realm.”","Seeing the expressions on Meng Shurong and Xuan Jiuling’s faces that seemed to have been struck by lightning, she was afraid that the two of them would be too shocked and cause some trouble. She tried her best to avoid the main issue and said,” Seniors, things are actually not as exaggerated as you think. Ruijiang was already seriously injured at that time, so even though he forcefully increased his cultivation, his strength was still very far from the true Demon King Realm. And my husband just so happened to advance and borrowed the power of the heavenly lightning to kill him. This is mainly luck, it’s all luck!” Hearing Huang Yueli’s words, Meng Shurong and Xuan Jiuling finally calmed down a little and started to accept this fact.","Even so, the shock in their hearts did not lessen.","Meng Shurong drank a cup of tea to suppress his shock. Then, he smiled bitterly and said,” Patriarch Huang, Young Master Li, the two of you are too humble. No matter what, to be able to kill a demon at the Quasi-Demon King Realm, it can’t be luck! If he didn’t have the corresponding strength, I’m afraid he would have been killed by Ruijiang in a single move.”","As the City Lord, Meng Shurong was not known for his combat strength. Instead, he was good at managing the town and coordinating relationships.","Even though his own cultivation reached Dao Profound Realm, in terms of strength and vision, he was not on the same level as a top expert like Xuan Jiuling at all.."]},{"number":4652,"title":"Chapter 4652: Victory (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4652: Victory (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Therefore, although Meng Shurong felt that Huang Yueli’s explanation was a little strange, but he couldn’t pinpoint what was strange about it.","But Xuan Jiuling was different.","As an expert on the Heaven Ranking, he had seen and experienced many things and had fought many Devil Race experts who were at the peak of the Heavenly Devil Realm. Hence, he knew that Huang Yueli had deliberately simplified the matter.","Not to mention other things, the devil race’s recovery ability was famous for being strong. Even if Huang Yueli and Li Moying had already heavily injured Rui Jiang, but Rui Jiang could forcefully raise his cultivation by a realm. During the process of raising his cultivation, using devil qi to recover his physical strength and heal his wounds was something that couldn’t be more normal.","No matter how weak a Devil King was, he was still much stronger than a peak Heavenly Devil!","As for using the heavenly lightning to kill the enemy during the advancement...","This sounded reasonable at first, but the truly experienced experts knew how dangerous it was to advance in battle. If they were not careful, they would die on the spot and be struck by the heavenly lightning into a charred corpse. Even their facial features could not be recognized.","Under such circumstances, it was already good enough to be able to keep his life, yet he still wanted to use the heavenly lightning to resist the enemy?","This was probably ten times more difficult than killing Ruijiang in a direct battle!","However, although Xuan Jiuling knew that Huang Yueli had some reservations in her words, but he didn’t intend to expose her.","Even if one used their toes to think, one would know that Huang Yueli and Li","Moying were able to kill a top notch expert like Heavenly Devil Auspicious River with their current cultivation and age. Just relying on god grade innate talent was far from enough. The two of them definitely had some other fortuitous encounters and had more trump cards in their hands.","It was normal for them to be unwilling to reveal all of their trump cards.","As long as they didn’t do anything to let down the entire god clan, no one had the right to ask.","Xuan Jiuling’s brows furrowed as he pondered for a moment before his brows gradually relaxed as his face revealed a trace of a smile as he stood up and cupped his hands towards Huang Yueli and Li Moying.","“I see. The two of you are really heroes from the young. You’ve made us two old fellows feel inferior! I’m ashamed, I’m ashamed. I thank you for helping out and saving the citizens of You ‘an City.”","Meng Shurong also stood up.” That’s right. I should thank you all the more. The two of you are indeed worthy of being the most outstanding geniuses of the","Shen clan in the past ten thousand years. You are indeed worthy of your reputation!”","Seeing the two seniors standing up, Huang Yueli and Li Moying couldn’t just sit there and not move.","The two of them quickly stood up and returned the greeting, saying, “You flatter me.","Xuan Jiuling and Meng Shurong sighed again. They finally calmed down and began to consider their next move.","Xuan Jiuling stroked his beard and muttered,” Since Heavenly Devil Auspicious River has been killed, the demon army camp is now without a leader. Based on my understanding of the demons, their camp must be in a mess at this moment.” This is the best time to defeat the mo army. I want to immediately lead people and sneak attack the mo camp overnight!”","“Then I’ll be in charge of appeasing the people in the city.” Meng Shurong said. That’s right, Patriarch Huang, Young Master Li, would the two of you mind telling the world about you killing Rui Jiang? If the soldiers of the alliance army knew about this news, their morale would definitely be boosted. At night, the","Mystic Divine General would lead his troops out and they would definitely win! The commoners will also be at ease...”","Huang Yueli nodded her head,” That’s natural. The news of Rui Jiang’s death can’t be concealed so there’s no need for us to hide it.."]},{"number":4653,"title":"Chapter 4653: Victory (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4653: Victory (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Meng Shurong was overjoyed.” That’s great. I’ll go find someone to immediately write this joyous occasion into a notice and post it all over You ‘an City! At the same time, he had to write letters to the alliance headquarters and the various families to inform them of this joyous occasion and the great merit of the two of them! “Killing a peak Heavenly Demon expert, just this quasi-Demon King Demon Stone, the military merits accumulated by the two of you can reach...”","Meng Shurong clearly didn’t understand the rules of the alliance army. When he said this, he suddenly stopped and subconsciously looked at Xuan Jiuling.","Xuan Jiuling chuckled.” These military merits are enough for both of you to be promoted to Divine Generals. If both of you are willing to join the alliance army, you will soon be like me.” Back then, this old man had been in the army","for decades before he accumulated enough military merits to become a Divine","General. The two of you did it in less than two years. You will definitely be","entrusted with important tasks! Why don’t you two consider joining the","alliance army?”","Huang Yueli smiled as she shook her head,” Lord Divine General, we appreciate your good intentions. But my husband and I are not bound by nature and we can’t even stay in the clan, let alone in the alliance army? Forget it!”","She could tell that after knowing that she and Li Moying had joined hands to kill Heavenly Devil Auspicious River, Xuan Jiuling and Meng Shurong’s tone when they spoke to her was different from before.","Although the two of them were very polite to her previously, but she could tell that this politeness was mainly because they valued her and Li Moying’s god grade innate talent and their status in the family. Actually from the depths of their hearts, they still felt that Huang Yueli and the rest were juniors.","It was obviously different now.","Xuan Jiuling and Meng Shurong’s tone seemed to treat them as colleagues, and they even seemed to be inferior to them.","This was naturally the result of the intimidation of his strength.","The two old seniors were both intelligent people so they were definitely very clear that Huang Yueli and Li Moying were able to kill the Quasi-Devil King Rui Jiang, so their abilities were at least on par with Xuan Jiuling and Xuan Jiuling was already an old man. The two of them were still so young and their innate talent was so high so it was estimated that it wouldn’t be long before they would reach a height that the two old fellows could only look up to.","For such young martial artists, other than taking the initiative to lower his head and build a good relationship with them, was there a second way?","At least, Huang Yueli and the rest didn’t look arrogant or impatient, not the slightest bit arrogant and despotic just because of their outstanding abilities and their personalities were also very likable.","Xuan Jiuling was actually very clear in his heart that Huang Yueli and Li Moying were unlikely to join the alliance army.","Therefore, he did not feel disappointed after being rejected.","He put down the teacup and stood up.” Alright, since the plan has been decided, this old man won’t delay any longer. Tonight, this old man will let these demons know who the true master of the Divine World is! The dignity of the twelve continents of the God Clan isn’t something these crazy guys can provoke!”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying initially wanted to go out together with him but after thinking about it, they decided to forget about it.","Half of the experts in the fiend race camp had been cleared by them.","Although there were a lot of people left, they were just a motley crew, and there were many experts in the alliance army, which was enough to deal with them.","They had already made such a huge contribution, so there was no need for them to compete with the other alliance soldiers. They had been guarding the border for so long, so they deserved to earn this bit of military merit.","Meng Shurong also left in a hurry to do some serious business.","Before he left, he didn’t forget to look for the City Lord Manor’s maidservant and asked her to bring some food over for Huang Yueli and the rest.."]},{"number":4654,"title":"Chapter 4654: Victory (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4654: Victory (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","You ‘an City had been besieged for many days. Although there was a large reserve of grain in the city and there was no danger of running out for the time being, in order to delay the defense of the city for a longer time, Meng Shurong still ordered all the grain in the city to be distributed.","Apart from the soldiers of the alliance army, the officials of the city lord’s mansion and the ordinary people received the same food every day.","Even Meng Shurong himself took the lead to eat simple food.","So in a hurry, the servants prepared very simple dishes for Huang Yueli and Li Moying. Other than steamed buns, there was only a plate of cucumber scrambled eggs, a plate of eggplant with garlic sauce, a plate of sour and spicy shredded potatoes, all of which were vegetarian.","Even so, Huang Yueli still wolfed down her food, eating three big steamed buns alone.","After eating, he put down his chopsticks and leaned back in his chair. He touched his slightly bulging belly and said,” I’m so touched. I can finally eat normal food!” Sob, sob, sob, I’m about to suffocate to death in this damned place of the demon race! Too tragic, really too tragic!”","Thinking back to the days in the devil army camp and the underground cave dwelling, what Huang Yueli couldn’t stand the most was that there was nothing to eat.","The eating habits of the fiend race were completely different from those of the celestial race and the human race.","Some low-level demons even ate raw meat directly. Although high-level demons would roast meat for cooking, their cooking skills were really not impressive.","Huang Yueli bit the bullet and ate a little bit, almost vomiting.","Although she also had some food stored in her space, it was not good to make a fire and cook in the territory of the demon race. She could only get some dry food to fill her stomach.","As a person who had high expectations for life, Huang Yueli really felt miserable.","A large part of the reason why she was in a hurry to return to You ‘an City was because of food.","Li Moying looked at his little fox’s lazy look in amusement as a slender finger stretched out to her lips and lightly scratched it,” Silly lass, there’s sauce on the corner of your mouth, didn’t you notice? The cooking skills of the chefs here are just average. They’re far inferior to you. It’s hard for you to like to eat so much. It seems that you’re really starving.”","Huang Yueli licked her lips as she narrowed her eyes, looking satisfied, just like a little kitten basking in the sun.","“Actually, the chef’s craftsmanship is not bad. It’s not easy to cook this table of dishes without any meat. Sigh, we came back at the right time! After the matter in You ‘an City is over, let’s eat at all the nearby restaurants before going to Linyin Town. How about that?”","Li Moying looked at her dotingly as he nodded,” Alright, I’ll listen to you.”","Huang Yueli had her fill and was satisfied as she raised her hands and stretched lazily,” Oh right, I haven’t taken a hot bath for a long time so I wonder if there’s still hot water in the city?”","She summoned the maid of the City Lord’s Estate and asked.","The maid hurriedly said: ” Clan Leader Huang, Young Master Li, we have already prepared all these. Your rooms have also been arranged. Please follow me.”","Huang Yueli didn’t expect Meng Shurong to be so thoughtful and instantly had a good impression of him.","She pulled her husband and followed behind the maid. As they walked, they sized up the interior of the City Lord’s Estate.","It could be seen that City Lord Meng was not a person who lived extravagantly. The interior of the City Lord’s Mansion was very simple. Other than the fact that the courtyard was a little bigger and there were more rooms, it was not much different from a commoner’s house. However, it was very clean.."]},{"number":4655,"title":"Chapter 4655: Victory (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4655: Victory (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli inched closer to Li Moying’s side and whispered into her husband’s ear,” City Lord Meng is really a good City Lord who is wholeheartedly devoted to the people. No wonder he was able to stay in You ‘an","City for so many years.”","Li Moying nodded his head as a strange look flashed past his eyes. He said emotionally,” If there wasn’t the united army’s soldiers who were fighting wholeheartedly for the people of the Celestial race and Human race, there wouldn’t be the current prosperity of the twelve continents. Compared to them, the so-called peerless geniuses are not even worth mentioning!”","This was also the reason why Jing Shaoyuan had repeatedly provoked him and Huang Yueli but he didn’t retaliate.","No matter how narrow-minded Jing Shaoyuan was, he was not a bad person because he could stay in the alliance army for more than ten years and constantly train himself.","Humans always had shortcomings. It was not easy to sacrifice one’s own interests for the common people.","When Huang Yueli saw this, she blinked her big eyes and stared at Li Moying for a while before she suddenly said,” Husband, from your tone...” Do you really want to join the alliance?”","Li Moying was startled and immediately broke into laughter,” What are you thinking about? To me, the most important thing is to stay by your side and live the carefree life that you like the most. I’m not that concerned about the world. If it’s like this time, helping the alliance army is no problem, but I can’t stay in the same place forever. This is impossible!”","Huang Yueli gave an ‘oh’ as she accepted his explanation.","However, although she did not say anything, her expression was thoughtful.","Not long after, they arrived at the guest room.","Meng Shurong had vacated the largest guest room in the entire City Lord Manor, and the hot water was already prepared.","Huang Yueli took a comfortable bath in the bathtub, feeling that there was nothing more satisfying than this.","After taking a bath, she put on a nightgown and returned to the bedroom. As soon as she entered, the man who had been waiting in the room for a long time grabbed her wrist and pulled her into his arms.","“Moying, what are you... Oh!”","A warm and moist touch brushed past the corner of her lips, stopping her from finishing her sentence.","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened as she saw her husband’s handsome face right in front of her eyes. His deep black eyes stared at her small face as his long eyelashes left a faint shadow under his eyes.","The man’s thin lips curled up slightly as he chuckled softly.” You didn’t wipe the sauce off your mouth. I’ll help you lick it off...”","A deep and sexy voice reverberated in her ears and Huang Yueli’s heart tightened as she subconsciously replied: ” Thank you husband...","When she finished her sentence, she saw Li Moying’s eyes flash with a trace of ridicule and she suddenly came to her senses as she hurriedly covered her mouth.","“You, you, you...You lied to me! Li Moying, you actually lied to me! It had been so long since they finished eating. How could there be any sauce left? Even if there was, it would have been washed away by the water when I took a shower just now. You are... He did it on purpose!”","Li Moying was exposed by his wife on the spot but his face didn’t show any trace of shame as he leaned closer to her.","A strong masculine breath blew on Huang Yueli’s face, causing her to unconsciously blush.","Li Moying exhaled slightly,” Li Jer, have you forgotten something? After being in the demon camp for so long, other than eating and bathing, there’s another thing that we haven’t done for more than half a month...”"]},{"number":4656,"title":"Chapter 4656: Victory (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4656: Victory (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying’s face was simply too lethal.","Not only from Soaring Heavens Continent, up to the Divine Realm, all sorts of noble ladies from various aristocratic families had prostrated themselves under Li Moying’s long robe. Even Huang Yueli who had been married to him for several years, couldn’t resist his deliberate temptation. The rationality that she had always been proud of had all left home at this moment.","The powerful and fierce peerless genius instantly turned into a soft and cute little fox. He did not realize that he had been set up at all. He even asked in a daze, “What...” What did you say you didn’t do?”","Li Moying’s laughter became even wilder and his voice became even deeper, carrying an obvious seduction,” Of course it’s...Dual Cultivation! Li ‘er, how long has it been since we last dual cultivated, do you still remember?”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment before she finally reacted to what Li Moying had said as her little face instantly flushed red.","“You... Why do you remember things like dual cultivation so well?”","Li Moying replied in all seriousness,” Of course we have to remember it well. Dual cultivation is for the sake of our abilities to improve faster! Li ‘er, think about it, I’m already in Dao Profound Realm now, but you’re still stuck at Heart Profound Realm peak stage bottleneck. Why is this? Of course, it’s because we haven’t had any Dual Cultivation recently! As long as you dual cultivate a few more times, you’ll definitely be able to break through very quickly.” Huang Yueli’s lips twitched as she really wanted to kick this shameless man away.","“I believed your evil...Wuwuwu!”","However, without waiting for her to make a move, Li Moying had already bent down and with his sharp eyes and agile hands, he grabbed her wrist and sealed her lips.","A room full of spring.","Because the previous day’s dual cultivation was too tiring, Huang Yueli rarely woke up late and only woke up when it was close to noon.","Li Moying had woken up earlier than her but he didn’t leave the room, instead leaning against the head of the bed, his hand was holding a scroll of devil race’s ancient records which he had obtained from Devil King Rui Fu’s cave dwelling, flipping through it.","Looking at the cold and aloof man who was dressed in a neat and tidy manner at this moment, and thinking about the shameless beast behavior of this man last night, Huang Yueli rubbed her waist as she muttered in her heart.","She must have married a fake husband!","What elegant and cold Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Young Lord, it was all a lie!","Sensing that Huang Yueli had woken up, his line of sight immediately turned towards her.","“Li ‘er, you’re awake? Previously, City Lord Meng had sent someone to say that this morning, the army led by Divine General Xuan had returned from a surprise attack on the demon camp and won a complete victory. He told us to go to the meeting hall in front after breakfast.”","Huang Yueli was initially still in a daze but when she heard this exciting news, she instantly woke up and immediately sat up from the bed.","“What is it? Really? The Mystic Divine General and the others have returned so quickly?”","Li Moying nodded his head,” That’s right, it’s said that they had almost wiped out the entire devil army, killing tens of thousands of devils, turning defeat into victory and achieving a great merit. This time, the Dark Divine General’s contribution would not be small. Perhaps he would be promoted to Nine-star Divine General very soon. Moreover, the demons have suffered heavy losses in this battle. I estimate that it’s impossible for them to launch an attack on You ‘an City in the short term.”","In the alliance army, other than the seven nine-star generals, the highest military rank was the nine-star general.","One could imagine how happy Xuan Jiuling would be.","Although Huang Yueli had long known that this would be the outcome, but hearing that things were progressing so smoothly, she couldn’t help but be overjoyed.","“That’s great, that’s great.. What are we waiting for? Hurry up and go over!”"]},{"number":4657,"title":"Chapter 4657: This old guy is very bad (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4657: This old guy is very bad (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli lifted the blanket and wanted to get off the bed.","However, the moment she moved, Li Moying’s gaze slowly shifted downwards from her face and the glint in his eyes made her suddenly feel a little dangerous.","Huang Yueli’s entire body shivered as she finally realised that this room seemed to be...A little cold?","She followed Li Moying’s line of sight and subconsciously lowered her head to take a look.","The next moment, she suddenly raised her hand and pulled the blanket that had fallen to her waist back to her chest. Her small face turned red as she glared at Li Moying,” You...” You didn’t even help me put on any clothes! Did you peek at me when I was asleep?”","Li Moying’s lips curled up in amusement,” You’re my wifey and we’ve dual cultivated so many times, how have I not seen it before? How could I peek? I’ve always watched it openly...”","“Mud Victory!”","Huang Yueli was so angry that her voice changed as she pushed him forcefully,” Go away quickly, I want to put on my clothes!”","Li Moying looked at her flushed face and there was an impulse in his heart, wishing that he could continue the dual cultivation from last night.","However, when he thought of Meng Shurong and the others who were still waiting in the meeting hall, he endured it. He rubbed his nose and stood up.","“Alright, I’ll wait for you outside.”","After Li Moying’s back view disappeared behind the door, Huang Yueli jumped up from the bed and found a set of clothes in the Sky Phoenix Ring to change into, before she washed up briefly.","The two of them quickly ate something and rushed to the meeting hall.","However, what they didn’t expect was that before the two of them reached the entrance of the meeting hall and were still standing in the corridor, they heard a loud roar coming from the entrance of the City Lord’s Mansion: ” Thank you, Clan Leader Huang! Thank you, Young Master Li! ”","This voice was unusually loud, and it was at least the volume of hundreds of people speaking at the same time.","Huang Yueli totally didn’t expect that there would be such a thing and was given a fright.","He turned around and saw a cavalry team lined up neatly on the street at the entrance of the city lord’s mansion.","This cavalry troop was made up entirely of Celestial soldiers who were at least at the ninth level of the Profound Meaning realm. They were all dressed in black uniform, and all of their mounts were third grade spirit beasts, Dark Cloud Stallion. Just from their appearance, it was obvious that this was one of the most elite troops under Xuan Jiuling.","And at this moment, these soldiers had all dismounted and with one hand holding onto the reins, the other hand pressed on their chest as they bowed towards Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s direction.","The captain who was standing at the front of the group noticed Huang Yueli looking over and immediately walked over.","“Patriarch Huang, Young Master Li, my brothers and I represent all the soldiers of the alliance army in You An City to thank you both deeply. Thank you for saving all the citizens of You An City, and thank you for avenging the comrades who died in this war!”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes as her expression revealed a rare trace of embarrassment and embarrassment.","She was someone who had seen a lot of things, but it was the first time she had been thanked so solemnly by so many people.","She could tell that these people had been waiting here for a long time, probably specially waiting for her and Li Moying to come out to thank them.","But Huang Yueli didn’t feel that she had done anything extraordinary that was worthy of their gratitude.","After all, she had helped Xuan Chaoyi and the others and killed Heavenly Devil Auspicious River. Although she had considered the people of Youan City, she had done it mostly for herself.","At that time, she and Li Moying were chased by Rui Jiang and they couldn’t even escape so they had to fight to the death.."]},{"number":4658,"title":"Chapter 4658: This old guy is very bad (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4658: This old guy is very bad (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","If she had known that Heavenly Devil Auspicious River would become so strong and could even advance to the Demon King Realm, how could she have rushed up and fought head-on?","He would definitely run far away at the first possible moment, not even wanting the King Xiang Formation Talisman.","From her point of view, other than Li Moying, there was nothing more important than her being able to live well.","Therefore, killing Heavenly Devil Auspicious River was largely due to luck.","Of course, after Rui Jiang’s death, she and Li Moying rescued Xuan Chaoyi and the rest, and before they left, they killed the top exponents from the Devil","Race’s campsite. These were indeed for the sake of the citizens of the Twelve Continents.","But to her and Li Moying, these things were just a piece of cake so she naturally didn’t mind doing it along the way.","In short, she was not that noble to risk her life for someone she did not know... Huang Yueli admitted that she didn’t do anything extraordinary but to receive such a solemn and sincere gratitude, she suddenly felt ashamed of herself.","However, in the eyes of the guards of You An City, Huang Yueli was being overly modest.","The cavalry captain stared at Huang Yueli as he spoke with a sincere expression: ” Patriarch Huang, Young Master Li, please don’t say that. You aren’t in the army and don’t understand the situation well enough. I’m afraid you don’t know how serious the casualties in our army have been during this period of time! Our Black Knights are the personal guards of Divine General Xuan, and we have also suffered heavy casualties. Originally, we had 2,000 people, but now, there are only 700 or so people left. Most of our comrades have already...”","His voice trembled for a moment before he stopped.","Huang Yueli opened her mouth in astonishment but she didn’t make a sound.","The captain took a deep breath to calm himself down.” If it weren’t for the two of you,” he continued,” I believe that the casualties would have been even greater in the future. Even we would have died here.” Of course, since we have joined the alliance, we are not afraid of death. However, not being able to avenge our comrades before we die is our greatest regret. Now that the two of you have killed Rui Jiang and let us wipe out the demon army, we can finally comfort our comrades in heaven...","After the captain finished speaking, he bowed deeply to them.” Thank you!”","Following his action, the hundreds of cavalrymen behind him followed suit and bowed towards Huang Yueli and Li Moying.","‘ Thank you, Clan Leader Huang. Thank you, Young Master Li!”","The combined roars of hundreds of people shook the sky.","Huang Yueli herself hated such noise the most. In the past when Little Wang Cai was making a ruckus in the room, she couldn’t wait to chase the little fellow outside.","However, at this moment, she did not feel disgusted at all. Instead, she was touched.","The relationship between the soldiers of the alliance army was deeper than she had imagined. It was really rare...","After the cavalrymen thanked him again, they did not stay at the entrance of the city lord’s mansion for too long.","The captain straightened up and said nothing. He turned around and walked back to the team, getting on his horse.","All the cavalrymen followed suit and mounted the Dark Cloud Stallion.","Following the captain’s order, the cavalry formed a long line and slowly left along the street.","Huang Yueli sent them off with her eyes as she let out a deep breath. Just as she was about to turn around and head to the meeting hall, who knew that there was a commotion outside the door.","However, this time, it was not as loud and orderly as before.","Miss Huang, thank you, thank you for saving us commoners!”"]},{"number":4659,"title":"Chapter 4659: This old guy is very bad (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4659: This old guy is very bad (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","” Young Master Li, my daughter was killed by the Devil Race. Before she died, she was even humiliated by them. Thank you for avenging her, thank you so much!”","“My husband also died in the hands of the demons. I thought I would never be able to take revenge! The two of you are really amazing!”","” Miss Huang, Young Master Li, you two are really good people. You are the most compatible couple I have ever seen. I wish you two a long life together!”","“Miss Huang, these are the vegetables that our family planted. They are very fresh. Please accept them..","A group of commoners rushed over from the streets.","Just now, the entire street in front of the city lord’s mansion was occupied by the cavalry. They wanted to enter but could not. They could only block the two ends of the road.","Now that the cavalrymen had left, the streets were empty and everyone couldn’t wait to rush over, wanting to see Huang Yueli and Li Moying personally.","Although the guards at the entrance of the City Lord’s Mansion stopped them and did not allow them to enter and leave as they pleased, they still could not stop the surging enthusiasm of the people.","Huang Yueli was shocked by this stance.","She could understand why the cavalrymen under Xuan Jiuling had come to thank her, but the fact that these commoners were so enthusiastic was beyond her expectations.","Li Moying was also stunned for a moment as his usually calm and aloof expression couldn’t hold on any longer as he narrowed his eyes slightly, his gaze turning even deeper.","“Step back, step back, everyone, please step back! The City Lord’s Mansion is an important military location, and all the generals of the alliance army are discussing matters inside. Please don’t disturb the meeting and hurry back home, hurry back!”","There were not many guards in the City Lord’s Mansion to begin with. In front of so many people, it seemed even more sparse.","The guards tried their best to block the door, but they could not. A few people still squeezed in from the side when the guards were not paying attention.","However, before they could get close to Huang Yueli and Li Moying, they were caught and brought back.","Huang Yueli recovered from her initial shock and when she saw this scene, her brows furrowed slightly as she immediately walked towards the door.","Seeing her walk over, the people became even more excited.","All sorts of screams rang out.","Huang Yueli cleared her throat,” Big brothers and big sisters, please quiet down for a moment and listen to me.","Her volume was not considered very high but because of the addition of some Profound Energy, even in such a noisy environment, it was still exceptionally clear and everyone could hear it clearly.","Everyone subconsciously quieted down and looked at her.","Huang Yueli gave a slight smile as she spoke in a calm tone: ” First of all, thank you everyone for coming to see me. I didn’t expect that everyone in You ‘an City would be so enthusiastic. But I really don’t deserve it. My husband and I were only able to kill Rui Jiang by chance. It is our honor to be able to help you. You don’t have to take this matter to heart. I’ve already received everyone’s gratitude. As for the gifts, you should bring them back.”","After Huang Yueli finished speaking, she waited for a while but the residents didn’t show any signs of leaving. Instead, they became even more agitated.","Li Moying also walked over as he said in a low voice,” Everyone, actually it should be me and my wife thanking you. If it wasn’t for you all supporting the alliance army, You ‘an City would have fallen long ago. We really don’t deserve everyone’s thanks. Peace has finally returned to Youan City. Please return early and rest..”"]},{"number":4660,"title":"Chapter 4660: This old guy is very bad (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4660: This old guy is very bad (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli and Li Moying tried their best to persuade them and after a long time, these residents were finally persuaded and some of them left one after another.","However, even though these people had turned around, the topic was still revolving around the two of them.","” Clan Leader Huang and Young Master Li are really too nice. They are actually so humble, saying that this is not their credit...","“Isn’t that so? He’s so young, but he’s already so strong. It’s rare for him to be so approachable. It’s really not easy!”","“Such outstanding young people, the Sacred Phoenix Clan and Cloudy Qilin Clan actually want to separate them, there’s simply no justice! Those old fellows are simply incompetent!”","“What is it? There’s actually someone who wants to break them up?”","“Don’t you know? Sacred Phoenix Clan and Cloudy Qilin Clan were mortal enemies. Even though they had signed the peace agreement and no longer attacked each other, but they had never intermarried! I heard from a friend of mine that Patriarch Huang and Young Master Li eloped to our border town and coincidentally killed Heavenly Devil Auspicious River.”","“Aiyo, what a sin. How could this be? I hope Miss Huang and Master Li can get married smoothly.”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying had originally heaved a sigh of relief and were prepared to turn around and leave when they heard the discussions of the commoners.","Although these people had already walked far away, they did not control their volume when they spoke. The two people’s divine senses were very strong, so they could easily hear them clearly.","The two of them looked at each other, not knowing what to say.","Most of these ordinary people were still humans. The two of them, who had always been loners, felt a little strange and awkward when they saw how much they respected and loved them.","But at the same time, an indescribable feeling rose from the bottom of his heart.","“I realized that in the alliance army, it’s not bad to fight for the ordinary people. These people...Ahem, she’s really quite cute.” After a long while, Huang Yueli said in a low voice.","Li Moying’s thin lips curled up slightly,” How is it as cute as my Li ‘er? She blushed after being praised by others...”","Huang Yueli’s eyes instantly widened,” You must have seen wrongly? I’m not blushing! ”","“Why aren’t you blushing? Look here...” Li Moying leaned closer to Huang Yueli.","Just as the atmosphere between the two of them was ambiguous, a familiar voice suddenly sounded behind them.” How is it? Clan Leader Huang, Young Master Li, the two of you should have seen it just now, right? You ‘an City’s defenders and citizens are so grateful to the two of you. Won’t the two of you consider officially joining the alliance army and continue to protect them?”","The instant the voice rang out, Huang Yueli reacted and hurriedly pushed Li Moying to the side.","The face of the man who had failed to steal the kiss immediately darkened. He turned around and crossed his arms before his chest. His expression was cold as he swept a glance at Xuan Jiuling.","Xuan Jiuling’s line of sight was blocked by a pillar in the corridor, so he didn’t notice what the two of them were doing. When he called out for someone, he realized what he had destroyed. His old face instantly turned red, and he rubbed his nose and coughed twice.","“That... I still have something to do, so I’ll return to the hall first..","‘ Divine General Xuan, wait a minute. We were just about to go to the meeting hall to look for you. Let’s go together.”","It would have been better if Xuan Jiuling didn’t say anything but after he said that, Huang Yueli felt even more awkward as she turned around and glared at","Li Moying before turning around and walking towards Xuan Jiuling’s direction.","Li Moying narrowed his eyes as he gave a cold snort in displeasure.."]},{"number":4661,"title":"Chapter 4661: This old guy is very bad (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4661: This old guy is very bad (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","It was said that Xuan Jiuling had dedicated his entire life to the alliance army ever since he joined the alliance army when he was young and had yet to marry.","Li Moying felt that it wasn’t because of the alliance army that this old man couldn’t get a wife, but purely because he didn’t have good judgment.","She might as well not have said anything!","He actually kidnapped his little fox!","Li Moying silently cursed but his wife had already run away with the old man, what else could he do? He could only follow.","“How is it, Patriarch Huang, do you have any thoughts of joining the alliance army now? I see that you and Young Master Li are really suitable for the alliance army. Your strength, courage, and bearing are admirable.”","Hearing Xuan Jiuling’s words, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but smile,” Divine General Xuan, I’m starting to suspect that those cavalrymen and commoners at the entrance earlier weren’t specially gathered by you right? Just to lure us into joining the alliance?”","Xuan Jiuling was stunned. Then, he laughed.” What are you thinking? How is that possible?” The people at the entrance had really gathered spontaneously. Every time they defeated the Demon Army, they would come to thank the alliance army. However, this time, you guys have completely suppressed the limelight of the other soldiers! Are you really not going to consider it?”","Huang Yueli still shook her head,” Forget it, it’s not a problem for me to go into battle to kill the enemies, but for me to lead an entire army.... I don’t think I have the ability to do so.”","Xuan Jiuling frowned slightly as he really wanted to remind Huang Yueli that it","wasn’t that she didn’t have the innate talent to lead an army, but that she had it too much!","For a general, the most difficult thing was to establish his own prestige in the team. This was not something that could be done just by relying on outstanding strength. It also required a strong charisma and fairness in doing things.","Many powerful martial artists were very powerful in one-on-one combat, but it was often difficult for them to adapt to the position of a general. Many people had been in the alliance army for decades, but they were still unable to make the soldiers under them completely convinced.","But Huang Yueli was different. She was born with a kind of charm that made people unable to help but look up to her.","Xuan Chaoyi and the rest had followed Huang Yueli to carry out a mission and now they kept talking about how powerful the Huang Clan Leader was and even took the initiative to transfer to Huang Yueli’s hands.","Unfortunately, Huang Yueli wasn’t in the alliance army’s establishment so he definitely wouldn’t be able to satisfy Xuan Chaoyi and the rest’s request.","“Patriarch Huang, you have really underestimated yourself...However, you still have a family mission, so I can understand your choice.”","Xuan Jiuling sighed. He felt regretful, but he knew that he couldn’t force it.","The instant Huang Yueli and Li Moying stepped into the meeting hall, deafening applause rang out in the hall.","All the generals swarmed up and surrounded the two of them.","The two of them spent a lot of effort before they successfully persuaded everyone to sit back down.","However, from the words of these generals, they managed to figure out what had happened after their rest yesterday.","After Xuan Jiuling learned that Tianmo Ruijiang had died, he gathered the remaining elite troops in the garrison overnight. There were less than 10,000 people in total. With the cover of the dark night, they raided the demon camp.","Just as Huang Yueli and Li Moying had described, after the devil army lost the strong leadership of Heavenly Devil Auspicious River, they were led by the two of them to kill off many high ranking officers. The entire camp had descended into chaos and there were barely any soldiers patrolling at night.."]},{"number":4662,"title":"Chapter 4662: This old guy is very bad (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4662: This old guy is very bad (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","It could be said that the fiend race camp was already defenseless against the outside world.","Although Xuan Jiuling’s alliance army was only one-third the size of the demon army, they came with a strong fighting spirit, determined to avenge their fallen comrades.","Facing the scattered Demon Army, Xuan Jiuling led his troops straight into the battlefield. They did not encounter much resistance throughout the entire process, and the situation was completely one-sided.","The battle only ended when the sky was bright.","Xuan Jiuling gathered his troops again and returned to You ‘an City. He did a headcount and realized that there were very few casualties, only a few hundred people. The casualties in the previous battles were often in the tens of thousands, which was simply disproportionate.","And from the magic crystals that the soldiers had handed over, they had wiped out tens of thousands of demons!","For a moment, the entire You ‘an City was in an uproar, and cheers resounded through the clouds.","As Meng Shurong had put up the announcement of Huang Yueli and Li Moying killing Heavenly Devil Auspicious River last night in order to appease the hearts of the people, so almost everyone in You ‘an City knew that this city could be preserved because of the two of them.","From the morning when the allied forces returned with a huge victory, there had been a continuous stream of commoners coming to the City Lord’s Estate’s entrance, wanting to take a look at Huang Yueli and Li Moying.","Meng Shurong had already asked people to chase him away a few times, but he still could not stop everyone’s enthusiasm.","Xuan Jiuling coughed a few times, and the meeting hall finally quieted down.","He then said in a deep voice,” Alright, everyone is here now. The commanders fought bravely yesterday. I am very pleased. Next, I will announce the situation of yesterday’s battle. There are a few teams that performed particularly well...’","Xuan Jiuling quickly returned to the main topic. He rewarded the commanders for their contributions in the surprise attack on the Demon Army and discussed the next step of the plan.","All these made Huang Yueli drowsy.","If she had known that Xuan Jiuling had asked them to come to the meeting hall for a meeting, she wouldn’t have come! She would rather hide in her room and pretend to be asleep.","At this moment, she calmed down and felt a little lucky. Fortunately, she was not overwhelmed by emotions and immediately nodded to join the alliance army.","If she had meetings like this every day, she would really be annoyed to death. It would also waste her time cultivating and being alone with her husband.","The meeting finally ended at noon.","Huang Yueli was overjoyed as she immediately stood up and pulled her husband to wipe the oil under her feet.","However, she had only taken a step when she was stopped by Xuan Jiuling.","“Patriarch Huang, please wait.”","Huang Yueli’s face instantly crumbled but she could only patiently reply: Profound Divine General, isn’t the matter already discussed? Is there anything else you haven’t finished?”","Although her gloominess had only flashed for a moment and was quickly covered up, it did not escape Xuan Jiuling’s eyes.","Looking at her expression, Xuan Jiuling was secretly amused, thinking that Huang Yueli had matured so early. At this moment, he could see that she was still a young lass who had not reached the age of adulthood. Putting aside her shocking ability and courage, her character was quite cute.","“Ahem, ahem, I want to say that I can reward the soldiers under my command according to their merits. However, your contributions are too great for a mere Divine General like me to decide. I’ve already written down your deeds in a letter and sent it back to the alliance headquarters. At that time, the headquarters will have someone to contact the two of you..”"]},{"number":4663,"title":"Chapter 4663: This old guy is very bad (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4663: This old guy is very bad (7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Huang Yueli heard that, she hurriedly replied: ” Divine General Xuan, you’re really too polite. Actually, we don’t need anything else. As long as you can give us the military merits, that’s enough.”","“Of course, there’s no lack of military merits.” Xuan Jiuling stroked his beard and smiled. “More importantly, it has been many years since the alliance army has killed a demon on the level of Heavenly Devil Auspicious River. The headquarters should publicize your deeds in the twelve continents. This way, it can also strengthen the reputation of our alliance army and attract more young martial artists to join the alliance army...”","“Ahem, I think... There’s no need for that...” When Huang Yueli heard this, she almost choked.","He deeply felt what it meant to shoot himself in the foot!","If her and Li Moying’s portrait were to be pasted all over the streets and alleys of the twelve continents, those who knew would say that it was a commendation but those who didn’t know would think that it was a wanted poster!","Moreover, to the two of them, this was no different from a wanted order.","They were still on the way to elope.","There weren’t many people who knew them in the past. At least in a small town, they didn’t have to worry about being recognized. If everyone knew about them, wouldn’t they have to disguise themselves even if they were farming in the countryside?","However, it wasn’t good to say this to Xuan Jiuling.","Huang Yueli had declined several times but Xuan Jiuling insisted that this was the lofty honor that the two of them deserved and the alliance army definitely wouldn’t mistreat them, so much so that Huang Yueli almost vomited blood.","Xuan Jiuling did not forget to remind the two of them that there would be a celebration banquet at night in the City Lord’s Estate. All the soldiers who had made contributions in the battle were invited to attend.","Huang Yueli nodded her head perfunctorily as she pulled her husband and ran.","He slipped away!","He couldn’t afford to offend her, he couldn’t afford to offend her!","Xuan Jiuling and Meng Shurong looked at their backs and sighed.","“It’s not easy. You’re so young and so powerful, yet you’re still so low-key and humble. “If it were any other young martial artist, let alone killing an expert like Heavenly Devil Rui Jiang, even if they killed a peak Earth Demon, they would probably spread it everywhere, afraid that others would not know that they are actually so indifferent to fame and fortune...”","“That’s right, Patriarch Huang and Young Master Li are really rare. However, we can’t stop publicizing their achievements just because they keep a low profile. Isn’t this bullying honest people? I, Old Meng, would never do such a thing.”","Xuan Jiuling turned his head unhappily and glared at Meng Shurong.” Look at what you’re saying. It’s as if I, Xuan Jiuling, am this kind of person who bullies the good and fears the evil! I also cherish talent! That’s right, the more low-key they are, the more we have to help them fight for the glory they deserve! How could he let them suffer? We must let everyone in the twelve continents know!”","If Huang Yueli had left a step later and overheard their conversation, she would definitely burst into tears.","Unfortunately, she had only wanted to slip away, so she pulled her husband and walked very quickly. By this time, they had already gone far away.","Returning to her room, Huang Yueli packed up her things and wanted to bring her husband to run away. It would be best if she could leave You ‘an City directly.","Although the surroundings of You An City wasn’t very safe, but in Huang Yueli’s eyes, it was at least safer than the inside of You An City.","She was very worried now. If she continued to stay in You ‘an City, she might be swindled by Xuan Jiuling. This old Divine General usually looked quite serious, but he was actually very evil. He would swindle people one after another. If his will was not firm and he really agreed to join the alliance army, then it would be over.."]},{"number":4664,"title":"Chapter 4664: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(l)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4664: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(l)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying looked at Huang Yueli’s anxious look and couldn’t help but laugh as he shook his head.","He knew it. Although his little fox always said that she would think for herself and that other people’s lives had nothing to do with her, in fact, her heart was better than anyone else.","If others treated her well, she would repay them tenfold.","If not for that, why would she care about what Xuan Jiuling and the soldiers of the alliance army thought, or what the citizens of You ‘an City thought?","However, Li Moying didn’t say anything to persuade her, but just silently watched her pack her luggage, occasionally giving her a hand.","Anyway, they would have to leave You ‘an City sooner or later. It might not be a bad time to leave now.","The two of them didn’t bring much with them, only some elixirs for replenishment, as well as the materials that Huang Yueli used to refine her armament. These were all exchanged with their military merits from Meng Shurong yesterday.","Not long after, Huang Yueli had finished counting all the things she had brought and with a wave of her pen, she wrote a short farewell letter to Xuan Jiuling and Meng Shurong.","When everything was settled, Li Moying said,” Li ‘er, if you really want to leave, we’d better take this opportunity to leave now. Most of the maids and guards should be preparing for the celebration banquet tonight. No one will notice that we’ve left.’","Huang Yueli nodded her head,” That’s my plan too. Let’s go now!”","She pushed open the door and poked her head out. She saw a familiar figure at the other end of the corridor.","Huang Yueli was slightly startled as she immediately retracted her head and closed the door.","Her actions were too fast and Li Moying didn’t see clearly as he turned around to ask her,” What’s wrong? Is there someone outside?”","Huang Yueli nodded her head,” Yes, there was someone passing by and it was someone we know, White Tiger Race’s Jing Shaoyuan! If we bump into him, I’m afraid we’ll have to waste a lot of time. Let’s wait until he leaves.’","Li Moying naturally had no objections.","However, Jing Shaoyuan had not fully recovered from the injuries he had suffered from Jun Sihan, so he limped and walked very slowly.","The two of them sat in the room and heard the sound of a walking stick hitting the ground. After a while, Jing Shaoyuan passed by their room.","There was still half a way to go from their room to the other end of the corridor!","Huang Yueli was getting impatient when she suddenly heard someone knocking on the door.","“Bang bang bang! ”","“Patriarch Huang, Young Master Li, I am Jing Shaoyuan from the White Tiger Race. I am here to pay you a visit!”","Jing Shaovuan’s voice came from outside the door.","Huang Yueli’s face was filled with astonishment as she exchanged glances with Li Moying.","She had never expected Jing Shaoyuan to come looking for them!","Was there a mistake?","The two of them had fought Jing Shaoyuan on the demon battlefield a dozen days ago, so Jing Shaoyuan should have known by now that they were the two demons.","In addition, the two of them had slapped Jing Shaoyuan in the face at the city gate yesterday.","With Jing Shaoyuan’s arrogant personality, shouldn’t he be avoiding the two of them at this time? Why did he come looking for her?","Just as the two of them were in shock, Jing Shaoyuan knocked on the door again.","“Patriarch Huang, Young Master Li, can I trouble the two of you to open the door? When Miss Huang opened the door just now, I saw the two of you. You should be in the room, right? I have something important to tell you, so please do me a favor.."]},{"number":4665,"title":"Chapter 4665: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4665: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","This time, Huang Yueli had nothing to say.","That’s right, she was so unlucky. She wanted to open the door to look for the way, but she was caught by someone. If she wanted to pretend that she was not there at this time...lt wasn’t that she couldn’t, but her curiosity was piqued by Jing Shaoyuan’s words. She wanted to know what he was here for.","So Huang Yueli stood up and went to open the door for him.","The one standing at the entrance was indeed a red-haired genius of the White Tiger Race.","Jing Shaoyuan did not wear his usual silver light armor. Instead, he had changed into a long robe. His long red hair, which was usually scattered around his ears, was also tied up in a purple-gold crown. He was dressed like a young master from a noble family.","The White Tiger Race cultivators had always had rough looks, and Jing Shaoyuan was the same. Although his facial features were still quite handsome, because of his valiant aura, he still looked a little fierce.","But today, with her dressing up, she actually looked like a dog.","Unfortunately, the walking stick beside him betrayed the fact that he was a cripple.","Huang Yueli sized him up from head to toe before saying: ” Commander Jing, your leg hasn’t fully recovered right? At that time, on the demon battlefield, the situation forced my husband and I to act. If we have offended you, please forgive us. However, since your leg hasn’t recovered, why didn’t you rest at home? Why did you come here?”","Jing Shaoyuan took a few steps inside and suddenly flung away the walking stick in his hand as he bent over and gave a deep bow towards Huang Yueli and Li Moying.","“Patriarch Huang, Young Master Li, I came here today to apologize to the two of you. In the past, I thought highly of myself. When I saw that the two of you were far more talented than me, I was always a little unconvinced. Under my impulse, I did many things that I shouldn’t have done and caused the two of you a lot of trouble. Fortunately, you were magnanimous and didn’t hold it against me. However, I still owe you this apology.”","When Huang Yueli heard these words, her eyeballs almost popped out.","“Ahem, Commander Jing, you...You don’t have a fever, do you? Although the external injuries don’t seem serious, if you don’t treat them properly, it will still cause a high fever. You should find a doctor to take a good look. You can’t hide your illness from the doctor...”","No wonder Huang Yueli was so surprised. She really had never imagined that Jing Shaoyuan would actually say such words.","The few times they had interacted with Jing Shaoyuan, they had always ended in an argument.","It was already good enough that Jing Shaoyuan didn’t go against them, but now he was apologizing to them?","Jing Shaoyuan smiled bitterly and sighed.” Patriarch Huang, please don’t mock me. I’m here to apologize sincerely.” “I know that my past actions have made you look down on me, but I really have already recognized my mistakes. At the end of the day, it’s all because I overestimated myself. Actually, compared to the two of you, I, the number one genius of the White Tiger Race, am nothing!”","Jing Shaoyuan’s attitude was too sincere which made Huang Yueli even more confused.","She turned her head and cast a questioning glance at her husband.","Li Moying still had his usual cold and indifferent look as his expression didn’t change. He stared at Jing Shaoyuan for a while before opening his mouth lightly, ” Commander Jing, you’re being too polite with your words. We didn’t feel offended by you. It’s normal for young martial artists to compete with each other. We don’t hold a grudge because of this..”"]},{"number":4666,"title":"Chapter 4666: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4666: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Jing Shaoyuan heaved a sigh of relief.” That’s good, that’s good. I knew you two were broad-minded people.”","However, he was still a little uneasy. After a while, he could not help but explain,” Also, on the city tower yesterday, I did not deliberately prevent the two of you from entering the city. I believe the two of you should know the situation at that time. I was just worried that a demon spy would take advantage of the chaos to sneak into the city...","Not waiting for him to finish, Li Moying raised his hand to stop him from continuing.","“Commander Jing, you are thinking for the sake of the alliance army and both Li ‘er and I understand so you don’t need to explain. If it was me and Li ‘er on the city gate tower, we might not let you in so this is normal.”","“That’s right, you don’t have to take it to heart.” Huang Yueli added.","Jing Shaoyuan stole a glance at them for a while and found that the two of them did not seem to be being polite. Instead, they looked quite sincere, and he was finally relieved.","“That’s great. Patriarch Huang, Young Master Li, I’m relieved that the two of you don’t mind. Otherwise, I’m really worried that the two of you are unwilling to join the alliance army because of me. Then, I’ll really be the sinner of the entire alliance army! My comrades who sacrificed themselves for You ‘an City will never forgive me underground.”","When Huang Yueli heard this, she finally understood why Jing Shaoyuan had specially come looking for her.","He was probably carrying the pressure from the alliance army.","Regardless, Jing Shaoyuan was an arrogant man, yet he had lowered himself to the point where he could be beaten and scolded at will. It was already a rare occasion for him to apologize in person. It also meant that he had indeed recognized his past mistakes.","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli instantly felt gratified.","The genius warriors of the God Clan were fewer than the Demon Clan. If possible, she didn’t want to make enemies with the geniuses of other clans. She would rather fight side by side with them.","To be able to make use of this opportunity to turn enemies into friends with Jing Shaoyuan was definitely a good thing for her and Li Moying.","Jing Shaoyuan obviously thought so too.","After he exchanged a few words with Huang Yueli and Li Moying, the three of them gradually became familiar with each other and the awkwardness that filled the entire room earlier dissipated by quite a bit.","Huang Yueli then realised that Jing Shaoyuan was actually quite a bit. This fellow’s character was forthright, decisive, daring to take responsibility for his actions and his relationship with the allied army was really not bad. When it came to gossip in the army, he was even able to provide Huang Yueli and the rest with a lot of insider information.","Jing Shaoyuan suddenly remembered something and stood up. He took out a wine gourd from his waist and placed it on the table.","“Oh right, I almost forgot. Today, I specially brought over the good wine that I have treasured for many years. I want to toast the two of you. I wonder if the two of you are willing to do me the honor? This wine...lt’s a Tiger Bone Brew unique to our White Tiger Race. There’s even a trace of the bone marrow of an ancient divine beast, the White Tiger. Not only is it rich, but it’s also beneficial to one’s cultivation after drinking it. The longer this Tiger Bone Wine is placed, the more mellow it becomes. This gourd of mine is even older than my age!”","Jing Shaoyuan was already in his fifties, so this bottle of wine must be at least sixty years old.","Huang Yueli herself wasn’t a very good drinker and after hearing Jing Shaoyuan’s introduction, her curiosity was piqued and she couldn’t help but want to have a taste.","After all, this Tiger Bone Wine was not an ordinary fine wine. It was not something that could be drunk anywhere.."]},{"number":4667,"title":"Chapter 4667: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4667: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","In the current Divine Realm, ancient divine beasts were practically extinct. The remains of the divine beasts of the various large families were all collected as family treasures.","This Tiger Bone Brew was made from the bone marrow of a white tiger. Even if there was only a trace of it, it was already very luxurious and precious.","Moreover, the bottle of wine that Jing Shaoyuan had brought over had been stored for such a long time. It was a rare wine that could not be bought with money.","Since Huang Yueli was so moved, Li Moying himself was a good drinker so naturally his interest was piqued.","Seeing the anticipation on the faces of the two, Jing Shaoyuan instantly felt proud. He took out a bottle stopper and personally poured wine for the two of them, not forgetting to brag about the wine-brewing techniques of his White Tiger Race.","“Patriarch Huang, Young Master Li, both of you ascended to the Divine Realm from the lower realm. I reckon that you don’t know much about the situation of the various large families, right? Actually, the twelve great clans of the God Race all have their own unique skills that they are good at. For example, the Sacred Phoenix Clan is good at refining weapons, the Cloudy Qilin Clan is good at treasure hunting, and our White Tiger Clan is the best at wine brewing!”","“Other than the most famous Tiger Bone Wine, our clan also has thousands of recipes for brewing wine. Each of them has a different effect. Some of them are even more powerful than medicinal pills! If there’s a chance, you can come to the White Tiger Continent. I’ll take you to visit our underground wine cellar.” “Alright, the two of you, come. We can drink to the brim.”","Huang Yueli raised her wine cup as she carefully observed the wine in the cup.","The Tiger Bone Wine looked extremely clear and had a completely transparent color. It looked no different from ordinary water.","However, this wine emitted a strong fragrance. This fragrance could not even smell the alcohol, but it was enough to make people dizzy when they really inhaled it.","And even under the cover of the fragrance, Huang Yueli could clearly feel a powerful energy contained within.","The three of them raised their glasses at the same time.","Huang Yueli gave a slight smile,” We can also be considered as...A smile and all grudges?”","Jing Shaoyuan nodded repeatedly. The three of them saluted each other, raised their heads, and downed their drinks.","Not only did this Tiger Bone Wine look different, but it also tasted extremely sweet and refreshing. It was like a clear spring. After swallowing it, there was still a lingering fragrance in the mouth.","As the wine entered his stomach, a wave of heat rose from his dantian and spread through his meridians to his limbs and bones.","This feeling was too comfortable. It was as if his entire body was soaked in warm water, and all the pressure seemed to have disappeared.","“Have you sensed it already?” Jing Shaoyuan explained with a smile. I wasn’t just bragging when I said that this Tiger Bone Brew was beneficial to cultivation, right? Why don’t the two of you sit quietly for a moment and let the mystic qi contained in the wine circulate through your bodies for a large circulation. It will be very beneficial to your cultivation.”","When Huang Yueli and Li Moying heard that, they both put down their wine cups as their palms faced the sky as they held their breaths and concentrated as they started to circulate their cultivation methods.","Just as Jing Shaoyuan had said, the Xuan Qi had completely merged into their bodies after going through a large circulation, becoming one with their own Xuan Energy.","However, his strength did not increase by much.","Huang Yueli thought for a moment and understood that this was most likely because their cultivation was too high.","If the same bottle of Tiger Bone Wine was given to a martial artist at the early or middle stages of the Heart Profound Realm, the effect would definitely be very obvious.."]},{"number":4668,"title":"Chapter 4668: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4668: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","To her and Li Moying, it seemed to be of little value.","However, this did not mean that there was a problem with the recipe.","Tiger Bone Brew was indeed a sharp weapon that could promote cultivation. However, due to the rarity of White Tiger Bone Marrow, there was too little of it.","If she added ten times more White Tiger Bone Marrow, it would probably be effective on her and Li Moying.","Jing Shaoyuan didn’t expect this. He looked at the two of them expectantly and asked,” How is it?” What do the two of you think?”","Huang Yueli nodded and smiled: ” This Tiger Bone Wine is indeed extraordinary! As expected of the White Tiger Clan’s inheritance! I’ve drunk a lot of wine in the lower realm, but I’ve never drunk such a fine wine. It really opened my eyes! Moying, what do you think?”","Li Moying nodded slightly, ” Wifey is right. This is indeed the best wine I’ve ever drunk. However, this Tiger Bone Wine is so precious. Aren’t you being a little too polite by taking it out for us to drink like this?”","With Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s status, to say such words of praise made Jing Shaoyuan extremely happy.","“Of course, you have to bring out good wine to apologize to someone. Besides, I get along well with you guys!” he said boldly. Come, come, come. I’ll fill your glasses again and drink another cup! I won’t go home until I’m drunk!”","Huang Yueli really wanted to say that there would be a celebratory banquet hosted by Divine General Profound and City Lord Meng later on.","With Jing Shaoyuan’s interference, her and Li Moying’s plan to sneak away had already gone down the drain and they could only attend the banquet later.","If he got drunk now, how would he face people later?","However, the taste of this Tiger Bone Brew was simply too wonderful. The rich fragrance was like a hook, making people unable to help but be attracted to it.","It shouldn’t be a problem to drink another glass, right?","It was rare for Huang Yueli to lose control of herself as she raised her wine cup again.","‘ This toast, I wish You ‘an City will forever be impregnable!”","After Huang Yueli finished her speech, she brought the cup to her mouth and raised her head, preparing to finish it in one gulp.","Who knew that at this moment, she suddenly felt a wave of nausea in her chest and a throbbing pain in her head. Her vision instantly darkened...","Clang!","The wine glass rolled from her fair and slender fingers and shattered on the ground.","Huang Yueli’s body tilted to the right and fell down.","Li Moying’s reaction was extremely fast as he noticed that Huang Yueli’s situation wasn’t right as he pounced towards her at the first instance and caught her just before she landed.","“Li Jer, Li’ er! What’s wrong with you? What had just happened? Li ‘er, you... Wake up!”","Li Moying hugged Huang Yueli’s petite body as he anxiously called out by her ear.","However, Huang Yueli seemed to have lost consciousness as her eyes were tightly shut, not moving at all.","Li Moying’s mind instantly buzzed as a wave of fury rushed straight to his chest.","He gently placed Huang Yueli back on the ground and turned around, grabbing Jing Shaoyuan’s collar and lifting him up.","Li Moying’s eyes were bloodshot as he stared at Jing Shaoyuan. He gritted his teeth and said,” Jing Shaoyuan, what did you put in the wine?” How did Li ‘er faint? What did you do to her?”","Jing Shaoyuan was squatting beside Huang Yueli as he stuck his head out to take a look when he was suddenly lifted up by Li Moying.","The speed at which Li Moying attacked was simply too fast.","The White Tiger Race mainly cultivated wind attribute cultivation techniques and was known for their speed. Jing Shaoyuan was one of the best and had always been proud of this.","But under Li Moying’s hands, she didn’t even have a chance to resist.."]},{"number":4669,"title":"Chapter 4669: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4669: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","By the time Jing Shaoyuan regained his senses, all his meridians had been restrained by Li Moying and he was totally unable to move.","Just like a bird being held in the palm of someone’s hand, as long as Li Moying exerted strength, he could strangle him to death.","It was only until this moment that Jing Shaoyuan realised that the difference strength between him and Li Moying was so huge!","Previously in that clash on the demon battlefield, Li Moying had not displayed his true strength and was purely teasing him!","Following that, Jing Shaoyuan heard Li Moying’s question and was instantly stunned.","“Wha... What was that? Wine... There was a problem with the wine? How is that possible?”","“You’re still pretending? Li ‘er had drunk your wine which was why she fainted! If it’s not because of your wine, what else can it be?”","Li Moying’s eyes were filled with rage as the hand that was strangling his neck tightened. Jing Shaoyuan could almost hear the cracking sounds coming from his neck as his vision turned black and he almost fainted on the spot.","Just as Jing Shaoyuan thought that he would be strangled to death, Li Moying’s hand suddenly loosened and he was flung onto the ground.","Jing Shaoyuan kept coughing as he struggled to get up from the ground, not caring about his injuries as he rushed towards Li Moying to explain.","“Li... Young Master Li, you said that 1...1 poisoned the wine? This... This was definitely a huge injustice!","This is indeed our White Tiger Race’s Tiger Bone Wine. It’s authentic and I definitely didn’t add anything! Moreover, Young Master Li, didn’t you drink too? Do you think there’s something added to the wine? Also, I... I’ll drink it too!","If there’s really a problem with the wine, is there a need for me to die?” Li Moying had just seen Huang Yueli faint and was really too flustered.","To him, even if Huang Yueli cut her finger, it was already a huge matter, let alone now, she had fainted without saying a word?","In his anger, he didn’t even have time to think. His first reaction was that there was something wrong with the wine and he dragged Jing Shaoyuan over to question him.","After all, Jing Shaoyuan’s history wasn’t clean either. He had caused them trouble many times in the past. Although he had taken the initiative to make peace with them, what if he was just putting on an act and was actually using this opportunity to kill them?","Now, after hearing Jing Shaoyuan’s explanation, Li Moying gradually calmed down.","Jing Shaoyuan was right.","Earlier when he poured the wine, it was in front of Li Moying so whatever he wanted to do, it couldn’t escape his eyes.","Moreover, after Li Moying drank the Tiger Bone Wine, his entire body felt relaxed and he didn’t feel any discomfort at all. This indirectly proved that this wine was indeed good wine, at least it wasn’t poisonous.","Li Moying took in a deep breath as he pursed his lips,” What you said makes sense. I was too impulsive earlier so I’m sorry, Commander Jing.”","“It’s fine, it’s fine. Everyone knows that Young Master Li has a deep relationship with Patriarch Huang. It’s normal for you to be worried when Patriarch Huang is in trouble.”","Jing Shaoyuan rubbed his neck that was about to break and smiled bitterly.","Facing such powerful strength, even if he was not satisfied, what could he do?","In the Divine Realm where strength was king, even if Li Moying killed him with a single slap, he wouldn’t have any ability to resist.","Luckily, Li Moying was still reasonable and was willing to listen to his explanation.","Li Moying couldn’t be bothered to consider Jing Shaoyuan’s feelings.."]},{"number":4670,"title":"Chapter 4670: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4670: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","After he let go of Jing Shaoyuan, he immediately returned to Huang Yueli’s side and patted her little face once again.","“Li ‘er, Li’ er? Wake up, wake up! What’s wrong with you? Don’t scare me...”","However, Huang Yueli was still lying motionlessly on the ground, as though she had not heard his voice at all.","Jing Shaoyuan walked over as well. He lowered his head to observe the situation for a while before suddenly saying,” Young Master Li, I think...” Is Patriarch Huang drunk?”","“Drunk?” Li Moying frowned,” Why do you think so?”","Jing Shaoyuan analyzed.” Young Master Li, you might not know this, but the wine brewed by the White Tiger Race is very intoxicating. If it was an ordinary human at the early stage of the Profound Meaning Realm, he would be drunk from just a drop of Tiger Bone Wine. If Patriarch Huang’s alcohol tolerance was not good, getting drunk was also a common occurrence. Moreover...”","“Moreover, tribe leader Huang does not seem to be unwell. Although she has fainted, I can see that her breathing is stable. Her face is also slightly flushed, as if she is a little drunk...","Hearing Jing Shaoyuan’s words, Li Moying’s heart moved slightly as he felt that what he said made sense.","But soon, he shook his head and rejected this guess.” I don’t think so. Although Li ‘er wasn’t an alcoholic, but her alcohol tolerance wasn’t bad. When she was in the Lower Realm, she had once competed with someone to drink and it could be said that she didn’t fall even after a thousand cups. Moreover, the higher a martial artist’s cultivation was, the better their alcohol tolerance. With her current cultivation, would she be knocked down by a cup of Tiger Bone Wine?","This is too abnormal.”","“Uh, this...That’s true...” Jing Shaoyuan also felt that something was wrong.","Seeing that Li Moying was sweating profusely from anxiety, he didn’t dare to act rashly and could only suggest ideas from the side.","“How about this, Young Lord Li, carry Patriarch Huang to the bed first. It’s even more uncomfortable to lie on the ground like this. I’ll inform Divine General","Xuan and City Lord Meng about this and ask them to invite the best doctor in","You ‘an City to treat Patriarch Huang...”","“Alright, let’s do that. Go and get the doctor to come over as soon as possible!” Li Moying immediately nodded in agreement.","Jing Shaoyuan didn’t dare to delay any further. He got up and left the room, running along the corridor.","Li Moying bent down and carried Huang Yueli up horizontally, gently placing her on the soft bed.","He even took off her boots, loosened her collar, and stuffed her under the blanket.","Throughout the entire process, Huang Yueli seemed to have fallen asleep as she laid softly in his embrace, allowing Li Moying to manipulate her.","Her body temperature was even higher than usual.","However, both her breathing and pulse were very stable.","Li Moying frowned as he sat by the bed, trying a few methods to wake her up, even lowering his head to kiss her but to no avail.","Li Moying was anxious and uneasy as he wanted to personally go out to look for a doctor for Huang Yueli but he was also worried that if he left, no one would take care of her.","Luckily, Jing Shaoyuan’s efficiency was very high and just as Li Moying was in a dilemma, he brought a large group of people and rushed over.","“Young Master Li, how is it? How’s Clan Leader Huang? Has she woken up? Divine General Xuan and City Lord Meng are here.”","Jing Shaoyuan’s voice was heard before he arrived.","A group of people pushed open the door and entered. The one walking in front was Xuan Jiuling, who had an anxious expression on his face. He took three steps and rushed to Huang Yueli’s bedside.."]},{"number":4671,"title":"Chapter 4671: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4671: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xuan Jiuling lowered his head to take a look and immediately frowned. His expression was filled with undisguised worry.","“This... What was going on? Is Patriarch Huang still not awake?”","Li Moying shook his head and didn’t say anything.","“This...” Xuan Jiuling said anxiously. How could such a thing happen? I just heard from Jing Shaoyuan that Patriarch Huang fainted after drinking the Tiger Bone Wine he brought from home. However, I’ve drunk this wine before and it only has the effect of increasing the Profound Energy density. There shouldn’t be such a problem at all?”","Li Moying replied in a deep voice,” There’s no problem with me drinking, but.. Sigh, perhaps Li ‘er did not faint because of the wine.”","“Could it be that he suffered internal injuries during the battle with the Heavenly Devil Auspicious River? It didn’t show up before, but it only acted up now?” Xuan Jiuling frowned and guessed.","Meng Shurong cut in.” Alright, Brother Xuan, stop guessing blindly. Move aside and let Divine Doctor Wu take a look.” Young Master Li, this Divine Doctor Wu is the head of the military doctors stationed in You ‘an City. He is the person with the highest medical skills in the city. He happened to be a guest in my residence today. It’s really a coincidence.”","He gave a simple explanation to Li Moying and stepped aside a little, inviting Divine Doctor Wu to step forward.","Divine Doctor Wu looked like a middle-aged man with a goatee and a scholarly look.","He sat down on the chair beside the bed and first observed Huang Yueli’s expression as he revealed a doubtful expression,” This...” It looked like the symptoms of drunkenness. However, if he was just drunk, he shouldn’t have been unconscious all this time, right? Young Master Li, have you tried giving Patriarch Huang some pills to sober her up?","Li Moying immediately replied,” When Wifey and I went out, we brought along quite a number of heat-clearing and detoxifying pills. Earlier I’ve already fed her a few heart-rinsing pills but it doesn’t seem to have any effect.”","“Heart rinsing pill? How many more?” Divine Doctor Wu was shocked.","This Heart Washing Pill was a heaven-grade medicinal pill. Although it was very effective in relieving hangovers, its more important function was to relieve thousands of different symptoms of poisoning. It could be said to be a divine medicine that was difficult to obtain with ten thousand gold.","Most people would not be willing to eat one unless they were about to die.","Li Moying actually used it as a hangover medicine and even took a few pills at Divine Doctor Wu really wanted to complain about ” wasting God’s gift ” but when he saw Li Moying’s cold and handsome face, he immediately swallowed all the words that he didn’t say back into his stomach.","As expected of the most talented husband and wife in the Divine Realm. They were indeed rich and overbearing, and could not be provoked!","“Why are you looking at me? What’s the situation with Li ‘er?” Li Moying urged unhappily.","Divine Doctor Wu jolted awake. He quickly said,” I can’t tell yet. Let me feel her pulse.”","As he said that, Divine Doctor Wu stretched out his hand and touched the pulse on Huang Yueli’s wrist.","Soon, he let out a surprised sound.","Everyone stared at him, thinking that he would say something. However, Divine Doctor Wu did not say anything. Instead, he closed his eyes, as if he was feeling something.","The process of taking his pulse lasted for a long time.","Everyone present did not dare to make a sound and waited quietly.","As time went by, Li Moying felt even more uneasy.","Huang Yueli’s body had the evil aura that came from cultivating the Wicked Shadow Canon so she couldn’t let outsiders know about it.","However, this was not what he was worried about.."]},{"number":4672,"title":"Chapter 4672: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4672: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(9)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","According to Li Moying’s experience, almost all the doctors in the twelve continents of the Gods Race couldn’t identify the evil aura.","Previously, there was once when he and Huang Yueli were outside Saint Xie Ying’s cave dwelling and were chased by Huang Sanbai and the rest. Under his heavy injuries, he had inhaled too much evil energy which resulted in him falling unconscious.","At that time, Cloudy Qilin Clan invited countless divine doctors to give him a diagnosis, but none of them knew what the situation was.","It was Huang Yueli who had personally infiltrated Cloudy Qilin Continent and changed her appearance to his side, to dual cultivate with him, that had woken him up.","So Li Moying had full confidence that a mere doctor like Divine Doctor Wu would not be able to see through Huang Yueli’s secret.","But it was precisely because of this that Divine Doctor Wu didn’t speak for a","long time which made Li Moying feel even more uneasy.","He couldn’t help but guess. Could it be that his little fox had really suffered some serious internal injuries that caused her to become like this?","Now that he thought about it, the abnormality on Huang Yueli’s body had already been there for a long time and it wasn’t just today.","Earlier on when they exchanged blows with Heavenly Devil Auspicious River, Huang Yueli had clearly chosen to self-destruct but she failed to succeed and all her Profound Energy was sucked dry...At that time, he felt that Huang Yueli’s physical condition was abnormal.","Could it be that she had left behind some kind of injury when she self-destructed, and he actually did not notice it?","After a very long time, Divine Doctor Wu opened his eyes and the hand on Huang Yueli’s wrist also dropped down.","Li Moying couldn’t wait any longer as he impatiently asked,” Divine Doctor Wu, how is my wifey?”","Divine Doctor Wu took a glance at Li Moying and frowned slightly, ” This...l don’t really understand either. From your wife’s pulse, there shouldn’t be any major problems with her body. In fact, the Profound Energy in her body is far more abundant than those of the same cultivation level, so her body should be much better than ordinary people.”","Li Moying’s handsome brows furrowed,” Since that’s the case, why did my wifey faint and why hasn’t she woken up till now?”","“Well...l have a theory.” Divine Doctor Wu pondered for a moment and suddenly said.","Li Moying’s heart skipped a beat as he hurriedly asked,” What guess?”","“It’s like this, Young Master Li, please calm down and listen to this old man slowly. In my opinion, there should be no problem with your wife’s body. However, when I wanted to check if she had any internal injuries, I discovered that there was an extremely powerful and pure energy in her body...” “Powerful and pure energy?” Li Moying was startled.","His first reaction was that the evil aura in Huang Yueli’s body had been discovered.","However, Divine Doctor Wu’s next words quickly dispelled his doubts.","“Yes, this energy is in your wife’s lower abdomen. Based on my experience, this should be the accumulation of Profound Energy caused by cultivating some special cultivation method. I guess that your wife must have been careless when cultivating, or she was only affected by the special cultivation method, which is why she fainted. As for the specifics, this old man doesn’t know. Young Master Li, as the husband of Patriarch Huang, you should know better than this old man.”","Hearing this, not only did Li Moying not relax, his brows furrowed even tighter.","That’s right, Divine Doctor Wu was right. Regarding Huang Yueli’s cultivation situation, he should be clearer than anyone else! However, he did not know what was going on!","This was the reason why he felt uneasy.."]},{"number":4673,"title":"Chapter 4673: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4673: Li ‘er, quickly wake up!(10)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","But since Divine Doctor Wu had said so, it meant that Huang Yueli’s body should not have too much of a problem.","“Young Master Li, your wife’s body is very normal. She might have fainted because she’s about to advance. This is something that can’t be treated by external forces. I suggest that you let your wife have a good rest. When she absorbs the accumulated energy in her body, she should wake up.”","Li Moying frowned as he asked,” Divine Doctor Wu, according to your judgement, when will my wifey wake up?”","Divine Doctor Wu choked.” This...” Well...This was hard to say. This is the first time I’ve encountered such a situation. If it’s fast, I might wake up immediately. If it’s slow, I might... It might take many days...”","Saying this was equivalent to not saying anything!","Li Moying was originally anxious and upon hearing this Divine Doctor Wu’s unreliable words, his expression turned even uglier.","Xuan Jiuling saw this and couldn’t help but walk over. He interrupted,” Divine Doctor Wu, think about it. Is there any way to make Patriarch Huang wake up earlier?” She and Young Master Li are the greatest heroes who saved You ‘an City. Everyone is waiting to see her at tonight’s celebration party!”","“If there was a way, I would have said it long ago. Why would I have to wait until now?” Divine Doctor Wu smiled bitterly. From the looks of it, letting her recuperate is the most effective...”","“In that case, I’ll have to trouble Divine Doctor Wu to wait by the side. If my wifey is unwell, we can treat her in time and leave after my wifey wakes up.” Li Moying suddenly said.","“What is it? But...","Divine Doctor Wu subconsciously wanted to refuse.","Forget about You ‘an City, even before he joined the alliance army, he, Old Wu, was a famous divine doctor in the Divine Realm. Which family didn’t respectfully invite him to see a doctor with a large amount of money? If they could get a diagnosis from him, they would be extremely grateful. They wished they could worship him.","In the end, when it came to Li Moying, he actually wanted to hold him hostage?","Listening to Li Moying’s meaning, if his diagnosis was wrong and Huang Yueli had an accident, he wouldn’t be able to leave...","However, before Divine Doctor Wu could finish his words, Xuan Jiuling interrupted him,” That’s right, please stay here, Divine Doctor Wu, so that you can treat Patriarch Huang in time.”","Meng Shurong immediately came over and reminded,” Divine Doctor Wu, you must treat Patriarch Huang. If anything happens to her, we won’t be able to explain ourselves at the alliance headquarters!”","“Yes, yes, the old me understands...”","Divine Doctor Wu wiped the cold sweat off his forehead and could only brace himself to agree.","Actually, it wasn’t that he wasn’t willing to treat Huang Yueli, but he was afraid of staying under Li Moying’s nose.","This legendary Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Young Lord who was full of vitality and handsome without a match, the aura on his body was a little too frightening. It was as if he would be killed if he made a mistake.","As a physician with an ordinary cultivation base, how could he not tremble in fear?","Xuan Jiuling looked at his stiff expression and found it a little funny. He comforted him,” Divine Doctor Wu, relax a little. Don’t worry. Young Master Li is a reasonable person. He’s not a demon. He won’t do anything to you..","He consoled him a few times, but seeing that Divine Doctor Wu was still panic-stricken, he could only give up.","Because Huang Yueli had suddenly fallen unconscious, the City Lord Manor’s celebratory banquet that night had been cancelled.","Quite a number of alliance army generals heard the news and rushed over, wanting to visit Huang Yueli but they were all blocked outside by Li Moying’s men.."]},{"number":4674,"title":"Chapter 4674: Three Godly Doctors (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4674: Three Godly Doctors (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","However, even though they were stopped, the alliance army generals were still unwilling to leave so easily. They stayed outside the City Lord’s Mansion and discussed with worry.","‘ Patriarch Huang is actually unconscious. What is going on?”","“Is there a need to ask? This was definitely a hidden injury left behind when he killed Heavenly Devil Auspicious River! Patriarch Huang has sacrificed too much for the people of You An City...’","“I really hope that tribe leader Huang can recover as soon as possible...”","Huang Yueli was completely unaware of everything that was happening outside.","When she woke up the next morning, she felt as if she had slept. Although her mind was still a little dizzy, her body was full of strength.","Huang Yueli rubbed her eyes and was about to sit up.","Suddenly, a surprised voice rang out beside her ear,” Li ‘er, you... You’re awake!","You’re finally awake!”","Huang Yueli still couldn’t come back to her senses. Blinking her eyes, she turned her head and asked in puzzlement: ” Husband?”","Her gaze landed on Li Moying’s face and she went into a daze for a moment before she jolted awake immediately.","“Husband? Husband, what’s wrong with you? Why did he look so awful? What exactly happened...”","Before she could finish her sentence, her body suddenly tightened and she was pulled into the man’s embrace.","Li Moying’s strong and strong arms tightly hugged the petite young lady in his embrace as his body trembled slightly,” Li ‘er, you’re really awake, you’re fine. That’s great!”","” Huh?!”","Up till now, Huang Yueli was still a little unable to regain her senses.","But she could feel Li Moying’s nervousness and anxiety as she hurriedly stretched out her hand and patted her husband’s back,” Husband, what’s wrong? Why does it feel like I’m about to die...Wuwu!”","Just as Huang Yueli’s ” die ” word left her mouth, her chin was lifted up","forcefully and a menacing kiss landed on her lips, choking her breath.","“Wu wu!”","This kiss was too urgent and Huang Yueli felt that she was almost unable to breathe as she subconsciously raised her hand and pushed Li Moying’s chest, wanting to push him away.","However, Li Moying hugged her too tightly and she didn’t move at all.","Not knowing how long had passed, Li Moying finally let go of her.","Huang Yueli almost couldn’t catch her breath as she hurriedly raised her head and took in a deep breath. At the same time, she didn’t forget to glare at Li Moying fiercely, using her gaze to express her disdain.","Li Moying didn’t seem to notice her unhappiness as he said with lingering fear,” Luckily you’re awake. Otherwise, I would be so anxious that I would kill someone!” Li ‘er, do you still remember what happened yesterday afternoon?”","Huang Yueli was slightly startled,” You mean yesterday afternoon? Weren’t we drinking with Jing Shaoyuan? To think that the wine brewed by the White Tiger","Race is so delicious. I...”","Halfway through her sentence, she suddenly stopped.","Huang Yueli finally recalled everything that happened yesterday and her memory, after picking up the second cup of Tiger Bone Wine, was left with only darkness.","“So, I’m drunk? He even drank a few clips?” Huang Yueli turned pale with fright,” My alcohol tolerance isn’t that bad right? This, this, this...This is too embarrassing!”","Besides, it was one thing to get drunk in front of her husband, but Jing Shaoyuan was there too!","She had never been drunk before, so she did not know how she would react when she was drunk.","It was said that some people would tell all their secrets, and some would even strip naked and dance..."]},{"number":4675,"title":"Chapter 4675: Three Godly Doctors (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4675: Three Godly Doctors (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","It was scary just thinking about it.","Huang Yueli subconsciously stretched out her hand and grabbed onto Li Moying’s clothes by his chest as she asked in a low voice: ” Husband, I didn’t do anything embarrassing yesterday right?”","Li Moying didn’t reply immediately but he frowned slightly as he turned his head sideways to look at her.","Huang Yueli’s heart felt even more guilty as she stared at him,” Husband, don’t scare me! Did I really do something embarrassing? Then why didn’t you quickly bring me out of You ‘an City...”","‘ So, Li ‘er, you feel that you’re drunk?” Li Moying finally couldn’t take it anymore as he interrupted her.","Huang Yueli was confused by this question,” Could it be that I’m not drunk? But, I feel that my symptoms are no different from being drunk. I still feel a little dizzy, hungry, and my stomach doesn’t feel well. These are the legendary symptoms of drunkenness, right?”","Although she had never been drunk before, she had seen a lot of drunkards.","In the past, Liu Buyan didn’t fear death and competed with Li Moying in drinking but in the end, he ended up drunk till he was unconscious.","Huang Yueli was very clear about the symptoms of drunkenness so from the moment she woke up, she didn’t feel that there was anything wrong with her.","Li Moying frowned as he looked at her for a while before asking,” Then...” Other than dizziness and stomach discomfort, what else do you feel uncomfortable about?”","Huang Yueli thought for a moment and shook her head,” No more...”","This time, Li Moying’s brows furrowed even tighter.","He really didn’t expect that Huang Yueli herself didn’t feel anything out of the ordinary.","Could it be that her sudden fainting yesterday was just a false alarm?","However, that was not right. It would be better if it was that simple!","Previously Divine Doctor Wu had said that there was a ball of abnormal energy in Huang Yueli’s body and later on when he personally probed her meridians with his Profound Energy, he had also discovered this point.","Why didn’t Huang Yueli feel anything out of the ordinary?","Huang Yueli looked at Li Moying’s deep gaze and realised that something was amiss as she turned serious,” Husband, could it be that something has happened to my body? What was going on? I really don’t feel anything.”","Li Moying saw her innocent look and after thinking for a while, he told her what Divine Doctor Wu had said.","When Huang Yueli heard that, she was slightly startled,” What? There was such a thing? However, this was not a strange thing, right? Husband, do you still remember the one we cultivated...Dual cultivation technique?","That cultivation method is different for men and women. In my half volume of cultivation method, it requires me to circulate the Profound Energy absorbed in my lower abdomen for seven small cycles and then seven large cycles. Perhaps it is because of this that it leads to the accumulation of Profound Energy?”","Li Moying was also stunned,” So it’s like this?”","Huang Yueli nodded her head vigorously,” Yes, that’s right! Husband, you’re worrying too much! This was very normal. However, yesterday...Ahem, I feel like my alcohol tolerance shouldn’t be so bad.","Wasn’t the wine Jing Shaoyuan brought a little too strong? I really didn’t say anything I shouldn’t have? Or do something strange?”","“No, after you blacked out, you collapsed and slept until now.” Li Moying said affirmatively.","Hearing Huang Yueli’s explanation, he felt a little relieved.","However, thinking about it carefully, he still couldn’t feel completely at ease.","Even if Huang Yueli was really drunk this time, but as a Peak Heart Profound Realm practitioner, her alcohol tolerance was not even as good as Jing Shaoyuan’s, so this was not justifiable.."]},{"number":4676,"title":"Chapter 4676: Three Miracle Doctors (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4676: Three Miracle Doctors (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","In addition, what happened during the battle with Heavenly Devil Auspicious River was still unexplainable until now.","Li Moying’s dark eyes flashed with a faint light as he made a decision in his heart.","“Alright, you’ve been lying in bed for a day and haven’t eaten three meals. You must be hungry now, right? I’ll get the maid to prepare some food for you.”","Li Moying caressed Huang Yueli’s head and kissed her forehead as he stood up.","Just as he turned around, he heard a weak voice coming from the window. Young Master Li, since Patriarch Huang has already woken up, then this old man...Can we go now?”","Li Moying turned around to take a look and the one who spoke was Divine Doctor Wu who had been guarding the room for the entire night.","He immediately waved his hand generously.” Divine Doctor Wu, it was hard on you last night. You’re getting on in years and it’s not easy for you to stay up all night. My wife and I will definitely repay you handsomely.”","Divine Doctor Wu shook his head like a rattle-drum.” No need, no need to thank me. This is all part of my duty.” If there’s no problem, I’ll leave now!”","Li Moying had just nodded his head when Divine Doctor Wu seemed to be chased by a wolf as he quickly slipped away.","Such a scene made Huang Yueli dumbstruck,” Husband, you...What did you do to him? Why is this doctor so afraid of you?”","Li Moying had an innocent look on his face,” Nothing much. He’s a coward so what can I do?”","Huang Yueli pursed her lips, not believing her husband’s words.","No one understood Li Moying better than her.","She had suddenly fainted yesterday and Li Moying thought that something had happened to her body so that reaction must have been especially frightening. Looking at that doctor earlier, he was really old and his cultivation wasn’t high so when he saw Li Moying flying into a rage, it would be strange if he wasn’t afraid....","She cursed silently for a moment before suddenly remembering something else. Her small face instantly flushed red.","“Just... Just now, when we were talking, this old miracle doctor was kept in the room? Then... Didn’t he hear everything we said? You even saw the two of us...”","Earlier on she totally didn’t know that there was someone else in the room so when Li Moying kissed her, she only gave him a few nudges and happily complied.","After that, she even had a very detailed and in-depth discussion with Li Moying about the Dual Cultivation Method...","Now, thinking about how that old mister had overheard everything, Huang Yueli felt a headache coming on.","Sigh, her fairy burden was getting more and more difficult to keep..","Li Moying had a relaxed look on his face as he didn’t feel that there was anything wrong,” That’s right, Divine Doctor Wu is indeed here but he probably wouldn’t dare to go out and spread rumors.”","“Is this a question of nonsense? Why didn’t you remind me?” Huang Yueli said angrily.","Li Moying replied nonchalantly, “I forgot. “.","That attitude was too matter-of-fact, making Huang Yueli not know what to say about him.","Ever since they were in Soaring Heavens Continent, this man had always been like this. He didn’t hide the intimacy between the two of them, as though he was afraid that others wouldn’t know how loving they were.","“Your skin is thicker than the city walls! If I didn’t take you in, I’ll see where you’ll find a wife!” Huang Yueli ridiculed in her heart.","But soon, her stomach, which had been hungry for a day and a night, began to protest and growl.","When Li Moying heard the sound, he regained his senses and hurriedly went to look for food.","Huang Yueli then got up from the bed.."]},{"number":4677,"title":"Chapter 4677: Three Miracle Doctors (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4677: Three Miracle Doctors (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","After leaving the room, Huang Yueli realised that the incident of her fainting yesterday had already spread to everyone.","Along the way, people kept coming over to talk to her and ask about her physical condition.","Initially Huang Yueli was still patiently explaining but towards the end, there were simply too many people who surrounded her and asked her all sorts of questions. Even if she knew that everyone had good intentions, she couldn’t bear it? She could only use the excuse that she had to find Xuan Jiuling and pull her husband’s hand to slip away.","In the end, he had only taken a few steps when he bumped into Xuan Jiuling.","Huang Yueli could only stop in her tracks as she exchanged a few pleasantries with Divine General Xuan.","Xuan Jiuling asked a lot of questions with concern and carefully observed Huang Yueli’s complexion. After discovering that she indeed looked very healthy, he finally relaxed.","“Patriarch Huang, it’s good that you’re fine. You scared everyone yesterday! I didn’t expect you to have such a low tolerance for alcohol. I won’t dare to toast you in the future.” Xuan Jiuling relaxed and was in the mood to joke.","Huang Yueli coughed dryly: ” Yesterday was really just an accident. Profound Divine General, you don’t have to take it to heart. If there’s good wine, I don’t mind having a taste!”","“I’m afraid that if I treat you to a drink today, I’ll be dragged to a dark alley and beaten up by some people tomorrow! I’m old and can’t afford to offend you!” Xuan Jiuling smiled meaningfully.","Huang Yueli was startled as she hurriedly turned her head and caught the threatening expression on her husband’s face which she had no time to hide.","She was speechless.","She kept feeling that she and Li Moying’s script was reversed.","In other families, wasn’t it always the wife who kept her husband in check, not allowing him to drink more and forcing him to take care of his health? Why was it the other way around in their family?","Just as Huang Yueli was in a dilemma, Xuan Jiuling looked at Li Moying once again and said: ” Young Lord Li, the matter that you asked me to investigate last night, there’s already some progress. Why don’t the two of you go to my study room to discuss it in detail?”","Li Moying nodded his head,” That’s good. It’s said that Divine General Profound has a unique method in gathering information. Indeed, it lives up to its reputation!”","“Haha, Young Master Li, you flatter me, you flatter me! This way please!”","Xuan Jiuling led the way in front and Li Moying held onto Huang Yueli’s hand as they followed.","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes as she stretched out a finger and poked Li","Moying’s waist. She asked in a low voice: ” Husband, why did you ask Divine General Profound to help you investigate?”","Li Moying replied, “You’ll know once you enter.”.","Huang Yueli frowned slightly.","But just as Li Moying had said, the moment the three of them entered the","study room and closed the door, Xuan Jiuling went straight to the point.","“Young Master Li, yesterday, you asked me to investigate the Miracle Doctors near You ‘an City, especially those who have special secret techniques to treat meridian injuries. You An City is a border town. Other than the military doctors appointed by the alliance army headquarters, very few doctors are willing to come to such a bitter and cold place. Godly doctors are even rarer. I also suggest that you bring Huang tribe leader to the White Pool State.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli finally understood.","It seemed that the incident of her fainting yesterday had frightened Li Moying.","Li Moying didn’t really trust that old military doctor’s medical skills so he looked for Xuan Jiuling and asked him to help introduce a famous divine doctor to bring her to see a doctor.","However, she had already woken up and her body was fine. It seemed that there was no need to do anything unnecessary, right?","Huang Yueli wanted to reject but Xuan Jiuling had already continued speaking.."]},{"number":4678,"title":"Chapter 4678: Three Godly Doctors (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4678: Three Godly Doctors (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“This old master originally thought that divine doctors were very difficult to find, but I have to say that your luck is really good. This old master just received news this morning. I heard that one of the Divine Realm’s Three Great Divine Doctors, Zhang Li and Divine Doctor Zhang, had just arrived at the nearby Xuehua City a few days ago.” Xuan Jiuling said with a smile.","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes,” Divine Realm’s Three Great Divine Doctors?”","Xuan Jiuling saw that she was confused and immediately explained, “Patriarch Huang, you don’t know. Among the twelve great god clans, the one who was the best at medicine was the White Marsh Clan. Moreover, the god clans were more talented in medicine than the human clan. Therefore, almost all the top divine doctors in the Divine World came from the White Marsh Clan. However, this Divine Doctor Zhang wasn’t a direct descendant of the Bai Zhe Clan. He wasn’t even a pure-blooded god. He was only a mixed-blood, yet he was already one of the three great Divine Doctors! In terms of medical skills, he might even be above the other two elders!”","“Oh? This Divine Doctor Zhang was actually not a god? Is he that powerful?”","Hearing Xuan Jiuling’s words, Huang Yueli’s interest towards this Divine Doctor Zhang was piqued.","In fact, although the twelve continents of the God Clan were under the rule of the twelve ancient god clans, there were not only ordinary humans other than the God Clan.","For hundreds of millions of years, the God Clan and the Human Clan had been living together on this land. They were even comrades in the alliance army. After interacting with each other for a long time, it was inevitable that they would marry each other. As a result, many branch clans with different degrees of mixed-blood were born.","Although these mixed-blood races could not compare to the pure-blood Protoss, they were still much more talented than ordinary humans.","Moreover, because it was very difficult for them to surpass the geniuses of the Protoss in martial arts cultivation, many people chose to become craftsmen such as spiritual artifact masters.","The Protoss were judged by their martial arts talent. Generally, those who chose to engage in side occupations were slightly inferior in martial arts talent. However, it was different for mixed-blood races. The geniuses among them would choose to become craftsmen first.","Hence, many of the famous craftsmen in the Divine Realm were of mixed blood.","For example, Divine Doctor Wu from You ‘an City was also of mixed blood.","However, a mixed-blood was still a mixed-blood. Compared to a pure-blood Protoss, there was still a gap in talent.","For this Divine Doctor Zhang to be ranked as one of the three great Divine Doctors, his high standards and wide knowledge were evident.","Xuan Jiuling saw that she was interested and nodded with a smile.” Indeed, Divine Doctor Zhang is of the same generation as me. When he was young, his name shook the Twelve Continents and he was even ostracized by the medical geniuses of the White Marsh Clan. However, medical skills are the same as martial arts. If you have strength, you have strength. You can’t suppress it!”","” Moreover, this Divine Doctor Zhang is very kind-hearted. Unlike the two great divine doctors of the White Marsh Clan, who stay in their residences all year round to study medicine and only come out of the mountains after the big families bring out heavenly and earthly treasures. Every three years, Divine Doctor Zhang will go to the big towns to treat the commoners for free. Therefore, he is deeply loved by the ordinary people.”","‘ He’s passing by Xuehua City this time and is only two days away from You ‘an City. Patriarch Huang, he’s the most suitable person for you.”","Li Moying immediately nodded his head,” Then it’s decided. Tomorrow my wife and I will set off for Xue Hua City.”","“Eh? Wait!” When Huang Yueli heard these words, her lips twitched as she turned to look at her husband,” Who said we’re going to Xue Hua City?","Husband, have you asked for my opinion?”","“What’s wrong? You don’t want to go?” Li Moying asked.."]},{"number":4679,"title":"Chapter 4679: Three Miracle Doctors (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4679: Three Miracle Doctors (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli immediately nodded her head,” That’s right, Husband, have you forgotten what our plan was? Didn’t we agree that after the matter in You ‘an","City was over, we would go...Just to visit an old friend?”","She blinked her eyes and used her gaze to hint at Li Moying.","Their initial plan was to go to Linyin Town and enter the Evil Shadow Saint’s cave abode again to fulfill their agreement with him.","If Jing Shaoyuan hadn’t suddenly appeared yesterday, they would have been on their way to Linyin Town by now.","Now, Li Moying had changed his mind at the last minute and wanted to go to Xue Hua City?","Wasn’t this too fast?","The three months agreed upon with the Wicked Shadow Saint had already passed. Wouldn’t it be bad to drag it out any longer?","But Saint Xie Ying was after all an evil cultivator and in front of Xuan Jiuling, she definitely couldn’t say it out loud but Huang Yueli believed that Li Moying would definitely be able to understand her hints.","In fact, Li Moying indeed understood what she meant but he still insisted on his opinion,” That old friend’s matter can be put aside for now. Your health is more important. Since I know that there’s something wrong with your body and I can’t find out the reason, how can I be at ease? Divine Doctor Zhang is in Xuehua City, this is a great opportunity. Moreover, it’s not far from here. Even if we take a detour, it won’t take more than a few days.”","“But...” Huang Yueli wanted to say something else.","Li Moying stretched out a finger and pressed it on her lips, stopping her from continuing.","“Li ‘er, have you forgotten what you promised me after killing Rui Jiang?","Hmm?”","“Ah?” Hearing this, Huang Yueli was obviously stunned for a moment.","To be honest, she really couldn’t remember.","At that time, the situation was so critical and she only cared about risking her life to save her and Li Moying’s lives. Now that she recalled the situation, her heart was still beating faster and she was extremely nervous so how could she remember what she said back then?","However, Li Moying’s gaze told her that if she didn’t remember, she would be no different from a scumbag.","Huang Yueli could only bite the bullet and think about it but after thinking for a while, she still had no clue.","She blinked her big eyes as she looked at Li Moying fawningly,” Husband, why don’t you remind me?”","Li Moying gave a cold humph as he said unhappily,” I knew you little heartless one wouldn’t remember! You promised me that you would never do anything harmful to your health again. If you encounter danger, you must listen to my arrangements. Have you forgotten it so quickly?”","“Ah, you mean this...” Huang Yueli came to a sudden realization as she frowned, ” But we haven’t encountered any danger yet...”","“Your body has a problem. It’s a potential danger to you. You can’t tolerate it!","Have you forgotten that you almost self-destructed during the battle with","Heavenly Devil Auspicious River? In the end, you didn’t succeed. Since then, I’ve been worried about your health. After what happened last night...ln short, if you still care about what my husband thinks, you must come with me to","Xuehua City!”","Li Moying’s tone gradually became more and more unyielding.","Because he knew that if he didn’t become tough, Huang Yueli definitely wouldn’t take his body seriously.","He had never seen such a stubborn little girl!","Usually, she looked cute, but now, he couldn’t wait to tie her up, stuff her into a carriage, and transport her to Xuehua City!","Huang Yueli opened her mouth as she looked stunned.."]},{"number":4680,"title":"Chapter 4680: Snowflake City (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4680: Snowflake City (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli originally wanted to persuade Li Moying but now that her husband had already said it to this extent, if she didn’t agree, wouldn’t that be not giving her husband any face?","Her face fell.” Alright, alright. I’ll listen to you, alright?” Why are you so fierce?” “If I don’t be fierce, will you listen to me?” Li Moying shook his head helplessly as he pinched her face.","Xuan Jiuling was dumbfounded when he saw the dispute between the two.","Never would he have thought that the dignified Sacred Phoenix Clan Leader and Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Young Lord, two god grade geniuses, the most outstanding young practitioners in the Divine Realm, were actually no different from ordinary people when they were flirting...","This made him feel awkward and he couldn’t watch anymore.","Fortunately, after the two of them quarreled, they returned to normal and stood up to bid him farewell.","Xuan Jiuling actually couldn’t bear to let Huang Yueli and Li Moying go. Before yesterday, he was still thinking of trying his best to drag the two of them out in You ‘an City for a longer period of time, to let them experience the life in the alliance army and try his best to trick them into joining the alliance army.","But now that Huang Yueli’s body had some problems and from Li Moying’s words, it seemed to be a hidden danger left behind from the battle with Heavenly Devil Auspicious River so he naturally couldn’t force the two of them to stay so he could only nod his head in agreement and even personally prepared a luxurious carriage and coachman for the two of them.","Huang Yueli was originally prepared to sneak out of You ‘an City but now, she could leave openly.","But she was still worried that it would attract too much attention so the next morning, she set off together with Li Moying silently.","There was a special carriage lane from Youan City to Xuehua City. It was said that it was specially built millions of years ago to transport supplies from the surrounding towns to the fortress Youan City.","Although the road had a long history, it was renovated every year, so the carriage was still very stable.","It took them two days to reach Xuehua City.","Compared to Youan City, which was the frontline fortress, although Xuehua City was very close, it was a completely different scene.","The outer city walls were not as tall as You ‘an City. There were many people coming and going in and out of the city gates. There were both gods and humans. Moreover, most of them were carrying burdens or driving carriages. It was obvious that they were here to do business.","Huang Yueli lifted the curtain of the carriage and took a look outside as the corners of her lips curled up,” Looks like this Xue Hua City is a city of merchants? Are there many markets inside?”","“Clan Leader Huang, you’re right!” The coachman smiled. Xue Hua City was the city with the most merchants among the dozens of nearby towns. Many merchants from other continents would specially come to Xue Hua City to sell their goods! Not only are there over ten bazaars in the city, but the four great auction houses of the Divine Realm also have branches in Snow Flower City. It’s very convenient for you to buy whatever you want.”","Huang Yueli was slightly surprised,” Really? In that case, Xuehua City was also an important town. That would be convenient..","After she was done with her treatment, she would follow Li Moying and head straight to Linyin Town, so she didn’t have the time to go to the main city of the Heaven Fox Continent to replenish her supplies.","If she could directly buy what she wanted at the market in Xuehua City, it would save her a lot of trouble.","The carriage stopped a few hundred meters away from the city gate.."]},{"number":4681,"title":"Chapter 4681: Snowflake City (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4681: Snowflake City (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli and Li Moying jumped down from the carriage and took out a small piece of crystal jade and stuffed it into the carriage driver’s hands, asking him to return to You ‘an City.","The coachman was still unwilling to leave.","“Patriarch Huang, Young Master Li, you are...No, I can’t accept your Crystal Jades, and I can’t go back like this! Divine General Xuan said that the roads in Xuehua City are complicated, and this is your first time here, so it’s not convenient for you to travel alone. He asked me to accompany the two of you for a walk. Wherever the two of you want to go, I’ll take you there.”","Huang Yueli shook her head and said: ” We don’t like people following us when we go shopping. Besides, if we don’t know the way, why don’t we ask? This isn’t our first time coming out to train. Why would Divine General Xuan need to worry about such a small matter? Just go back and say that you’ve already sent us there. Divine General Xuan won’t blame you.”","Huang Yueli tried her best to persuade the coachman to go back before turning around and walking shoulder to shoulder with Li Moying towards the city gates of Xue Hua City.","As it was a city of merchants, the control of entry and exit in Xuehua City was not strict. Basically, as long as one had a waist token or a travel pass that could prove their identity and paid a certain amount of entrance fee, everyone could enter the city.","However, due to the payment, the speed of entering and leaving the city was a little slow. There was a long queue waiting to enter the city at the entrance.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying naturally didn’t have any intention of asking for any special privileges as the two of them calmly walked to the end of the queue, queuing up with all the travelling merchants who were passing by.","However, even though the two of them were already very low-key, there were still a few Protoss in the team, not to mention the two Protoss youths who were so good-looking.","As soon as the two of them approached the crowd, they attracted the attention of many people.","At the start, only the people who lined up near the two of them stared at them. After a while, Huang Yueli suddenly realised that the number of people who turned to look at them was increasing.","There were even people dozens of meters away who deliberately turned their heads to look at the two of them.","Moreover, after reading it, she even whispered to the people around her.","Huang Yueli’s five senses were very sensitive and she had long noticed this situation. As she looked on, she suddenly felt that something was amiss so she released her divine senses, wanting to hear what the other party was saying.","At such a distance, wanting to hear other people’s conversation, to top powers like Huang Yueli and Li Moying, it was totally effortless.","But eavesdropping on the conversation of people she didn’t know was after all very impolite so under most circumstances, Huang Yueli would rarely release her spiritual awareness in front of ordinary people.","However, it was different today. The gazes of the people around him looked too strange...","Huang Yueli had just released her spiritual perception when a few voices of discussion entered her ears.","“Brother, look behind us! Do you see the two god clans at the end of the line?","Why do I find them so familiar?”","“Let me see, let me see...Oh, it really was! It does look familiar. I think...They seemed to be a little like Sacred Phoenix Clan’s Patriarch Huang and Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Young Lord Li? Don’t you think so?”","“Yes, yes, yes, you’re right! I knew it. Why did he look so familiar? I’ve never dealt with the god race before. So it was like this! After seeing the good news on the wall this morning, I had an impression. This Patriarch Huang and Young Master Li are really outstanding, making people unable to take their eyes off them.. I don’t know if they are especially good-looking, or are all pure-blooded Protoss like this?”"]},{"number":4682,"title":"Chapter 4682: Snowflake City (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4682: Snowflake City (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“How can the Gods be so good-looking? Isn’t our City Lord also a god? He looked very ordinary. He was short, fat, and bald! He’s indeed much stronger than us humans!”","“You’re right...ln that case, those two were really Patriarch Huang and Young","Patriarch Li? Oh my god, we can actually see these two legendary figures here.","They could even kill a peak Heaven Demon! What kind of peerless expert is","“Forget it! How could they appear in Xuehua City? Even if they were really bored and came over to take a look, the City Lord would have come out to welcome them personally. They would pay the money here like us and even queue up?”","“That’s true, but they really look alike...”","“Then it’s just very similar, right?”","Listening to the conversation between these two peddlers, Huang Yueli’s expression turned stiffer and stiffer.","Heavens!","She and Li Moying had only returned to You ‘an City for a few days? Xuan","Jiuling had already spread the news?","Even Xuehua City had posted the news of the wedding, and there were even two people’s faces drawn on it!","Fortunately, she had been careful enough to eavesdrop. Otherwise, she would have been recognized the moment she entered the city.","Huang Yueli had originally thought that they had just told Xuan Jiuling about Rui Jiang’s death a few days ago so even if the allied army was quick in handling matters, it would take at least ten days to half a month to spread the news. At least for these few days, they wouldn’t expose their identities.","So she had slacked off and didn’t disguise herself and Li Moying as she sat in the carriage.","After all, she didn’t really like to disguise herself. A ball of greasy makeup on her face was never so comfortable.","In the end...He was almost recognized.","At the thought of this, she quickly took a few steps back and lowered her head. She loosened the jade hairpin on her head and let some hair fall down, just enough to cover her face.","Li Moying saw her actions and was puzzled,” Li ‘er, what are you doing?”","Huang Yueli grabbed his sleeve and stood on her tiptoes. Raising her head, she leaned towards his ear and whispered: ” Husband, we...” We were almost exposed! Xuan Jiuling’s speed was too fast. He had already posted the news in Xuehua City! These people were just surrounding us, guessing if we were","Huang Yueli and Li Moying!”","“Is that so?” Li Moying was slightly startled but he immediately understood,’ Divine General Xuan was too happy that day so he definitely couldn’t wait to announce this joyous occasion to the world...Then what should we do now?","Why don’t we just reveal our identity and enter the city directly?”","“No, no, this won’t do. We still have to go to Linyin Town later. It won’t be good if we get targeted.” Huang Yueli immediately shook her head.","Li Moying replied, “Then...” Are we going to disguise ourselves now? Was it too late? Isn’t it too deliberate?”","“Of course we can make it!” Huang Yueli nodded her head,” As for whether it was too deliberate...This would depend on the technique! Husband, why don’t you lower your head?”","Li Moying had always been obedient to Madam’s words and when he heard that, he immediately lowered his head and even bent down slightly as he inched closer to Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli looked at this handsome face which made countless of noble ladies from the Celestial Race go crazy as she raised her hand to touch his face, sighing in her heart, her husband’s skin was really better than hers..."]},{"number":4683,"title":"Chapter 4683: Snowflake City (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4683: Snowflake City (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Li ‘er, have you touched enough? Everyone is looking at us...","Li Moying lightly reminded her.","Actually, he didn’t mind letting his wife touch as much as she wanted. If touching his face wasn’t enough, he wouldn’t hesitate to offer up other parts.","Even if there were many outsiders standing beside him, it did not matter. He was very thick-skinned.","However, didn’t they have something important to do now?","When Huang Yueli heard this, she suddenly regained her senses as she hurriedly covered up and coughed twice: ” I touched you so that I could figure out the direction of your facial bones. This way, when I put on a disguise for you, I would be able to take advantage of the situation and appear natural enough. Do you understand? Don’t make me sound like a pervert!”","Huang Yueli quickly explained and without waiting for Li Moying to reply, she took out a few different coloured rouge and directly used her hand to replace the powder puff as she smeared it on his face.","She was a spiritual artifact master, and her work speed had always been very fast. It was no exception when she disguised herself.","She raised her hand and casually wiped a few times but before Li Moying could react, she had already retracted her hand.","“Alright, let me give you a mirror to look at!” After Huang Yueli finished speaking, she took out a small bronze mirror and passed it to her husband.","Li Moying lowered his head to take a look and was instantly stunned.","The man in the mirror looked very similar to him. It could be said that if one looked carefully, no matter if it was the shape of his face or his facial features, there wasn’t any change. Huang Yueli’s rouge powder had only changed the skin tone of some parts of his face, forming some shadows.","However, if he hadn’t been told who was in the mirror beforehand, he wouldn’t have dared to say that the person in the mirror was him!","“This... This was too amazing! Li ‘er, your disguise technique has improved even more than before!” After a short moment of astonishment, Li Moying passed the mirror back to her and revealed a smile.","Huang Yueli took the mirror and started to apply it on herself.","This time around, her speed was even faster and even Li Moying only saw her touching his face a few times before that peerlessly beautiful face that he was used to seeing every day changed.","In terms of similarity, it was still very similar to the past.","It was just that Huang Yueli’s few disguises perfectly covered up her beautiful and charming charm, making her look like an ordinary and delicate girl.","Actually, Li Moying’s disguise was also in the same direction.","That was to use a little color to suppress his own temperament.","The current Li Moying still looked handsome but he was more like a poor kid who was born in poverty, and not the high and mighty Young Master Li.","It was only a small part of the changes, but the effect was so obvious...","Huang Yueli looked at Li Moying’s stunned look as she raised her brows and smiled smugly,” How is it? I didn’t lie to you just now, right? I’m really touching your bones, and you dare to accuse me? Hmph! Alright, we should be safe now. If you can bend your back a little and not stand so handsome, the effect of your disguise will be better! ”","Li Moying couldn’t help but laugh.","His little fox refused to admit that she was mesmerized by his face... It seemed that she could only tell the truth on the bed in the inn after she entered the city.","His heart was filled with impure thoughts but he didn’t show it on his face. He even obediently followed Huang Yueli’s request and arched his back a little, making himself look listless.."]},{"number":4684,"title":"Chapter 4684: Snowflake City (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4684: Snowflake City (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Huang Yueli was disguising the two of them, she had used a simple smokescreen which could temporarily divert the attention of the surrounding people.","In addition, her speed was too fast, so no one could react to what they had just done.","However, when he looked at the two of them again, he felt that the two of them did not look that similar to the two god-grade geniuses on the announcement. Of course, there were still similarities, but it was obvious that they were not the same person.","Their temperament was different!","Xuehua City was indeed a big commercial town. The guards at the city gate were extremely efficient.","Although the line was very long, the speed at which they moved forward was not slow.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying queued for an hour and they had already reached the city gate.","The soldiers guarding the city extended their hands to the two of them.” Where are your identity tokens? Take it out for me to take a look?”","According to the rules of the Twelve Continents of the Divine World, the God","Clan was considered a noble clan. Every God Clan had their own identity token. If they were to enter and leave the city, they could use their identity token to obtain various noble privileges.","Ordinary humans didn’t have such privileges. Generally, when they left their hometown, they had to go to the local officials to get a travel pass, which was mainly used to prove their identity and background.","Huang Yueli was already prepared as she took out two identity tokens from her space and handed them over to the guards.","This was something she had prepared when she eloped with Li Moying from the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","The difficulty of refining the identity tokens of the Protoss was not low, but Spirit Weapon Masters above Heavenly Treasure Grandmaster could still refine them. The key to distinguishing the authenticity of these tokens was that each identity token had a trace of the aura of an ancient divine beast. This was something that ordinary people could not forge.","But these two crucial points weren’t a problem for Huang Yueli.","It was almost no difficulty for her to refine a Bejeweled Weapon level Spirit Weapon.","As for the aura of an ancient divine beast... She and Li Moying had plenty of them so she just needed to absorb a little from Little Wang Cai and Zi Yu. Therefore, he could have as many identity tokens as he wanted.","Before she left Sacred Phoenix Continent, Huang Yueli had casually made a bunch of them and kept them for her own use.","Now, it was finally useful.","The guard took their tokens and used a special spiritual weapon to probe them, reading their identity information.","‘ Huang Xiaoyue, Sacred Phoenix Race, 18 years old, Tenth Level Intent Profound Realm.’","” Li Sanjing, Cloudy Qilin Clan, 25 years old, cultivation base at Heart Profound Realm Initial Phase.”","The two of them had lowered their cultivation by a major realm. This way, it was more in line with the cultivation that the two of them should have at their age.","But even so, the guards still showed a hint of interest when they saw their families. One of you is from the Sacred Phoenix Clan, and the other is from the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Why are you all mixing together? Isn’t it said that Sacred","Phoenix Clan and Cloudy Qilin Clan don’t intermarry?”","Huang Yueli looked at them with an innocent expression,” Master Li and I are just Senior Brother and Junior Sister, don’t misunderstand!”","“Senior and junior brother and sister...lt doesn’t look like it!” The guards looked at the two of them with gossipy faces and smiled.” You don’t have to be so nervous. What’s the big deal?” Is your Sacred Phoenix Clan’s Patriarch and Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Young Lord not going to get married? They even killed Heavenly Devil Auspicious River together!","Now, there were rumors everywhere that the two of them were the strongest","Dao companions. In the future, perhaps the Sacred Phoenix Clan and Cloudy","Qilin Clan will be publicly acknowledged as the most compatible dao companions..”"]},{"number":4685,"title":"Chapter 4685: Divine Doctor’s Rules (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4685: Divine Doctor’s Rules (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Ahem, is that so? If the clan really doesn’t object in the future, that would be great.” Huang Yueli said perfunctorily.","The guards verified their information and handed the tokens back to them.","Huang Yueli stretched out her hand and was about to receive it when the guard stared at her and Li Moying for a while before he suddenly opened his mouth and said,” Speaking of which, you and this Little Senior Brother of yours look a little similar to Patriarch Huang and Young Lord Li! Everyone, come and take a look. Are they similar to the portraits?”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli’s expression remained unchanged as she calmly replied: ” Isn’t that so? Ever since I left the clan, many people said that I looked a little like the Huang Clan Leader. However, this is all an illusion of your human race. I’m originally a direct descendant of the Shen clan and am a relative of the Huang clan leader. It’s normal for me to look like her. There’s nothing to be surprised about.”","“So that’s how it is...No wonder...”","The guards had obviously not seen many direct descendants of the god clan, so they were fooled by her words.","When Huang Yueli saw this, she hurriedly took back her identity token and grabbed her husband with her other hand as she turned around and ran away.","After entering Xuehua City, the first thing he had to do was to find a place to stay.","As the two of them did not plan to stay in the city for too long, they did not have many special needs. They randomly found a relatively luxurious inn and stayed there.","However, because the two of them were too young, when they booked the room, they were even looked at by the shopkeeper a few times.","Huang Yueli took the opportunity to ask: ” Manager, I heard that one of the Divine Realm’s three great Divine Doctors, Divine Doctor Zhang, has recently arrived in Xue Hua City and is going to be providing medical services in the city. Is this true? To tell you the truth, I have a strange illness that can’t be cured for a long time. My senior brother is here to accompany me to see the doctor.”","The shopkeeper was stunned when he heard this. He sized up the two of them for a while.” So you two are senior siblings...”","This made it easier to understand.","It seemed that this seemingly lively and cute little girl was only strong on the surface. Her illness was actually quite serious and needed her senior brother to stay in a room to take care of her.","Huang Yueli was the one who had led him to think in the wrong direction so she didn’t explain. She only said: ” That’s right. May I ask if Divine Doctor Zhang is still in Xue Hua City? Which clinic was he in? How many crystal jades or other treasures do I need to prepare to see him?”","She repeated the question again, and the shopkeeper came back to his senses and hurriedly explained.","“Little girl, you really came at the right time this time! Divine Doctor Zhang indeed arrived in Snow Flower City a month ago. He was only planning to stay for a few days before leaving, but just as he was about to leave, the demons launched a large-scale attack on You ‘an City. As a neighboring town of You’ an City, all the roads in our vicinity have been blocked. Divine Doctor Zhang couldn’t leave even if he wanted to, so he could only continue to stay in Snow Flower City to treat patients.”","” Now, although You ‘an City has been defended and the roads nearby have been restored, but considering that many people have specially rushed to Xuehua City from the outer city, Divine Doctor Zhang decided to stay in","Xuehua City for a while longer. There are even rumors that Divine Doctor Zhang plans to take in a disciple and prepare to set the examination questions in Xuehua City!”","“Is that so? There was such a thing? What a coincidence!” Luo Chenxi’s face lit up when she heard that.","Before she came, she was worried that Zhang Lihe had already left. As long as she didn’t miss, it was a good thing.."]},{"number":4686,"title":"Chapter 4686: Divine Doctor’s Rules (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4686: Divine Doctor’s Rules (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The shopkeeper continued,” Divine Doctor Zhang didn’t accept any invitation from any clinic. Instead, he rented a small courtyard by himself. It’s in the corner of the west of the city. That place is relatively remote and not easy to find. If you want to go there, I can draw a map for you.”","Huang Yueli hurriedly nodded her head,” That’s really great. Shopkeeper, thank you so much. Then... Divine Doctor Zhang’s consultation fee...”","“Divine Doctor Zhang has never taken any fees when he treats patients in Xuehua City. Even the medicine and pills he prescribed are free of charge. At most, he will only charge for the ingredients. Of course, the two of you don’t seem to lack money, but it’s always good to save some money.”","Hearing that, Huang Yueli and Li Moying exchanged a glance as they both felt heartfelt admiration towards this Divine Doctor Zhang.","When they were in Youan City, they had heard Xuan Jiuling mention Divine Doctor Zhang. Their impression of him was that he had excellent medical skills.","Now that they heard that he was treating commoners for free, the two of them were very impressed.","Not to mention other things, even if Huang Yueli herself was asked to give out the spirit weapons she refined for free, she was also unwilling.","Zhang Lihe, who sacrificed himself for others, was a true expert. In the Divine Realm, where strength reigned supreme, it was truly rare to see him.","Huang Yueli turned around and said to Li Moying: ” Since that’s the case, let’s go back to our room later to settle things. Tomorrow afternoon...”","“Two of you, I’ll say something more. If you want to see Divine Doctor Zhang, you definitely can’t go in the afternoon. You can’t even go at dawn. The queue at the entrance of Divine Doctor Zhang’s courtyard is endless. Most of them sleep on the floor.”","The shopkeeper saw that this pair of good-looking and young senior brothers were quite pleasing to the eye and could not help but remind them.","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment,” Really? There was such a thing? However, that’s right. With Divine Doctor Zhang’s medical skills and the fact that he doesn’t need a consultation fee, there will definitely be many people who will come because of his reputation...","” I wonder if there’s a way to meet Divine Doctor Zhang first. I vaguely remember that I have some friendship with one of Divine Doctor Zhang’s benefactors. Perhaps we can...”","Li Moying naturally couldn’t bear to see his wife queuing outside all night and immediately thought of a way to cut the queue.","However, the shopkeeper said,”Young Master, although you are a god, it is impossible for you to cut the queue.” Divine Doctor Zhang had his own rules. As long as he was on his free rounds outside, he would not give face even if the patriarchs of the 12 great families of the Protoss came. Everyone had to queue up to see a doctor! If you want to use your privileges or pay a huge consultation fee, it’s not impossible, but you can only wait until Divine Doctor Zhang returns to Bai Ze Zhou’s home...”","This was something that Huang Yueli and Li Moying hadn’t expected before they came over.","The two of them looked at each other in surprise.","Li Moying’s brows creased as he felt troubled.","They had thought that with their status, as long as they showed their sincerity, it would be easy for Zhang Lihe to treat them. At most, they would just give them more rare medicinal herbs!","They had quite a lot of these things and they were all obtained by Huang Yueli when she was in the Perched Phoenix Canyon, using roasted chicken drumsticks to exchange for them from the phoenixes. It was easy to get them so giving them away wasn’t too painful.","However, they could only line up now...","Who knew how many days and nights he would have to queue for?","If Zhang Lihe said he didn’t want to watch it and wanted to change places halfway through the queue, who would he cry to?"]},{"number":4687,"title":"Chapter 4687: Divine Doctor’s Rules (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4687: Divine Doctor’s Rules (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","However, if he didn’t look at it now, he would spend money to invite Zhang Lihe after he returned to the White Pool State...Then who knew how long it would take.","According to Xuan Jiuling, Zhang Lihe would need at least a few years for a free consultation tour.","If there was really a problem with the Profound Energy in Huang Yueli’s body, by then, it would be too late.","When the two of them went out to train, they often needed to fight. This was a very fatal hidden danger.","But compared to Li Moying’s worry, Huang Yueli was more carefree.","Back in her room, she patted her husband’s shoulder and smiled. There was no need to be so nervous. Perhaps the shopkeeper’s description was too exaggerated? We’ll go to the small courtyard in the west of the city tomorrow to take a look at the situation before making plans. If there are really too many people, we’ll just wait until we go to the White Pool Continent to look for him. I don’t think there’s anything unusual with my body...”","” Nothing unusual. Perhaps, it’s the biggest abnormality!” Li Moying narrowed his eyes as he swept a glance at her,” But we’ll do as you said, we’ll go take a look tomorrow first.","The two of them discussed it and went to bed early that night.","Li Moying really wanted to continue the dual cultivation that he didn’t enjoy to his heart’s content with his wife yesterday but considering that he still had to go to see a doctor the next day, he was afraid that it would affect Divine Doctor Zhang’s diagnosis so he could only forcefully hold it in.","The next morning, the two of them woke up very early. They followed the map that the shopkeeper had given them the day before and headed to the Xicheng District of Xue Hua City.","When they arrived at the Xicheng District, the situation there really surprised them.","“This... This is obviously the slums of Xuehua City!” Huang Yueli looked around for a while and came to a conclusion.","Li Moying nodded his head,” That should be the case.”","The large area in front of them was filled with very low thatched huts. Not only did they look very unstable, as if they would fall down with a gust of wind, but they were also very crowded and the streets were very dirty.","There were many children in ragged clothes squatting by the roadside. When they saw the two well-dressed young men and women appear, they rushed up to ask for money.","Huang Yueli casually fished out a few pieces of dry rations and threw them over.","He could tell that these children wanted money more than food, so he was a little disappointed.","But Huang Yueli obviously didn’t intend to bother with them anymore so they hugged the few pieces of dry rations tightly as they turned around and left.","Huang Yueli was also very helpless. It wasn’t that she didn’t sympathize with these children from the slums and wasn’t willing to give them some money.","However, she didn’t have any currency smaller than ten taels of crystal jade on her. If she took out so much money, the scene would definitely be a mess.","At that time, it would be very easy for her and Li Moying to get away with it. These children would inevitably start fighting over the crystal jade and it might even cause a huge mess.","After sending the children away, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but let out a sigh, really didn’t expect that there would be such a poor place in the twelve continents of the Gods Race! The children here don’t seem to have any cultivation at all. They’re no different from ordinary people in the lower realm...”","Before this, all the people she had met in the Divine World, even if they were just ordinary commoners, had all cultivated.","However, most of the humans were not as talented. There were only a few who could reach the late stage of the Profound Meaning realm, let alone the Profound Heart realm.","This time, she had really learned something new.."]},{"number":4688,"title":"Chapter 4688: Divine Doctor’s Rules (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4688: Divine Doctor’s Rules (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying’s expression was slightly solemn as he explained,” These people shouldn’t be commoners but sinners. They should be the ones who had committed a crime so they were isolated. Ever since the twelve great god clans and the human race signed an agreement, ordinary humans can also enter the martial arts of the various continents to learn basic cultivation techniques. No matter how bad their talent is, they can cultivate to the early stage of the Profound Meaning realm in twenty years. Those who have no cultivation at all can only be sinners.”","When Huang Yueli heard that, she was even more puzzled as she frowned,” But if the ancestors committed a crime, why would it implicate the future generations? Even if it’s a joint crime, it can’t affect so many generations, right?”","“I heard that those who are generally classified as sinners are those whose ancestors had dealings with the Demon Race, just like... Ahem, same.”","Li Moying coughed twice but didn’t finish his sentence.","But Huang Yueli instantly understood what he meant.","The person Li Moying was referring to should be Senior King Xiang but it wasn’t appropriate to say his name out here.","Strictly speaking, King Xiang was also secretly interacting with the fiend race, and it was even with a devil king realm powerhouse!","However, according to the information left behind by King Xiang in Demon King Rui Meng’s cave abode, the relationship between the gods and demons in ancient times might not have been as tense as it was now, to the point of life and death...","“Ugh, these children are really pitiful...” Huang Yueli sighed lightly.","If they could not cultivate, they would never have any power. In the Divine Realm where ordinary civilians were at the Profound Meaning Realm, weren’t these sinners the targets of slaughter?","“However...” She suddenly thought of something and looked thoughtfully at the other end of the road.” Why would Divine Doctor Zhang choose a place like this for his temporary clinic? This shouldn’t be a coincidence. This place is so noisy. Spirit Apothecaries need a quiet environment no matter if they are performing a consultation or refining pills. Divine Doctor Zhang can’t think of anywhere to perform a consultation, but he insisted on choosing this place...”","“You’re thinking the same thing as me.” Li Moying nodded his head,” Looks like this Divine Doctor Zhang is really a saint. He should know that this sinner has no money to treat his illness and he doesn’t even dare to step outside of the Xicheng District so he specially chose the small courtyard in the western district.”","As the two of them spoke up to this point, they had a higher opinion of this Divine Doctor Zhang.","He had not even been cured, yet he had already determined that Zhang Lihe was worthy of the title of one of the three great divine doctors.","No matter how good his medical skills were, his magnanimity was enough to make people praise him.","The two of them continued forward, following the route on the map.","As they got closer to Zhang Lihe’s courtyard, the number of people on the road increased.","However, compared to the noisy and crowded path just now, although there were more people here, it was miraculously very quiet. The ground was also spotless and very clean.","Although most of the people lining up on both sides of the road were sinners in shabby clothes, their behavior was completely different from when they were at the entrance of the Xicheng District.","“Looks like these sinners also know that Divine Doctor Zhang came for them.","They are still very grateful and consciously regulate their words and deeds... Divine Doctor Zhang is really amazing!” Huang Yueli sighed.","Li Moying nodded slightly but his eyes flashed with a trace of worry,” There are so many people and it seems that the shopkeeper wasn’t exaggerating at all.. If we want to see Divine Doctor Zhang, do we really have to queue for over ten days?”"]},{"number":4689,"title":"Chapter 4689: Divine Doctor’s Rules (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4689: Divine Doctor’s Rules (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","For martial artists with their cultivation, queuing was definitely not physically difficult.","However, it was definitely their first time queuing for more than ten days.","Both of them were peerless geniuses and had been surrounded by stars since they were young. They had special privileges wherever they went.","But this time, the two of them had no intention of revealing their identities.","Seeing Zhang Lihe rack his brains for the sake of these sinners, they felt that it was inappropriate for them to cut the queue or bribe Divine Doctor Zhang with materials and crystals.","Just as the two of them were looking at each other speechlessly and hesitating, a middle-aged man suddenly spoke up,”The two of you...” Are you also here to see Divine Doctor Zhang? Oh, that’s not right. Looking at the clothes of the two of you, they seem to be from the god race? Then... Could it be that you want to acknowledge Divine Doctor Zhang as your master?”","When Huang Yueli heard the voice, she was stunned for a moment as she hurriedly turned around and saw many people lining up nearby looking curiously at the two of them.","She quickly understood.","With her and Li Moying’s looks and temperament, even if they had changed their appearances, it was still too conspicuous in such a place. Even if they stood there without saying a word, they would still stand out from the crowd.","Furthermore, when she was conversing with Li Moying earlier, she didn’t intentionally lower her voice so it was overheard by others.","However, there was nothing to hide.","Huang Yueli immediately nodded: ” That’s right. My husband and I indeed came here because of its fame. However, we heard that Divine Doctor Zhang was here and came to see him, not to acknowledge him as our master...Why? Is Divine Doctor Zhang really going to accept disciples in Xue Hua City?”","Huang Yueli was halfway through her sentence when she suddenly recalled that the hotel manager had mentioned about taking in a disciple yesterday and her curiosity was piqued.","The middle-aged man said, “If you want to see a doctor...” The two of you look rich and noble. Why are you waiting in line here to suffer? We can totally find the other two White Marsh Miracle Doctors among the three. It’s said that the White Marsh Miracle Doctors will make house calls as long as we give them enough money!”","Huang Yueli smiled,” We were just passing by. If we really can’t see Divine Doctor Zhang, we can only find someone else.”","She naturally did not need to explain too much to these ordinary people.","Fortunately, the middle-aged uncle did not think too much about it. He nodded and continued,” I see. Recently, many god clans have come here. I heard that they are all here to acknowledge Divine Doctor Zhang as their master. Divine Doctor Zhang even stopped his treatment for a few days and gathered these people to take a test. Unfortunately, none of them passed.”","“Is that so? There was such a thing? However, with Divine Doctor Zhang’s medical skills, it’s not difficult to understand that he would have very high requirements if he wanted to take in a disciple.”","Huang Yueli smiled and treated it as a gossip as her heart didn’t waver.","If the three great spiritual artifact masters of the Immortal Realm were to take in disciples, she might be a little interested. It was not that she was interested in taking in a master, but to see how others took in disciples. In the future, when she wanted to take in disciples, she could also learn from them.","However, it was the godly doctor who was taking in disciples now...She wasn’t very interested in medicine, so she couldn’t even be bothered to watch the show.","” If you’re not here to acknowledge me as your master, then you’re really unlucky to have come. Divine Doctor Zhang hasn’t been in Xuehua City for the past few days,” the middle-aged uncle said.","Hearing this news, Huang Yueli was shocked,” What? Divine Doctor Zhang isn’t in Xuehua City? Had he already left? But if he left, why are you still queuing up here?”","Look at this line, it was already more than ten miles long.."]},{"number":4690,"title":"Chapter 4690: Divine Doctor’s Rules (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4690: Divine Doctor’s Rules (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The middle-aged man explained,” Divine Doctor Zhang didn’t leave Snow Flower City. I heard that he just ran out of herbs and went out to pick them. I heard that he brought along a few prospective disciples who performed well in the previous rounds of examinations. Perhaps he has the intention of testing them.” As for us...","He smiled.” Our time is not valuable. Even if Divine Doctor Zhang is not here now, won’t he still have to treat patients when he comes back? She would queue up here first so that she could see the doctor earlier. Otherwise, the queue here will get longer and longer, and we’ll have to wait until when?” What he said made sense, and there was no way to refute it!","Huang Yueli choked for a moment as she asked again: ” Then Uncle, do you know that Divine Doctor Zhang went out to pick herbs. How long would it take for him to return?”","“This... Who would know? I heard that there are some special medicinal herbs around our Xuehua City that can’t be found anywhere else. I wonder how long it will take for them to come back? However, it has been five to six days since Divine Doctor Zhang left...”","After listening to this kind uncle’s introduction, Huang Yueli’s face turned a little pale.","Now she finally understood that the queue for consultation was not only long, but it was also more troublesome that she did not know when she could start the consultation, so she did not know how long the queue would last!","If Zhang Lihe went out for a month or two, wouldn’t he have to stay here for another month or two?","Huang Yueli was also someone who had learnt medical skills for a few days and was good friends with Liu Buyan so she knew clearly that the process of picking herbs was very random. In order to wait for the best time to pick, it was possible to spend as much time as possible.","“Looks like we can only give up.” Huang Yueli shrugged her shoulders as she looked at Li Moying who was behind her,” With such a long time, it’s enough for us to go to Linyin Town first. When we return from Linyin Town, Divine Doctor Zhang might not even be able to come back. There’s no harm in coming back to see him then, right?”","Li Moying’s expression was a little gloomy.","He was just worried that Huang Yueli would go to Saint Xie Ying’s cave dwelling without any confirmation of her illness, fearing that she would encounter some unexpected danger and Huang Yueli would have an accident during the battle.","However, the current situation...lt was completely unexpected.","Huang Yueli was right, continuing to wait would only be a waste of time.","Li Moying thought for a while but didn’t say anything.","Huang Yueli looked left and right and realised that no one was paying attention to them so she simply threw herself into Li Moying’s embrace and stretched out her hand to pull his sleeves,” Husband, listen to me, I really don’t have any problems. Let’s go to Linyin Town first and when we return, I will definitely go to see a doctor obediently, alright?”","As she said that, she even secretly planted a kiss on Li Moying’s face.","Li Moying couldn’t stand his wife acting coquettishly the most and after being pleaded by her in such a soft voice, he immediately gave up,","He sighed deeply.” Alright, I’ll do as you say. However, you must be careful. If you feel uncomfortable, tell me immediately, understand?”","“I know, I know! Don’t worry, when have I ever made you worry?” Huang Yueli nodded her head vigorously.","Li Moying shook his head helplessly. He was worried every day and had an endless amount of worries, alright?","The two of them held hands and turned around to return the way they came.","However, at this moment, a commotion suddenly appeared in front of them.","‘ Disperse! Everyone, disperse! If anyone dares to stand in my way and let this little thief escape, don’t blame me for being impolite!”","“Get lost!”","” That kid is right in front. I see him.. Quick, chase after him!”"]},{"number":4691,"title":"Chapter 4691: Senior Brother, how did you end up like this?(l)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4691: Senior Brother, how did you end up like this?(l)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Although there were many people on this street, because the patients who came to see the doctor respected Divine Doctor Zhang, no one dared to make a noise. The surroundings were still very quiet.","All of a sudden, a group of people shouted and quickly attracted everyone’s attention.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying also looked towards the source of the voice.","A group of Protoss warriors wearing the same uniform rode on tall horses and sped through the streets.","Even though he saw many pedestrians on the street ahead, he did not have the slightest intention of avoiding them. Instead, he waved the horsewhip in his hand and sternly shouted at them to get out of the way.","The commoners lining up on both sides of the road all looked dissatisfied, but no one dared to make a sound.","After all, that was the high and mighty god clan!","Even if they killed civilians, they would not be punished. Who would dare to go up and die?","Huang Yueli and Li Moying frowned when they saw this.","In the past, although they had heard that some god clans acted arrogantly and despotic outside and treated ordinary human beings very rudely, they had never seen such a situation with their own eyes. This was the first time, and it really broadened their horizons.","However, the two of them did not want to meddle in other people’s business. Seeing that no civilians were injured, they prepared to leave.","The two of them had just taken a few steps when they suddenly saw a pale green figure flash past the crowd.","This person was extremely fast. His sudden appearance shocked the patients in the queue. However, before the patients could exclaim, he had already dashed from the street to the end of the street and disappeared from everyone’s sight.","The humans present did not even see his face clearly. When they finally came back to their senses, they were so scared that they broke out in cold sweat.","Huang Yueli’s expression changed,” Husband, did you see that earlier? Could that be...Did I see wrongly?”","“I didn’t see wrongly. That should be your senior brother...Why is he here?” Li Moying frowned.","Huang Yueli turned her head and saw that group of Gods Race practitioners were running towards them. Suddenly understanding something, she grabbed Li Moying’s hand and ran towards the direction where Liu Buyan had disappeared.","“Don’t think about it anymore. Let’s go after Senior Brother first! These people seem to be chasing after him!”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were both experts who were proficient in movement Profound Skills and their speed was even faster than Liu Buyan.","In a flash, the pedestrians let out waves of exclamations.","However, although they were fast, they were still a step too slow. When they reached the end of the street, they looked around and realized...Liu Buyan’s shadow was already gone.","“This... What was going on? When did Senior Brother’s movement technique become so good? When he ran over just now, his speed scared me! Moreover, he was actually hiding so well now...","He didn’t even know about concealment mystic skills in the past?” Huang Yueli was a little stunned.","Thinking about it carefully, if it wasn’t because she was too familiar with Liu Buyan’s figure, she might have thought that she had seen wrongly earlier!","Li Moying also seemed to be a little puzzled. After a moment of silence, he said in a low voice,” Liu Buyan’s speed is slower than ours so he definitely wouldn’t have run far. He should be around here.” Why don’t we just reveal our identities and ask him to come out and acknowledge us? However, I saw a lot of people chasing him just now. If we find out his whereabouts, I wonder if we will cause trouble for him?”","Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up,” Let’s do it this way! As for those ‘trouble’...l want to see who dares to find trouble with my senior brother!”"]},{"number":4692,"title":"Chapter 4692: Senior Brother, how did you end up like this?(2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4692: Senior Brother, how did you end up like this?(2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The two of them quickly came to an agreement and turned around to call for help.","However, before they could shout, a part of the cavalry from earlier rushed","over from the other end of the street.","Furthermore, they weren’t at a loss like Huang Yueli and Li Moying as they didn’t even stop and directly rushed towards a corner of the road.","The leader of the team laughed coldly as he said loudly,” Liu Buyan, why aren’t you scram out? I know you’re inside! Stop hiding!”","A row of beggar-like sinners sat in the corner. Ordinary people could not tell the difference between them.","But with Captain’s hint, Huang Yueli recognised Liu Buyan as her brows raised slightly.","Liu Buyan himself remained motionless, pretending to be a beggar.","The captain sneered again,” Liu Buyan, stop pretending. To tell you the truth, you’ve come into contact with our Miss Qing Ling and you already have her aura on your body. Our Black Tortoise Race has a special method to track the aura of our clansmen so I’m sure that you’re among these few people!”","“If you know what’s good for you, come out yourself. Otherwise, I can capture all of you! Anyway, I’m just killing a few more sinners. No one can punish me...’","Before he could finish his sentence, Liu Buyan stood up straight away.","“Wait, I’ll go with you. Don’t hurt these ordinary people.”","His face was still covered with the dirty black mud he had smeared on his face during his disguise. However, when he stood up, his tall and slender figure, elegant and outstanding temperament, and his calm and collected manner of speaking all showed that he was different from the rest.","The civilians who were watching by the side were in an uproar.","When the Black Tortoise Race’s captain saw Liu Buyan, his expression didn’t look good.","He flipped down from his horse and walked in front of Liu Buyan in a few steps as he stretched out his hand to grab him, ” You stinking brat, I’m letting you escape! If you have the ability, then run! You ruined Miss Qing Ling’s innocence and still want to escape? You’re simply courting death!”","When Liu Buyan was talking to Captain, he was actually observing the surrounding situation.","The moment the captain approached, he suddenly dodged. Taking advantage of the moment when the captain was distracted, he suddenly turned his body sideways, wanting to go around him.","Unfortunately, there were too many people on the streets.","Liu Buyan wasn’t willing to harm the civilians so he was stopped after running a few steps and his speed slowed down.","The Black Tortoise Race’s captain quickly regained his senses and was even more flustered and exasperated.” Damn it, this kid actually still wants to escape. Hurry up and capture him!”","A group of Black Tortoise Race practitioners immediately swarmed forward and surrounded Liu Buyan.","Among these Black Tortoise Clan practitioners, the lowest cultivation was at","Heart Profound Realm Middle Phase and they were obviously the more elite existences in the clan. Comparatively speaking, Liu Buyan had just ascended from the lower realm for a few years and he didn’t have such heaven defying innate talent like Huang Yueli and Li Moying so his cultivation was limited and the difference in their abilities was huge.","He, Liu Buyan, didn’t even struggle twice before he was directly flipped onto the ground.","“You actually dare to escape! Damn brat, show him what you’ve got!”","With the captain’s order, all the team members couldn’t wait to respond as they swung their fists towards Liu Buyan.","Liu Buyan closed his eyes in despair, knowing that he was completely done for today.","He did not expect that after hiding for so long, he was still found by these people in the end!","Based on the things he had committed and the usual style of the Protoss, he was definitely dead this time!"]},{"number":4693,"title":"Chapter 4693: Senior Brother, how did you end up like this?(3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4693: Senior Brother, how did you end up like this?(3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","If he was beaten to death, he would be lucky.","In actual fact, Liu Buyan was very clear that these Black Turtle Race practitioners absolutely wouldn’t let him die so easily and would definitely torture him ruthlessly!","Liu Buyan emptied his thoughts as he gritted his teeth and waited for the torture to arrive.","However, what he did not expect was that after waiting for a while, he did not feel any pain. Instead, he heard a cold female voice not far away.","This voice sounded a little familiar.","Not waiting for Liu Buyan to figure it out, a powerful Profound Energy blasted towards him.","The Black Tortoise Race martial artists around him were all caught off guard and bounced off.","Even the leader of the team was not spared and he was the most unlucky one. As he was bending over, the Profound Energy suddenly struck his buttocks and he immediately fell to the ground with a thud, falling flat on his face.","The people present were shocked by this turn of events and cried out in surprise.","When the captain fell to the ground, he was stunned.","It was only when he heard the discussions of the surrounding civilians that he suddenly realized what had happened. He quickly got up from the ground and looked behind him.","They saw a young man and woman of the God Clan holding hands as they walked over from the end of the road.","The two of them looked very young and obviously underage. However, judging from the aura on their bodies, their cultivation should not be low.","“All of you...Who is it?” The captain could not help but frown.","The team members also reacted as they all raised their weapons and looked at Huang Yueli and the rest warily.","“Who are you? Were you the ones who hit him just now?”","“Where did this little girl and little brat come from? How dare they hit our","Black Tortoise Race’s people? Do you want to die?”","“Hurry up and get lost!”","These people looked fiendish but Huang Yueli’s expression remained indifferent as she held her husband’s hand, her footsteps neither fast nor slow. It took her quite a while before she walked over from the other end of the street.","Huang Yueli stood in front of the captain and said coldly,” Release this person!”","The warriors of the Black Tortoise Clan were stunned. They did not expect that this little girl would not be afraid at all when she saw so many powerful adult warriors. Instead, she dared to speak to them with such an arrogant attitude.","Then, the captain couldn’t help but laugh out loud.” Hahaha, which family are you from? Wasn’t he too bold? Even our Black Tortoise Clan has to interfere in our clan’s internal affairs? Hurry up and bring your little lover home to drink milk!”","“That’s right. Where did this little girl come from? How dare she speak to our captain like this? Why didn’t she go out and ask about our captain’s name?” “This is ridiculous! Are all little ghosts nowadays so bold?”","“Aiyo, I’m dying of laughter! Do they still think that they’re helping out when they see injustice on the road?”","These Protoss warriors all laughed so hard that they could not straighten their backs.","After all, Huang Yueli and Li Moying looked too young and furthermore, they had changed their appearances so others couldn’t see through their true identities so they didn’t expect that the dignified Sacred Phoenix Clan’s","Patriarch and Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Young Lord would appear in such a slum.","In fact, if it wasn’t for the sake of pursuing Liu Buyan, these elites from their clans wouldn’t have appeared in such a filthy place.."]},{"number":4694,"title":"Chapter 4694: Senior Brother, how did you end up like this?(4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4694: Senior Brother, how did you end up like this?(4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","From their point of view, Huang Yueli and Li Moying were just two young practitioners who had been protected too well by their own clan. Perhaps their innate talent wasn’t bad and they had been cultivating in their clan since young so they didn’t know anything which was why they did such a ridiculous thing and actually dared to stop them.","The captain of the Black Tortoise Race laughed so hard that he almost choked. After he finally finished laughing, he straightened his back and waved at the two of them.","“Alright, you two brats, hurry up and leave! Seeing that you’re still young, I can’t be bothered to argue with you. Hurry up and bring your little lover home to drink milk! Remember to mind your own business in the future. Otherwise, you won’t even know how you died outside!”","As the captain spoke, he released a portion of the pressure in his body.","As a Late Heart Profound Realm martial artist, he was considered a rather outstanding martial artist in the clan. He had over ten people under him, and could be considered a person with a reputation.","He intended to show these two young martial artists his strength and make them retreat.","However, he did not expect that after he released his pressure, the man and woman in front of him did not seem to feel anything at all. Not to mention being suppressed by his pressure until they could not breathe, their expressions did not even change.","“Tsk, you two brats seem to be quite talented. No wonder she was spoiled by her family and didn’t know anything! Since that’s the case, I’ll teach you on behalf of your family elders and let you know what kind of people you can’t offend outside!”","As the captain spoke, he further released his pressure.","But even so, Huang Yueli and Li Moying still didn’t have any reaction.","The captain didn’t believe it and released it again.","Release again.","Release again.","He had already completely released all the Profound Energy in his body but the couple in front of him was still standing calmly in front of him. Even the girl’s face had an obvious look of impatience.","“Alright, what the hell are you doing? Didn’t you hear me?” Huang Yueli said impatiently.","When the captain heard her speak, he almost couldn’t hold his breath. Coupled with the lack of Profound Energy in his body, he almost fell to the ground. This, this... What was going on?","He was a Late Heart Profound Realm martial artist, yet he couldn’t suppress these two brats?","Huang Yueli saw that he didn’t make a sound and her patience ran out so she directly went forward to pull Liu Buyan who was lying on the ground.","“Senior Brother, how are you? Can he still move? If you can still move, get up quickly and follow us!”","When Liu Buyan heard Huang Yueli’s words, he had already guessed the identity of this young couple but he didn’t dare to believe that Huang Yueli and Li Moying who had eloped and left the Gods Race’s territory for many days would suddenly appear here so he wasn’t sure.","Now that he heard Huang Yueli call him ‘Senior Apprentice’, Liu Buyan recovered his senses and was extremely excited.","“Mas...Junior Sister, it really is you!”","Huang Yueli patted his shoulder and couldn’t help but ridicule,” Who else could it be if not me? Senior Brother, ah, Senior Brother, it’s only been a few months since we last met, and you’ve become like this. You’re actually being pressed to the ground and rubbed against. You’re too embarrassing for your junior sister!”","Although Huang Yueli’s words were filled with disdain, but Liu Buyan was still filled with the feeling of having survived a calamity and almost burst into tears.","No matter how big the trouble was, as long as his junior sister came, she would definitely be able to settle it.."]},{"number":4695,"title":"Chapter 4695: Senior Brother, how did you end up like this?(5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4695: Senior Brother, how did you end up like this?(5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Junior sister, let me tell you...”","He hurriedly wanted to explain to Huang Yueli what had happened.","However, Huang Yueli stopped him,” Let’s talk about it later. Let’s leave this place first.”","With so many pairs of eyes on the street, she had no interest in becoming the subject of gossip.","Furthermore, Huang Yueli understood her own Senior Brother and knew that although Liu Buyan’s character seemed to be frivolous, he was actually very confident in his heart. To be honest, he was much more reliable than her and Li Moying.","In her previous life, every time she and Li Moying were impulsive and wanted to take a risk, it was always Liu Buyan who blocked them in front.","Therefore, according to common sense, her senior brother should not have provoked such a powerful enemy. There must be something very important going on...","Liu Buyan also understood and immediately used his arm to support himself on the ground as he gritted his teeth and crawled up.","When the Black Tortoise Race martial artists swarmed him just now, he was still injured. However, they were basically superficial wounds. They were not very serious. It was just a little painful.","“Let’s go.” Huang Yueli hurriedly said.","Saying that, he stretched out his hand to pull Liu Buyan.","However, before she could touch Liu Buyan’s hand, her wrist was grabbed by a huge hand.","‘ Liu Buyan won’t die so easily, suffering such a small injury and he can’t even walk? Don’t be fooled by him!” Li Moying gave a cold humph in annoyance as he tightly held onto his wifey’s small hand as he turned around to glare at Liu","Buyan,” Hurry up and leave!”","Liu Buyan was speechless.","He had already said a few hundred times that he no longer had any thoughts towards his Junior Sister who had been married for many years but Li Moying was always on guard against him like a thief.","Looking at Li Moying’s gaze, he simply wished that he could just throw him here and leave!","Thinking up to here, Liu Buyan quivered and even forgot about the pain from the wounds on his body as he hurriedly walked behind the two of them.","At this moment, a stern shout was heard.” Stop! Stop right there! You three damned thieves, where are you going?”","The Black Tortoise Clan’s captain who had been shocked by Huang Yueli’s actions earlier suddenly woke up. When he saw that the two of them were about to leave, he hurriedly shouted: ” Quick! Stop them!” Capture these two thieves together. None of them can escape! That wretched girl called that brat surnamed Liu Senior Brother. They were obviously in cahoots, accomplices!","Hurry up and catch them. The elders are still waiting!”","The other team members seemed to have woken up from a dream and quickly surrounded the three of them.","Huang Yueli narrowed her eyes slightly as a cold glint flashed in her eyes but she didn’t feel any nervousness.","It was just a group of Heart Profound Realm practitioners and even if they were the elites from the large clans of the Gods Race, in her and Li Moying’s eyes, they were just a motley crew.","She turned to look in the captain’s direction and said coldly,”Who said we were going to run?” We are leaving openly! My senior brother is a noble spirit herb master and has never done anything bad. What right do you have to use the power of your family to capture him here?”","” A noble spirit herb master?!” The captain heard this and laughed coldly as if he had heard a joke. The things that this brat did were really despicable to the extreme! It’s as if our Black Tortoise Race doesn’t exist! Stop talking nonsense here. We must bring this brat back today!”","When Huang Yueli heard that, she couldn’t help being startled as she subconsciously turned her head to look at Liu Buyan.."]},{"number":4696,"title":"Chapter 4696: Senior Brother, how did you end up like this?(6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4696: Senior Brother, how did you end up like this?(6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Although she had also thought that Liu Buyan might have stirred up trouble, but she had not expected that the other party would say that Liu Buyan was despicable and despicable.","What did he do?","Before Huang Yueli could figure it out, the Captain couldn’t wait any longer as he brought his men to chase after her in exasperation.","Huang Yueli turned her head to look at Li Moying,” Husband, bring Senior","Brother and leave first. I’ll cover the rear here.”","If they wanted to escape, the greatest difficulty was none other than Liu Buyan’s speed.","Earlier when Liu Buyan was almost caught, he sprained his ankle and he couldn’t use his movement Profound Skill so if he were to run, he definitely wouldn’t be able to outrun the Black Tortoise Race’s practitioners and could only get someone to drag him along.","Li Moying frowned slightly as he wanted to say that he would cover the rear.","But this way, wouldn’t his little fox be holding hands with Liu Buyan? That was worse than killing him!","Thinking up to here, he didn’t act pretentious anymore as he grabbed onto Liu Buyan’s shirt and forcefully pulled him along as he ran out of the crowd.","As for Huang Yueli who was left behind by him, Li Moying wasn’t worried at all.","Such a group of Heart Profound Realm martial artists was not even enough for his wife to poke with a finger!","Li Moying brought along Liu Buyan as he suddenly sped up, his figure was like a bolt of lightning as he shot out.","This astonishing speed made the expressions of the Black Tortoise Race’s martial artists change.","The captain roared, “Chase! Quickly chase after him! We spent so much time to find this brat. We can’t let him escape. Otherwise, how are we going to explain it to the elders? Hurry up and chase!”","Actually, even without him saying anything, the team members had already rushed forward without caring about anything else.","However, before they could take a few steps, a petite figure suddenly appeared in front of them, blocking their way.","“You guys should stay here! Don’t chase after him. Don’t even think about touching a hair on the person I want to protect!”","Huang Yueli stood in the middle of the road and in front of the ten over Heart Profound Realm adult males, a delicate and beautiful girl like her really looked too tiny, as though the other party could seriously injure her with a single move.","Seeing this scene, the surrounding passersby broke out in a cold sweat for her.","At the same time, there were also some people who were secretly despising Liu Buyan and Li Moying who were the first to escape.","The two young men just now looked decent and outstanding. However, they did not expect their character to be so bad. They actually ran away first when something happened, leaving such a weak junior sister behind...He was simply a beast!","However, at this moment, a shocking scene appeared.","Just as the Black Tortoise Race’s practitioners were rushing over, when they were still a few meters away from Huang Yueli, her figure suddenly swayed.","Everyone only saw a shadow flash past. When they looked over again, the petite girl’s figure was no longer in front of them. “Whoosh...What happened?”","“Where is he? Where did he go? Why did it disappear?”","The Black Tortoise warriors were even more surprised than the passers-by.","They had originally wanted to swarm forward and grab hold of Huang Yueli but who knew that after pouncing on her, they ended up empty-handed.","Just as they were at a loss, a powerful pressure suddenly came from behind them. The Heaven and Earth Xuan Qi that blotted out the sky and covered the earth pressed down on their heads.","“Not good, behind! That wretched girl is behind us!”","The captain was the first to react. He hurriedly shouted and turned around, wanting to block this attack that came out of nowhere.."]},{"number":4697,"title":"Chapter 4697: Senior Brother, how did you end up like this?(7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4697: Senior Brother, how did you end up like this?(7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Unfortunately, it was too late for him to realize that something was wrong.","Even though he turned around at the first moment and tried his best to mobilize the Profound Energy in his body to form a protective armor on his body, but he was still unable to completely block Huang Yueli’s peerless powerful attack.","The Black Tortoise Race captain was hit in the chest by this attack. His body instantly flew back and he spat out a mouthful of blood on the spot.","He was the one with the highest cultivation among all of them. If that was the case, there was no need to mention the others.","Most of the team members had not even reacted to the fact that Huang Yueli was behind them and had already been struck by the attack, so they were struck without any warning.","Because they were hit in the back, the team members fell to the ground head-first. They fell flat on their faces, and their faces hit the mud directly, creating human-shaped pits on the ground.","The roads in the slums had not been specially repaired. They were still primitive mud roads. These martial artists had their mouths stuffed with mud. The blood that was about to come out of their mouths was blocked by the mud again.","For a moment, mud and dirty blood mixed together, and his mouth was filled with a strange taste. That sour feeling...Don’t mention it!","The surrounding onlookers were also completely stunned by this scene.","Moreover, most of them were sinners living in the slums and had limited knowledge. They had never seen such shocking cultivation and attacks! The entire road instantly became silent. The passers-by did not even dare to breathe loudly, afraid that the young female expert would be angered by someone’s voice and vent her anger on them.","However, reality proved that they were definitely overthinking.","After Huang Yueli knocked down these practitioners with a single blow, she had no intention of staying here any longer.","She jumped up and snorted in mid-air. I told you to stop chasing! Why did he have to rush up and ask for a beating? You guys can rest here. We’ll take our leave first!”","She drifted back dozens of meters with the wind and jumped over the crowd. After landing, she went to chase after her husband and senior brother.","Everyone present looked at her in a daze, unable to come back to their senses for a long time.","After quite a while, the Black Tortoise Clan’s captain clutched his chest and crawled up from the ground. Raising his head to look in the direction Huang Yueli had left in, his eyes were filled with shock.","He had never thought that such a delicate girl could actually have such strength. With one attack, she could injure all of them!","The main reason why she could do this was because she had attacked suddenly and caught them off guard. In addition, they had underestimated their enemies and were unprepared.","However, to be able to do this, this girl must be at least at the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm. Even in the Shen clan, she would be an expert among the direct descendants. She should be a Heaven Grade genius.","‘ Who is this little girl?!”","He had totally not expected that this girl was Sacred Phoenix Race’s Clan Leader Huang Yueli.","Because for a person of Huang Yueli’s status to appear in Xue Hua City, unless the City Lord personally accompanied her, how could she possibly wander around the slums by herself?","The captain was shocked. He turned around and found that his subordinates were still lying on the ground. He was even angrier. He immediately walked over and raised his leg to kick their butts.","“Get up, get up! Why was he lying on the ground? The face of our Black","Tortoise Race has been completely thrown away by you trash!”"]},{"number":4698,"title":"Chapter 4698: Senior Brother, why are you in such a miserable state? (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4698: Senior Brother, why are you in such a miserable state? (8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Even though the Captain was flustered and exasperated and even kicked them directly, these Black Tortoise Clan cultivators were still lying on the ground, moaning and not getting up.","The Captain was about to explode with anger.” Do you think mud tastes good lying on the ground?” he said angrily. What? Was it not embarrassing enough?","Quickly get up!”","Didn’t you hear the laughter coming from the crowd?","Although these sinners were obviously afraid of them, so they suppressed their laughter, he could still hear it clearly!","As soon as he finished speaking, the sound of vomiting came from the scene.","The Captain frowned and looked down. He was so angry that he almost fainted. Only then did he know why these team members were not talking.","It turned out that their mouths were filled with mud. In order to speak, they could only spit it out. Some unlucky guys even spat out their teeth.","This scene was simply too ugly.","As a dignified ancient god clan warrior, and an elite team in the family, he was actually beaten to such a state by a petite and delicate little girl!","What was even more embarrassing was that so many sinners had seen it.","The Captain’s expression was extremely ugly. He shouted angrily and chased away the surrounding sinners.” What are you all looking at? Is this something you can see? Hurry up and get lost! Get lost, all of you! If anyone dares to stay on this street again, don’t blame me for being rude!”","As the Captain spoke, he picked up a steel knife that had fallen to the ground and waved it in the direction of the crowd.","A dazzling cold light flashed. Coupled with the pressure emitted from the Captain’s body, it was enough to shock these ordinary people.","The crowd did not dare to continue watching the show. They were as silent as cicadas in winter and ran away in a hurry.","Seeing that the street had returned to silence, the Captain’s expression became a little better. However, when he turned around, he saw that his subordinates were all covered in dirt, as if they had just been pressed to the ground and rubbed. The anger in his heart rose again.","“Trash! What’s the use of having you guys? No matter what, they were all Heart Profound Realm cultivators. There were so many of them, yet they couldn’t defeat a little girl? Look at you, you’re even worse than the beggars on the street!”","When the Black Tortoise Clan cultivators heard this, they were unwilling. They thought to themselves, Captain, you’re not any better than us. Didn’t you also get beaten up by that little girl? You even vomited blood! How can you talk about us?","However, they knew that their Captain was in a fit of anger. No one dared to add fuel to the fire. They were all as quiet as chickens, lowering their heads and not daring to say a word.","The Captain scolded for a while before his anger subsided a little and he finally calmed down.","“This little girl is really too strange. I actually couldn’t tell which family she was from just now! What about you guys? Did any of you see her attack? What kind of Profound Energy did she use?”","Hearing this question, all the cultivators looked at each other in dismay.","“This... It seemed to be... Fire attribute?”","“No way! I think the move I was hit by just now seems to be of the lightning attribute?”","“No, no, I think it’s the wind attribute! That lass is from the White Tiger Race, right?”","Everyone gave different answers!","The Captain felt the veins on his forehead popping out, but he couldn’t say anything.","After all, he couldn’t tell the exact attributes of the little girl!","The little girl’s attack was too fast.. He did not even have time to react before he was knocked down!"]},{"number":4699,"title":"Chapter 4699: Senior Brother, why are you in such a miserable state?(9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4699: Senior Brother, why are you in such a miserable state?(9)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","If word of this got out, it would be extremely embarrassing.","They were the elite team of the Black Tortoise Clan. There were over ten Heart Profound Realm cultivators, but they were beaten up by the little girl. They did not even see how the other party attacked...","“That damned brat. We were all bewitched by her. We underestimated the enemy this time, so she took advantage of the situation! The next time we see her, everyone must get back at her!”","Hearing this, the team members nodded their heads vigorously.","In fact, they still felt that it was impossible for a little girl to be stronger than all of them combined. She must have used some kind of magic treasure to erupt with such powerful strength.","Now that they were prepared, they would not be afraid of that little girl if they met again in the future.","Everyone spent a lot of effort to clean themselves up.","“Let’s go, let’s leave this place first! This street...l can’t come here again! This person has been thrown into the slums!” The Captain snorted and was about to leave.","At this moment, someone remembered their mission this time and asked carefully, “Captain, then we... What about our mission? Could it be that... Just let it go? It wasn’t easy for us to catch up to that Liu kid, could it be that...We let him escape just like that?”","“Bah! How was this possible? That kid dared to lay his hands on Young Miss Qingling and even kidnapped her. The clan leader had already given a strict order to capture him and cut him into pieces. It would be useless even if he escaped to the ends of the earth! Don’t worry, we can find him once, so we’ll definitely find him a second time!”","The secret technique of finding people through the aura of the clansmen was a unique secret technique of the Black Tortoise Clan. It was impossible to crack.","So Captain wasn’t worried that Liu Buyan would disappear.","“But, Captain, even if... Even if we find Liu Buyan again, he...He had someone protecting him, right? That man and woman just now don’t seem to have weak cultivation...","“Yeah, those two are not easy to deal with. I think that young man’s strength is even higher than the little girl’s! If we join forces, we might really be in trouble.”","“I can see that the movement techniques of the two of them are extremely outstanding. Even if we can find them, we can still defeat them. However, if the few of them want to escape, we really do not have the confidence to catch up..","Everyone was discussing at once, feeling that the situation was not good. Huang Yueli had knocked everyone down with a single strike earlier and it could be said that she had borrowed the advantage of sneak attacks and magical treasures but the movement technique that she and Li Moying had displayed when they left earlier was real!","Honestly speaking, many Dao Profound Realm powerhouses might not even be as good as the two of them.","Especially Li Moying, he was able to grab a big man like Liu Buyan and still move so quickly. If he didn’t see it with his own eyes, who would believe it?","When the Captain heard these words, he also realized the seriousness of the matter and immediately frowned.","“Damn it, isn’t this brat just a little Spirit Medicine Master who ascended from the lower realm? This talent was simply not ranked in the Divine Realm. He could only be considered an expert among the human race. With someone like him, how could he be a Senior Brother of a Heaven Grade genius? Are you kidding me?”","The team members thought about it carefully, and someone could not help but think too much.” Captain, this.... Does this mean that this Liu kid has some background? Speaking of which, I seem to have heard his name somewhere before..."]},{"number":4700,"title":"Chapter 4700: A Very Intriguing Story (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4700: A Very Intriguing Story (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Bah! He’s just a human with mixed blood that has ascended from the lower realm. What background could he have? He only has half of the blood of the Ancient God Clan, as long as he’s not a direct descendant of a large family clan, there is nothing to fear! Based on the crimes he has committed, no matter what, our Black Tortoise Clan is in the right! Who can protect him?” The Captain sneered and interrupted his subordinate.","The person who spoke earlier replied softly,” But his Junior Sister is so formidable so who knows if Liu Buyan has secretly acknowledged some formidable Master...","“Hahaha, what a powerful master...Are you trying to kill me with laughter? Why don’t you take a look at his cultivation talent? Who would take him as a disciple?” The Captain couldn’t help but laugh. After a while, he stopped and said,” No matter what background he has, you don’t have to worry. To tell you the truth, I just received a message from my family. Divine General Xuan will arrive in Snowflake City in a few days.”","“Divine General Xuan? Which Divine General Xuan?”","“Which other Divine General? Isn’t there the one and only Divine General in our clan, Senior Xuan Jiuling of Blessed City?”","“Senior Xuan Jiuling is coming to Snowflake City! ”","Everyone was excited as exclamations were heard all around.","The Captain also revealed a smile.” That’s right. Since Divine General Xuan is here, we can ask him for help. No matter what background this Liu brat has, he can forget about farting in front of Divine General Xuan! Our Divine General Xuan has just defeated the Devil Army and made a great contribution to the entire God Realm! So what if he really had a powerful master? Do you dare to go against Divine General Xuan?”","“That’s great. With Divine General Xuan around, there will definitely be no mistakes...”","Everyone was relieved.","“Let’s go, let’s leave this place first!”","Following the Captain’s order, the Black Tortoise Clan’s cultivators all flew up. They covered their faces with their hands and ran along the street.","On the other side, Huang Yueli was afraid of being followed by the Black Tortoise Clan so she took a detour and returned to the inn.","Li Moying and Liu Buyan had already arrived at the inn and were waiting for her in the room.","The moment Huang Yueli entered the door, Liu Buyan leaped up from his seat and came up to welcome her,” Junior Sister, you’re finally back. I was very worried earlier. You alone dealt with so many Black Tortoise Clan cultivators, you wouldn’t be injured right? They were all experts in the Profound Heart Realm. Ughhh!”","Liu Buyan’s words were halfway through when he suddenly felt a burst of pain on his ankle as his body suddenly fell forward.","If he hadn’t reacted quickly, he would have fallen on his face and broken his nose bridge on the spot.","Liu Buyan’s expression changed in shock but luckily he managed to stabilize his body in time and hurriedly turned back to take a look, just in time to see Li Moying pulling his leg back in an unhurried manner.","“You... Li Moying! What are you doing?”","Li Moying’s face still had a cold and aloof expression as he lifted the teacup with one hand and lifted the lid with the other as he blew into the cup. After taking a sip of tea, he turned his gaze towards him and said slowly,” Oh, sorry, I seemed to have accidentally tripped you earlier? I’m really sorry. I didn’t expect you to suddenly stand up. By the way, didn’t you sprain your ankle when you were pressed to the ground? Look, this fall wouldn’t have made it more serious, right?”","“You...!”","Careless? Don’t think that he didn’t know that this guy did it on purpose!","Wasn’t it just that he wanted to greet Huang Yueli and somehow, he had turned over the vinegar jar?","Not only did he trip him on purpose, but he even brought up the embarrassing thing he did just now and repeated it again, afraid that his Junior Sister would forget!"]}]);
